window.GEAR_BOOK_CONTENTS["book-11"] = [{"id":1,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第九章：把環保帶回家\n\n「追查排水溝」任務展開的第一個星期，溜溜交出了第一份調查報告。\n\n「嗶嗶！報告！」溜溜攤開一張畫滿記號的地圖，電子眼裡跳動著數據，「經過七天的偵察，我發現：學校後方那條排水溝的異味，不是從學校附近開始的——它來自更遠的上游！我沿著水溝往上飛了三公里，味道最重的地方，在那邊！」\n\n溜溜用尾巴在地圖上畫了一個大大的圈。\n\n「那邊……」晴晴湊近一看，皺起眉頭，「好像是工業區的方向？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞走過來，看著那張地圖，輕輕說，「不過，光靠我們幾個人的力量，還不足以把整條排水溝查清楚。而且……」\n\n她頓了頓，目光掃過全班：「污染，其實不只在那一條排水溝裡。」\n\n「不在排水溝？」阿釁疑惑地問，「那在哪裡？」\n\n「在我們每天的生活裡。」未晞說，「每一個人丟掉的塑膠袋、洗掉的清潔劑、用掉的寶特瓶，最後都會順著水溝、流進河裡、流進海裡。那一條排水溝的臭味，是我們全部人，一點一點『貢獻』出來的。」\n\n教室裡，安靜了一下。\n\n「所以，」晴晴站起來，大聲宣布，「『守護地球大作戰』的下一場行動，不在學校——在我們每個人的家裡！」\n\n「家裡？」孩子們面面相覷。\n\n「對！」晴晴說，「我們要把『大作戰』，帶回家！從今天開始，每個人回家之後，都要發動自己的爸爸媽媽、爺爺奶奶，跟我們一起：垃圾分類、省電節能、減少塑膠！」\n\n「這……這也太難了吧！」阿釁哀嚎，「我爸連自己的襪子都懶得分類！」\n\n「所以才要你們出馬！」晴晴雙手叉腰，「你們可是『守護地球作戰部隊』的隊員！戰場從教室，延伸到每個人的家！這叫——『把環保帶回家』！」\n\n「好——！」孩子們齊聲高喊。\n\n於是，第二天開始，六年一班的二十六個孩子，各自展開了一場「家庭大作戰」。\n\n第一個潰敗的，是阿釁家。\n\n「爸！你怎麼又買塑膠袋了！」阿釁站在家門口，雙手叉腰，像個小警察，「我們不是說好要自備購物袋嗎？」\n\n「啊？那兩個塑膠袋才兩塊錢！」阿釁爸爸拎著菜籃，滿臉困惑，「你什麼時候變成環保糾察隊了？」\n\n「從今天開始！」阿釁理直氣壯，「我們班在執行『守護地球大作戰』！塑膠袋用一個少一個，丟到海裡一百年都不會消失！」\n\n「一百年？」爸爸皺起眉頭，「那我用了一輩子的塑膠袋，豈不是要堆成一座山？」\n\n「所以你更要少用啊！」阿釁大叫，「爸！你要支持我！我可是『植樹認養突擊隊』的組長！」\n\n「好好好，支持支持！」爸爸無奈地搖搖頭，「那你說，塑膠袋不用，用什麼裝菜？」\n\n「用這個！」阿釁變魔術似的，從背後掏出一疊折得整整齊齊的環保購物袋，「我在學校用零用錢買了五個！一人一個！」\n\n「……」爸爸看著那疊購物袋，沉默了兩秒，「……你連這個都準備好了？」\n\n「我可是做足了功課！」阿釁得意地挺起胸膛。\n\n那天晚上，阿釁家的餐桌上，第一次沒有出現塑膠袋。\n\n而老巫家，則是另一種畫風。\n\n「媽！從今天開始，我們家的垃圾，我來分！」老巫捲起袖子，豪氣干雲，「廚餘放這個桶！回收放那個袋！一般垃圾放垃圾桶！」\n\n「你？」老巫媽媽瞪大眼睛，伸手摸了摸兒子的額頭，「你沒發燒吧？你平常連襪子都亂丟，現在要分類垃圾？」\n\n「士別三日，刮目相看！」老巫驕傲地仰起頭，「我可是『午餐零浪費突擊隊』的組長！我們班連全校的剩食都能管好，家裡這點垃圾算什麼！」\n\n「好好好，」媽媽笑得合不攏嘴，「那我倒要看看，你能分幾天！」\n\n「一輩子！」老巫大聲宣布。\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」媽媽笑得眼淚都出來了。\n\n而林芸芸家，就沒有那麼順利了。\n\n「芸芸，妳又在做什麼？」林芸芸的媽媽看著蹲在陽台、把舊報紙一張一張折好的女兒，皺起眉頭。\n\n「我在整理回收。」林芸芸小聲說，「我們班在執行『守護地球大作戰』，老師說……不對，同學說，要從家裡開始。」\n\n「什麼大作戰？」媽媽的語氣裡帶著不耐煩，「妳的功課寫完了嗎？下星期不是要月考了？整天搞這些有的沒的，成績退步了怎麼辦？」\n\n「我……我功課有寫完……」林芸芸低下頭，聲音越來越小。\n\n「寫完就去複習！」媽媽嘆了一口氣，「環保這種事，是大人該管的事，妳一個小孩子，管那麼多做什麼？」\n\n林芸芸沒有再說話。\n\n她默默地把折好的報紙放進回收袋裡，回到書桌前，打開課本。\n\n可是，她的眼睛，卻一直偷偷地，往陽台那袋回收物看去。\n\n同樣的情形，也發生在尪伝恺家。\n\n「阿恺，你奶奶說，你叫她把廚餘分開？」尪伝恺的媽媽端著飯碗，疑惑地問。\n\n「對啊！」尪伝恺點頭，「廚餘可以拿去堆肥，種菜！不然跟垃圾一起燒，會產生很多髒空氣！」\n\n「你一個小學生，管這些做什麼？」奶奶在旁邊插嘴，「以前我們都沒分，垃圾車還不是照樣來收！」\n\n「可是奶奶，」尪伝恺難得認真地說，「以前的人，沒有那麼多垃圾啊。現在一個人一天丟的垃圾，比以前一家人一個月丟的還要多！如果我們不分，垃圾就真的沒有地方去了。」\n\n奶奶愣了一下，看了孫子一眼，沒再多說什麼。\n\n但那天晚上，尪伝恺發現，奶奶悄悄地把廚餘，倒進了另一個桶子裡。\n\n而最慘烈的戰場，是晴晴家。\n\n「爸爸！你那個廢機油，不能直接倒進水溝啦！」晴晴衝出家門，一把拉住正要倒油的爸爸。\n\n「啊？」爸爸拎著黑漆漆的機油桶，滿臉問號，「不倒水溝倒哪裡？一直以來都是這樣倒的啊！」\n\n「一直以來都這樣，不代表是對的！」晴晴急得跳腳，「廢機油倒進水溝，會流進河裡、流進海裡，污染水源！新聞都有報！」\n\n「新聞？」爸爸愣住，「你什麼時候開始看新聞了？」\n\n「從……從認識一個朋友開始！」晴晴說，「總之，廢機油要收集起來，拿去專門的回收點！爸爸，你修了二十年車，一定知道哪裡有收廢機油吧？」\n\n「知道是知道……」爸爸摸了摸後腦勺，「可是這樣很麻煩耶。」\n\n「爸爸！」晴晴雙手叉腰，使出殺手鐧，「你女兒我，可是『守護地球作戰部隊』的『作戰總指揮』！你總不希望，你女兒的部隊，第一個失守的戰場，就是自己家吧！」\n\n「……」爸爸沉默了三秒鐘，然後笑了，「好好好，總指揮大人！廢機油，我以後都收集起來，拿去回收！」\n\n「這才是我的好爸爸！」晴晴滿意地笑了。\n\n然而，不是每個家庭，都像晴晴家這樣「順利攻陷」。\n\n一個星期後，晴晴的媽媽，神色凝重地，把一張手機截圖，遞到晴晴面前。\n\n「小晴，」媽媽的聲音裡帶著擔憂，「你們班的班級群組裡……有個家長在抱怨你們。」\n\n晴晴接過手機一看——\n\n班級群組裡，一條訊息，靜靜地躺在群組最上方：\n\n「各位家長好，我是柯志遠的媽媽。我想請問，六年一班的『守護地球大作戰』，到底是什麼活動？我們家志遠，這兩個禮拜回家，整天都在搞什麼垃圾分類、省電、種樹，作業隨便寫一寫就跑去陽台看他的樹！我想問，這到底是學校規定的活動，還是哪個老師、哪個學生『自己發明』的？」\n\n訊息下面，跟著幾則附和：\n\n「我們家小孩也是耶！說要『把環保帶回家』，結果整天在家裡碎碎唸！」\n\n「對啊，月考快到了，這不是耽誤課業嗎？」\n\n「小孩子搞環保，不就是玩嗎？老師怎麼不管管？」\n\n晴晴看著那些訊息，臉色，一點一點地沉了下去。\n\n「媽……」她低下頭，聲音乾澀，「這些家長……他們是不是覺得，我們做這些事，是錯的？」\n\n「小晴，」媽媽蹲下來，輕輕摸了摸她的頭，「你們做的事情，媽覺得沒有錯。可是，大人有大人擔心的事。你們整天忙這些，功課有沒有顧好，他們當然會擔心。」\n\n「可是我們功課也有顧好啊！」晴晴的聲音帶著委屈，「我們班上學期的成績，還進步了！為什麼他們不看這個，只看我們『整天搞環保』？」\n\n「因為……」媽媽嘆了一口氣，「大人總是只看見，他們擔心的那一面。」\n\n那天晚上，晴晴失眠了。\n\n她躺在床上，翻來覆去，怎麼也睡不著。\n\n腦海裡，一直迴盪著群組裡那些家長的話：\n\n「整天在家裡碎碎唸……」\n\n「這不是耽誤課業嗎？」\n\n「小孩子搞環保，不就是玩嗎？」\n\n她輕輕爬起來，走到窗邊，看著遠處那五根在夜色裡隱隱發光的煙囪。\n\n「我們……真的做錯了嗎？」她低聲問。\n\n第二天一早，晴晴頂著兩個黑眼圈，走進教室。\n\n「晴晴，妳怎麼了？」未晞一眼就發現了她的異樣，「妳看起來，好像沒睡好。」\n\n「未晞……」晴晴猶豫了一下，把手機遞給她，「你看看這個。」\n\n未晞接過手機，靜靜地，把群組裡那些訊息，一條一條看完。\n\n然後，她放下手機，輕輕說了一句：\n\n「他們說的，不是沒有道理。」\n\n「什麼？！」晴晴瞪大眼睛。\n\n「大人會擔心課業，是因為他們覺得，『環保』跟『唸書』是兩件不相干的事。」未晞的聲音依然很輕，「可是我們都知道，它們其實是同一件事——保護地球，就是保護我們唸書的地方、長大的地方。」\n\n「那我們要怎麼讓大人知道？」晴晴問。\n\n未晞想了想，說：「大人不相信『嘴巴說的話』，可是他們會相信『眼睛看到的東西』。與其跟他們爭論，不如……讓他們親眼看看。」\n\n「親眼看看？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「我們辦一個活動吧。邀請爸爸媽媽、爺爺奶奶，到學校來，親眼看看我們做了什麼。讓數據說話，讓樹說話，讓……」\n\n她頓了頓，輕輕笑了：\n\n「讓孩子們說話。」\n\n於是，「守護地球大作戰」的下一場行動——「環保家庭日」，正式展開了。\n\n晴晴鼓起勇氣，親自擬了一封邀請函，發到班級群組：\n\n「各位爸爸媽媽、爺爺奶奶您好：\n我們是六年一班的『守護地球作戰部隊』。\n這兩個月，我們在學校做了很多事：垃圾分類、午餐零浪費、省電節能、種樹認養。\n我們想邀請您，在星期五下午，來學校看看我們做了什麼。\n也許您會發現，孩子們做的，不是『玩』，而是真的在保護我們的家。\n──六年一班全體同學 敬邀」\n\n邀請函發出去之後，群組裡，沉默了整整一個下午。\n\n晴晴忐忑不安地，盯著手機，看了又看。\n\n「會有人來嗎？」她小聲問。\n\n「不知道。」未晞搖搖頭，「可是，只要有一個人來，我們就成功了。」\n\n星期五下午。\n\n兩點鐘。\n\n鹿陽國小六年一班的教室門口，出現了第一位家長——是阿釁的爸爸。\n\n「爸！你來了！」阿釁又驚又喜。\n\n「你不是一直叫我來嗎？」爸爸彆扭地咳了兩聲，「我倒要看看，你整天唸的『大作戰』，到底是什麼名堂！」\n\n接著，老巫的媽媽、尪伝恺的奶奶、晴晴的爸爸……\n\n一個一個地，出現在了教室門口。\n\n最後，連柯志遠的媽媽，也來了。\n\n「志遠一直求我來看看，」柯媽媽抱臂站在教室門口，語氣裡帶著保留，「我倒要看看，是什麼活動，讓志遠連遊戲機都不想玩了。」\n\n「歡迎歡迎！」晴晴深吸一口氣，站到講台上，大聲說，「各位爸爸媽媽，歡迎來到六年一班的『環保家庭日』！」\n\n於是，一場特別的「導覽」，開始了。\n\n「首先，請看這裡！」晴晴指著教室後面那一排分類桶，「這兩個月，我們全班一共正確分類了三百四十二公斤的資源回收！」\n\n「三百四十二公斤？！」阿釁爸爸瞪大了眼睛。\n\n「這是我女兒……」他看著那排整齊的回收桶，說不出話來。\n\n「請看這裡！」老巫挺著肚子，指著牆上的統計表，「我們班的午餐，從一天倒掉七點八公斤，變成現在的一天零點五公斤！這些省下來的食物，足夠餵飽三百個人！」\n\n「哇……」老巫媽媽感動地看著兒子，「我家這隻吃貨，居然在『省食物』？」\n\n「請看這裡！」尪伝恺指著窗外那片樹苗地，「我們種了一百二十六棵樹，全部活了下來！每一棵，都是我們親手種的！」\n\n「那棵『吃飽飽』，」尪伝恺的奶奶，眯著眼睛，看著窗外那些小樹苗，「是我孫子種的？」\n\n「對！奶奶！」尪伝恺點頭，眼眶微微發紅，「它會一直長大，一直陪著學校！」\n\n奶奶沒有說話。\n\n但她看著那棵小樹苗的眼神，悄悄地，溫柔了下來。\n\n最後，晴晴帶著家長們，走到學校後方的海堤邊。\n\n「各位爸爸媽媽，」晴晴指著遠方那片灰濛濛的海，「你們知道嗎？學校後面那條排水溝，這兩個月，越來越臭了。海水裡，也越來越多的東西，不該出現在那裡。」\n\n「這跟你們的『大作戰』有什麼關係？」柯媽媽問。\n\n「關係就是，」未晞站出來，聲音輕輕的，卻清清楚楚，「如果我們現在不做這些事，將來有一天，我們喝的水、我們的海、我們種的菜，都會被我們自己弄髒。我們現在做的每一件事，都是在幫大人們，多留一點乾淨的東西。」\n\n柯媽媽沉默了。\n\n她看著眼前這個溫柔的轉學生，又看了看那片海，最後，問了一句：\n\n「這些事……妳是從哪裡知道的？」\n\n未晞沒有回答。\n\n她只是微微笑了，然後，輕輕地說了一句：\n\n「從一個，大家還沒有忘記怎麼愛地球的時代。」\n\n那一刻，海風吹過。\n\n柯媽媽站在原地，看著遠方那五根煙囪，沉默了很久很久。\n\n「……志遠，」她忽然開口，「你做的這些事，媽媽以前不懂。可是……媽媽現在好像有點懂了。」\n\n「媽媽！」柯志遠撲進媽媽懷裡，眼眶紅紅的。\n\n「你們的『大作戰』，」柯媽媽深吸一口氣，語氣裡帶著前所未有的鄭重，「媽媽支持你們。」\n\n「哇——！」孩子們爆出震天的歡呼！\n\n家長們你看看我、我看看你，也都跟著笑了起來。\n\n「走！我們回去幫孩子們澆樹！」阿釁爸爸第一個行動。\n\n「對！我家的垃圾，從今天開始，全部分類！」老巫媽媽大聲宣布。\n\n「我明天就去買環保袋！」尪伝恺的奶奶也跟著湊熱鬧。\n\n那一天，夕陽特別紅。\n\n孩子們牽著爸爸媽媽的手，走在回家的路上。\n\n晴晴牽著爸爸的手，忽然開口：「爸爸，謝謝你來。」\n\n「謝什麼，」爸爸揉了揉她的頭髮，語氣裡帶著溫柔，「你做的這些事，爸爸其實一直看在眼裡。只是……大人的嘴巴，比較笨，不知道怎麼說。」\n\n「爸爸……」晴晴的眼眶，忽然有點熱熱的。\n\n「總之，」爸爸咳了兩聲，「以後家裡的廢機油，爸爸都拿去回收。這樣，你總滿意了吧？」\n\n「滿意！」晴晴笑了，笑得眼睛都瞇成了一條線。\n\n當天晚上，晴晴家的客廳裡，手機「叮咚」響個不停。\n\n晴晴忐忑地拿起手機，點開班級群組——然後，愣住了。\n\n群組裡，訊息一條接著一條跳出來：\n\n「今天去學校看了一趟，老實說，我滿感動的。孩子們種的那些樹，都是真的一棵一棵澆水種出來的。」（阿釁爸爸）\n\n「我家那隻吃貨，居然在管全校的剩食！我這個當媽的，今天第一次覺得他『長大了』。」（老巫媽媽）\n\n「我們家芸芸，這兩個月一直在陽台整理回收，我居然都沒發現。對不起，媽媽之前說錯話了。」（林芸芸媽媽）\n\n「奶奶說，明天要把家裡的塑膠袋全部換成環保袋。志遠，你贏了。」（柯媽媽）\n\n「哈哈哈！我家小子說明天要檢查我的襪子有沒有分類！（誤）總之，支持孩子們！」（另一位家長）\n\n一條，又一條。\n\n那些曾經讓晴晴失眠的話，此刻，全都變了。\n\n晴晴看著那些訊息，眼眶，一下子紅了。\n\n「媽媽！」她衝到客廳，撲進媽媽懷裡，「你看！他們……他們都……」\n\n「媽媽看到了。」媽媽輕輕拍著她的背，語氣溫柔，「小晴，你們做了一件，連大人都做不到的事。」\n\n「什麼事？」\n\n「讓大人，願意回頭看看自己丟掉的東西。」\n\n晴晴趴在媽媽懷裡，用力點頭，眼淚一滴一滴地，落在媽媽的肩膀上。\n\n那晚，月光特別亮。\n\n而在他們身後，未晞一個人，靜靜地，走在海堤上。\n\n她看著那些牽著手、笑鬧著回家的孩子們，嘴角，微微上揚。\n\n「……這樣，就對了。」她低聲說，「地球，就是靠著一個一個小小的家庭，一點一點救回來的。」\n\n「嗶嗶——」一個小小的銀白色身影，從排水溝的方向竄了過來，氣喘吁吁地停在未晞腳邊。\n\n「未晞！我查到了一個重要的線索！」溜溜的電子眼裡，難得地帶著凝重，「我沿著排水溝往上飛，發現上游有一條『新的』管線！跟以前的完全不一樣！它……」\n\n「它還在排，對嗎？」未晞問。\n\n「對！」溜溜點頭，「而且排出來的東西，會讓海水變色！我偷偷取了一滴，掃描了一下——裡面有重金屬，還有一些……連我的資料庫都認不出來的化學物質！」\n\n未晞沉默了。\n\n她看向排水溝上游的方向，輕輕說：「終於……開始了。」\n\n「開始什麼？」溜溜緊張地問。\n\n「沒什麼。」未晞搖了搖頭，蹲下來，輕輕摸了摸溜溜的頭，「溜溜，這件事，先不要告訴大家。讓孩子們，再多開心幾天。」\n\n「為什麼？」溜溜不解。\n\n「因為……」未晞看向遠方那五根煙囪，聲音輕得像一片羽毛，「接下來發生的事，會很辛苦。我想讓大家，至少先記住『開心』是什麼樣子。」\n\n溜溜歪著頭，似懂非懂。\n\n但牠看著未晞那張溫柔卻隱隱帶著憂傷的臉，最後還是點了點頭。\n\n「嗶嗶。我知道了。」溜溜低聲說，「我會繼續盯著那條管線。」\n\n「嗯。」未晞輕輕笑了，「謝謝你，溜溜。」\n\n她低頭，看了一眼手環。\n\n手環內側，那行倒數數字，在夕陽下微微閃爍。\n\n——四十。\n\n風，從海上吹來。\n\n她輕輕地，握緊了手腕上的手環，像是在握著什麼重要的東西。\n\n「還有一點點時間。」她低聲說，「就讓我，再多陪他們一下子吧。」\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 9: Bringing Environmental Protection Home\n\nIn the first week after the \"Inspect the Drainage Ditch\" mission began, Liu-Liu submitted its first investigation report.\n\n\"Beep beep! Report!\" Liu-Liu spread out a map covered in markings, data dancing in its electronic eyes, \"After seven days of reconnaissance, I found that the smell of the drainage ditch behind the school doesn't start near the school—it comes from much further upstream! I flew three kilometers up the ditch, and the spot where the smell is strongest is over there!\"\n\nLiu-Liu drew a big circle on the map with its tail.\n\n\"Over there...\" Qingqing leaned in for a closer look and frowned, \"isn't that toward the industrial zone?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi walked over, looked at the map, and said softly, \"But with just our little group, we don't have enough strength to investigate the entire ditch. And...\"\n\nShe paused, sweeping her gaze across the whole class: \"the pollution isn't only in that one ditch.\"\n\n\"Not in the ditch?\" A-Xin asked in confusion, \"Then where is it?\"\n\n\"In our everyday lives.\" Weixi said, \"Every plastic bag someone throws away, every cleaner someone rinses down the drain, every PET bottle someone uses—they all flow down the ditches, into the rivers, into the sea. The stink of that one ditch is something all of us 'contributed' to, bit by bit.\"\n\nThe classroom fell quiet for a moment.\n\n\"So,\" Qingqing stood up and announced loudly, \"the next operation of 'Protect Earth' isn't at school—it's in each of our homes!\"\n\n\"At home?\" The children looked at each other.\n\n\"Yes!\" Qingqing said, \"We're going to bring the 'Campaign' home! Starting today, everyone goes home and rallies their parents, grandparents—to sort trash, save electricity, and cut down on plastic together with us!\"\n\n\"That... that's way too hard!\" A-Xin wailed, \"My dad can't even sort his own socks!\"\n\n\"That's exactly why you're going!\" Qingqing planted her hands on her hips, \"You're members of the 'Protect Earth Operations Unit'! The battlefield extends from the classroom to every home! This is called—'bringing environmental protection home'!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\" The children shouted in unison.\n\nAnd so, starting the next day, the twenty-six children of Class 6-1 each launched their own \"home campaign.\"\n\nThe first to surrender was A-Xin's house.\n\n\"Dad! Why did you buy plastic bags again!\" A-Xin stood at the front door, hands on his hips like a little police officer, \"Didn't we agree to bring our own shopping bags?\"\n\n\"Huh? Those two plastic bags cost two dollars!\" A-Xin's father held up his grocery basket, utterly confused, \"Since when did you become an environmental inspection team?\"\n\n\"Starting today!\" A-Xin declared with full confidence, \"Our class is carrying out 'Protect Earth'! Every plastic bag used is one less on Earth—throw it in the sea and it won't disappear for a hundred years!\"\n\n\"A hundred years?\" His father frowned, \"Then the plastic bags I've used my whole life would pile up into a mountain!\"\n\n\"So you have to use fewer!\" A-Xin shouted, \"Dad! You have to support me! I'm the leader of the 'Tree Adoption Raid Squad'!\"\n\n\"Fine, fine, I support you, I support you!\" His father shook his head helplessly, \"Then tell me, if not plastic bags, what do I use to carry groceries?\"\n\n\"Use these!\" A-Xin produced, like magic, a neat stack of reusable shopping bags from behind his back, \"I bought five with my allowance at school! One for each of us!\"\n\n\"...\" His father stared at the shopping bags and fell silent for two seconds, \"...You even prepared for that?\"\n\n\"I did my homework thoroughly!\" A-Xin puffed out his chest proudly.\n\nThat evening, for the first time, no plastic bags appeared on the A-Xin family's dinner table.\n\nOld Wu's house, meanwhile, was a different picture.\n\n\"Mom! Starting today, I'm in charge of sorting our household trash!\" Old Wu rolled up his sleeves, grand and heroic, \"Food waste goes in this bucket! Recyclables go in that bag! General waste goes in the trash can!\"\n\n\"You?\" Old Wu's mother stared wide-eyed and reached out to feel her son's forehead, \"Are you running a fever? You can't even keep your socks together—now you're sorting trash?\"\n\n\"Never judge a book by its cover!\" Old Wu tilted his head up proudly, \"I'm the leader of the 'Zero-Leftover Lunch Raid Squad'! Our class manages the whole school's leftover food—a bit of household trash is nothing!\"\n\n\"Fine, fine,\" his mother laughed heartily, \"then let's see how many days you last!\"\n\n\"Forever!\" Old Wu announced loudly.\n\n\"Hahaha!\" His mother laughed until tears came out.\n\nLin Yunyun's house, however, didn't go so smoothly.\n\n\"Yunyun, what are you doing again?\" Lin Yunyun's mother frowned at her daughter, who was crouching on the balcony, carefully folding old newspapers one by one.\n\n\"I'm organizing recyclables.\" Lin Yunyun said quietly, \"Our class is carrying out 'Protect Earth,' and the teacher... I mean, my classmates said we should start at home.\"\n\n\"What campaign?\" His mother's tone carried impatience, \"Have you finished your homework? Isn't the monthly exam next week? Messing around with all this stuff all day—what if your grades drop?\"\n\n\"I... I finished my homework...\" Lin Yunyun lowered her head, her voice growing smaller and smaller.\n\n\"Then go review!\" Her mother sighed, \"Environmental protection is something adults should worry about. Why does a little kid like you need to meddle in it?\"\n\nLin Yunyun said nothing more.\n\nShe silently placed the folded newspapers into the recycling bag, returned to her desk, and opened her textbook.\n\nBut her eyes kept sneaking, again and again, toward that bag of recyclables on the balcony.\n\nThe same thing happened at Wang Zhuankai's house.\n\n\"A-Kai, your grandmother says you told her to separate the food waste?\" Wang Zhuankai's mother asked, holding a bowl of rice, puzzled.\n\n\"Yeah!\" Wang Zhuankai nodded, \"Food waste can be composted and used to grow vegetables! Otherwise it gets burned with the trash and produces lots of dirty air!\"\n\n\"Why does an elementary school kid need to worry about these things?\" His grandmother chimed in from the side, \"We never separated it before, and the garbage truck still came!\"\n\n\"But Grandma,\" Wang Zhuankai said with unusual seriousness, \"people in the old days didn't have this much trash. One person today throws away more trash in a day than a whole family used to throw away in a month! If we don't sort it, there really won't be anywhere left for the trash to go.\"\n\nHis grandmother froze for a moment, glanced at her grandson, and said nothing more.\n\nBut that night, Wang Zhuankai noticed that his grandmother had quietly poured the food waste into a different bucket.\n\nAnd the most ferocious battlefield of all was Qingqing's house.\n\n\"Dad! You can't just pour that waste oil down the ditch!\" Qingqing dashed out of the house, grabbing her father's arm just as he was about to pour it out.\n\n\"Huh?\" Her father held up the pitch-black oil can, face full of question marks, \"Where else would I pour it? This is how I've always done it!\"\n\n\"Always doing it that way doesn't mean it's right!\" Qingqing jumped anxiously, \"Waste oil poured down the ditch flows into the rivers and the sea, polluting the water sources! It's all over the news!\"\n\n\"News?\" Her father froze, \"Since when did you start watching the news?\"\n\n\"Since... I made a certain friend!\" Qingqing said, \"Anyway, waste oil has to be collected and taken to a proper recycling point! Dad, you've been fixing cars for twenty years—you must know where they collect waste oil, right?\"\n\n\"I do know...\" Her father scratched the back of his head, \"but that's a hassle.\"\n\n\"Dad!\" Qingqing planted her hands on her hips and deployed her trump card, \"I, your daughter, am the 'Operations Commander' of the 'Protect Earth Operations Unit'! You wouldn't want your daughter's unit's first lost battlefield to be her own home, would you!\"\n\n\"...\" Her father was silent for three seconds, then laughed, \"Alright, alright, Commander! From now on, I'll collect the waste oil and take it for recycling!\"\n\n\"That's my good dad!\" Qingqing smiled in satisfaction.\n\nHowever, not every household was \"conquered\" as smoothly as Qingqing's.\n\nA week later, Qingqing's mother, with a grave expression, handed a phone screenshot to Qingqing.\n\n\"Xiaoqing,\" her mother's voice carried worry, \"in your class's parent group... a parent is complaining about you.\"\n\nQingqing took the phone and looked—\n\nIn the parent group chat, a message lay quietly at the very top:\n\n\"Dear parents, I'm Ke Zhiyuan's mother. I'd like to ask, what exactly is Class 6-1's 'Protect Earth Campaign'? Our Zhiyuan has come home these past two weeks, messing around with trash sorting, saving electricity, and planting trees all day; he scribbles through his homework and runs out to the balcony to look at his tree! I want to know—is this a school-mandated activity, or was it 'invented' by some teacher or student?\"\n\nBelow it followed several supporting comments:\n\n\"Our kid is doing the same! Says they're 'bringing environmental protection home,' and ends up nagging at us all day!\"\n\n\"Right! The monthly exam is coming up—isn't this a waste of study time?\"\n\n\"Kids doing environmental stuff is just playing, isn't it? Why isn't the teacher doing something about it?\"\n\nQingqing read those messages, and her face slowly sank.\n\n\"Mom...\" she lowered her head, her voice dry, \"do these parents think... what we're doing is wrong?\"\n\n\"Xiaoqing,\" her mother crouched down and gently stroked her head, \"Mom doesn't think what you're doing is wrong. But adults have their own worries. You're busy with all this all day—whether you've kept up with your schoolwork is what they naturally worry about.\"\n\n\"But we've kept up with our schoolwork too!\" Qingqing's voice carried grievance, \"Our class's grades even improved last semester! Why don't they look at that, and only look at us 'doing environmental stuff all day'?\"\n\n\"Because...\" her mother sighed, \"adults always see only the side they worry about.\"\n\nThat night, Qingqing couldn't sleep.\n\nShe tossed and turned in bed, unable to fall asleep at all.\n\nIn her mind echoed those words from the parent group:\n\n\"Nagging at us all day...\"\n\n\"Isn't this a waste of study time?\"\n\n\"Kids doing environmental stuff is just playing, isn't it?\"\n\nShe quietly got up, walked to the window, and looked at the five smokestacks faintly glowing in the distance through the night.\n\n\"Are we... really wrong?\" she whispered.\n\nThe next morning, Qingqing walked into the classroom with two dark circles under her eyes.\n\n\"Qingqing, what's wrong?\" Weixi noticed her change at once, \"You don't look like you slept well.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" Qingqing hesitated, then handed her the phone, \"Take a look at this.\"\n\nWeixi took the phone and quietly read through those messages in the group, one by one.\n\nThen she put down the phone and said softly:\n\n\"What they said isn't entirely unreasonable.\"\n\n\"What?!\" Qingqing's eyes went wide.\n\n\"The adults worry about schoolwork because they think 'environmental protection' and 'studying' are two unrelated things.\" Weixi's voice was still soft, \"But we all know they're actually the same thing—protecting the Earth is protecting the place where we study and grow up.\"\n\n\"Then how do we make the adults understand?\" Qingqing asked.\n\nWeixi thought for a moment, then said: \"Adults don't believe what they hear 'with their mouths,' but they believe what they see 'with their eyes.' Instead of arguing with them, let's... let them see for themselves.\"\n\n\"See for themselves?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"Let's hold an event. Invite the fathers, mothers, grandfathers, grandmothers to come to school and see with their own eyes what we've done. Let the data speak, let the trees speak, and let...\"\n\nShe paused, then smiled softly:\n\n\"...let the children speak.\"\n\nAnd so, the next operation of \"Protect Earth\"—the \"Green Family Day\"—began in earnest.\n\nQingqing gathered her courage, personally drafted an invitation, and sent it to the parent group:\n\n\"Dear fathers, mothers, grandfathers, and grandmothers:\nWe are the 'Protect Earth Operations Unit' of Class 6-1.\nThese past two months, we've done many things at school: trash sorting, zero leftover lunches, saving electricity, planting trees.\nWe'd like to invite you to come to school this Friday afternoon to see what we've done.\nPerhaps you'll find that what your children are doing isn't 'playing'—it's genuinely protecting our home.\n—Sincerely, all twenty-six students of Class 6-1\"\n\nAfter the invitation went out, the group fell silent for an entire afternoon.\n\nQingqing stared at her phone anxiously, checking again and again.\n\n\"Will anyone come?\" she asked quietly.\n\n\"I don't know.\" Weixi shook her head, \"But as long as one person comes, we've already succeeded.\"\n\nFriday afternoon.\n\nTwo o'clock.\n\nAt the classroom door of Class 6-1, Luyang Elementary, the first parent appeared—it was A-Xin's father.\n\n\"Dad! You came!\" A-Xin was both surprised and delighted.\n\n\"Didn't you keep asking me to come?\" His father coughed awkwardly, \"I want to see for myself what this 'Campaign' you keep nagging about really is!\"\n\nThen, Old Wu's mother, Wang Zhuankai's grandmother, Qingqing's father...\n\nOne by one, they appeared at the classroom door.\n\nFinally, even Ke Zhiyuan's mother came.\n\n\"Zhiyuan kept begging me to come,\" Ke's mother stood at the classroom door with her arms crossed, her tone reserved, \"I want to see what activity is so good that Zhiyuan doesn't even want to play video games anymore.\"\n\n\"Welcome, welcome!\" Qingqing took a deep breath, stepped up to the podium, and said loudly, \"Dear parents, welcome to Class 6-1's 'Green Family Day'!\"\n\nAnd so, a special \"tour\" began.\n\n\"First, please look here!\" Qingqing pointed at the row of sorting bins at the back of the classroom, \"In these two months, our class has correctly sorted three hundred forty-two kilograms of recyclables!\"\n\n\"Three hundred forty-two kilograms?!\" A-Xin's father's eyes went wide.\n\n\"This is my daughter...\" He stared at the neat row of recycling bins, lost for words.\n\n\"Please look here!\" Old Wu stuck out his belly and pointed at the statistics chart on the wall, \"Our class's lunch went from throwing away 7.8 kilograms a day to 0.5 kilograms! The food we saved could feed three hundred people!\"\n\n\"Wow...\" Old Wu's mother looked at her son, moved, \"This glutton of mine is actually 'saving food'?\"\n\n\"Please look here!\" Wang Zhuankai pointed at the sapling lot outside the window, \"We planted one hundred twenty-six trees, and every single one survived! Each one was planted by our own hands!\"\n\n\"That one, 'Eat-Your-Fill,'\" Wang Zhuankai's grandmother squinted at the little saplings outside, \"was planted by my grandson?\"\n\n\"Yes, Grandma!\" Wang Zhuankai nodded, his eyes slightly reddened, \"It'll keep growing, and it'll keep the school company forever!\"\n\nHis grandmother said nothing.\n\nBut the look she gave that little sapling quietly softened.\n\nFinally, Qingqing led the parents to the seawall behind the school.\n\n\"Dear parents,\" Qingqing pointed at that murky gray sea in the distance, \"do you know? That drainage ditch behind the school has been getting stinkier these past two months. And the seawater has gained more and more things that shouldn't be there.\"\n\n\"What does that have to do with your 'Campaign'?\" Ke's mother asked.\n\n\"The connection is,\" Weixi stepped forward, her voice soft yet clear, \"that if we don't do these things now, one day the water we drink, the sea we swim in, and the vegetables we grow will all be dirtied by our own hands. Everything we're doing now is helping the adults hold on to a little more clean.\"\n\nKe's mother fell silent.\n\nShe looked at this gentle transfer student, then at the sea, and finally asked one question:\n\n\"These things... where did you learn them?\"\n\nWeixi didn't answer.\n\nShe only smiled faintly, then said softly:\n\n\"From an era when people hadn't yet forgotten how to love the Earth.\"\n\nAt that moment, the sea breeze blew past.\n\nKe's mother stood in place, staring at those five smokestacks in the distance, silent for a very, very long time.\n\n\"...Zhiyuan,\" she finally spoke, \"what you've been doing—Mom didn't understand before. But now... I think I'm starting to.\"\n\n\"Mom!\" Ke Zhiyuan threw himself into his mother's arms, his eyes red.\n\n\"Your 'Campaign,'\" Ke's mother took a deep breath, her tone carrying unprecedented solemnity, \"Mom supports you.\"\n\n\"Wow—!\" The children erupted in thunderous cheers!\n\nThe parents looked at each other, then laughed along.\n\n\"Come on! Let's go back and water the trees for the kids!\" A-Xin's father was the first to act.\n\n\"Right! From today on, all our household trash gets sorted!\" Old Wu's mother announced loudly.\n\n\"I'm going to buy reusable bags tomorrow!\" Wang Zhuankai's grandmother joined in the excitement.\n\nThat day, the setting sun was especially red.\n\nThe children walked home holding their parents' hands.\n\nQingqing held her father's hand and suddenly spoke: \"Dad, thank you for coming.\"\n\n\"What's there to thank,\" her father ruffled her hair, his tone gentle, \"I've actually been watching everything you do. It's just... adults have clumsy mouths and don't know how to say it.\"\n\n\"Dad...\" Qingqing's eyes suddenly felt a little hot.\n\n\"In any case,\" her father coughed twice, \"from now on, I'll take the waste oil for recycling. Satisfied?\"\n\n\"Satisfied!\" Qingqing smiled, her eyes squeezed into happy crescents.\n\nThat evening, in the living room of Qingqing's house, the phone went \"ding-dong\" without stop.\n\nQingqing nervously picked up the phone and opened the parent group—then froze.\n\nMessages popped up one after another:\n\n\"I went to the school today, and honestly, I was pretty moved. Those trees the kids planted—each one was watered and grown by their own hands.\" (A-Xin's father)\n\n\"That glutton of mine is actually managing the whole school's leftover food! As his mom, today is the first time I feel he's 'grown up.'\" (Old Wu's mother)\n\n\"Our Yunyun has been organizing recyclables on the balcony for two months, and I never even noticed. I'm sorry—Mom was wrong before.\" (Lin Yunyun's mother)\n\n\"Grandma says we're switching all our plastic bags to reusable ones tomorrow. Zhiyuan, you win.\" (Ke's mother)\n\n\"Hahaha! My kid says tomorrow he's going to check whether my socks are sorted! (Joke) Anyway, we support the kids!\" (Another parent)\n\nOne after another.\n\nThe words that had once kept Qingqing awake had all changed now.\n\nQingqing looked at those messages, and her eyes suddenly turned red.\n\n\"Mom!\" She dashed into the living room and threw herself into her mother's arms, \"Look! They... they all...\"\n\n\"Mom can see.\" Her mother gently patted her back, her tone soft, \"Xiaoqing, you've done something even adults couldn't do.\"\n\n\"What is it?\"\n\n\"Made adults willing to look back at the things they throw away.\"\n\nQingqing lay in her mother's arms, nodding hard, tears falling drop by drop onto her mother's shoulder.\n\nThat night, the moonlight was especially bright.\n\nAnd behind them, Weixi walked alone, quietly, along the seawall.\n\nShe watched the children, hand in hand with their parents, laughing and heading home, and the corners of her mouth lifted slightly.\n\n\"...This is right.\" she whispered, \"The Earth is saved bit by bit, one small family at a time.\"\n\n\"Beep beep—\" A small silver-white figure darted over from the direction of the drainage ditch, panting as it stopped at Weixi's feet.\n\n\"Weixi! I found an important clue!\" Liu-Liu's electronic eyes carried unusual gravity, \"I flew up the ditch and found a 'new' pipe upstream! Completely different from the old ones! It...\"\n\n\"It's still discharging, isn't it?\" Weixi asked.\n\n\"Yes!\" Liu-Liu nodded, \"And what it discharges changes the color of the seawater! I secretly took a drop and scanned it—it contains heavy metals, plus some chemical substances... that not even my database can identify!\"\n\nWeixi fell silent.\n\nShe looked toward the upstream direction of the ditch and said softly: \"Finally... it's begun.\"\n\n\"Begun what?\" Liu-Liu asked nervously.\n\n\"Nothing.\" Weixi shook her head, crouched down, and gently patted Liu-Liu's head, \"Liu-Liu, don't tell everyone about this yet. Let the children be happy for a few more days.\"\n\n\"Why?\" Liu-Liu didn't understand.\n\n\"Because...\" Weixi looked at the five smokestacks in the distance, her voice light as a feather, \"what's about to happen will be hard. I want everyone to at least remember first what 'happy' looks like.\"\n\nLiu-Liu tilted its head, half understanding.\n\nBut looking at Weixi's gentle face, faintly laced with sorrow, it finally nodded.\n\n\"Beep beep. Got it.\" Liu-Liu said quietly, \"I'll keep watching that pipe.\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi smiled softly, \"Thank you, Liu-Liu.\"\n\nShe lowered her head and looked at the bracelet on her wrist.\n\nOn the inside of the bracelet, the countdown number flickered faintly in the setting sun.\n\n—Forty.\n\nThe wind blew in from the sea.\n\nShe gently clenched the bracelet on her wrist, as if holding something precious.\n\n\"There's still a little time.\" she said softly, \"Let me stay with them... just a little longer.\"\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":2,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第十章：淨灘行動與塑膠危機\n\n「追查排水溝」任務展開的第二個星期，未晞做了一個提議。\n\n「與其一直等著上游的真相，」某天放學後，未晞站在教室後面，看著窗外那片灰濛濛的海，「不如先從我們看得見的地方開始。」\n\n「看得見的地方？」晴晴問。\n\n「那片海灘。」未晞指著學校後方海堤外的沙灘，「你們有沒有仔細看過，那片沙灘上，現在是什麼樣子？」\n\n孩子們面面相覷。\n\n那片海灘，他們每天都看得到。可是說真的……好像從來沒有人，仔細看過它。\n\n「去看看就知道了。」未晞說。\n\n於是第二天放學，六年一班的二十六個人，加上溜溜，浩浩蕩蕩地，翻過海堤，第一次踏上了那片海灘。\n\n然後，所有人都愣住了。\n\n沙灘上，密密麻麻地，散落著各種垃圾。\n\n寶特瓶、瓶蓋、吸管、塑膠袋、保麗龍碎片、飲料罐、拖鞋、漁網、繩子……從腳邊，一直蔓延到視線盡頭，像是有人故意把一整座垃圾場，倒在了這裡。\n\n「這……」阿釁瞪大眼睛，「這也太誇張了吧！我們學校後面，怎麼會有這麼多垃圾？！」\n\n「這些垃圾，」未晞蹲下來，撿起一個被海水磨得發白的寶特瓶，聲音輕輕的，「大部分，都不是從學校來的。它們是從上游的河裡，一路漂下來的；是從海上的船，丟下來的；是從海的那一頭，被洋流帶過來的。」\n\n「海的那一頭？」老巫愣住，「那是多遠？」\n\n「可能，是幾千公里以外的地方。」未晞說，「風把它們吹到海上，海把它們帶到這裡。我們撿起來的每一片垃圾，可能都環遊過半個地球。」\n\n「環遊半個地球……」林芸芸蹲在沙灘上，小心翼翼地撿起一個瓶蓋，喃喃地重複著。\n\n「那我們要怎麼辦？」尪伝恺問，「這麼多垃圾，光靠我們二十六個人，撿得完嗎？」\n\n「撿不完。」未晞搖搖頭，語氣卻很堅定，「可是，只要我們撿起一把，這片沙灘，就乾淨一點點。」\n\n「對！」晴晴站起來，大聲說，「『守護地球大作戰』新任務：『淨灘行動』！我們每個人，負責把自己面前這一小塊沙灘，清乾淨！」\n\n「好——！」孩子們齊聲回應。\n\n隔天是星期六，天氣陰陰的，海風帶著鹹味，吹得人直打哆嗦。\n\n可是，早上九點，鹿陽國小的校門口，卻站滿了二十六個裹著外套、戴著口罩、全副武裝的孩子。\n\n「都帶齊了嗎？」晴晴點名。\n\n「手套！」「夾子！」「垃圾袋！」「水壺！」「帽子！」孩子們一個一個報數。\n\n「還有最重要的！」阿釁從背包裡掏出一面用黃色塑膠布做的小旗子，插在沙灘的方向，「『淨灘作戰旗』！出發！」\n\n「喔——！」\n\n二十六個孩子，像一支小小的軍隊，浩浩蕩蕩地，翻過海堤，朝那片海灘出發。\n\n於是，一場「淨灘大作戰」，在學校後方的海灘上，正式展開了。\n\n孩子們帶來了手套、夾子、垃圾袋，阿釁甚至不知從哪裡弄來了一頂工地安全帽，戴在頭上，煞有其事地指揮起來。\n\n「各就各位！垃圾分類！寶特瓶放這個袋！瓶蓋放這個袋！其他垃圾放那個袋！分錯的，溜溜會退貨！」\n\n「嗶嗶！收到！」溜溜在沙灘上跑來跑去，像個嚴格的監工，「這片沙灘，就是我們的『戰場』！」\n\n「戰場？」老巫撿起一隻被海水泡爛的拖鞋，舉在頭上，「那這隻拖鞋，就是我的『戰利品』！」\n\n「你那算什麼！」阿釁不甘示弱，從沙子裡挖出一條纏著海草的釣魚線，「我這個，可是『海底怪物』的觸手！」\n\n「你那條釣魚線，」晴晴走過來，皺起眉頭，「要是纏到海龜的脖子上，海龜會死掉的！新聞都報過，海龜被塑膠纏住，長大以後，殼都變形了！」\n\n「真的假的？！」阿釁瞪大眼睛，立刻把釣魚線小心翼翼地收進垃圾袋，「那我要把它『處決』！替海龜報仇！」\n\n孩子們一邊撿，一邊嘰嘰喳喳地討論。\n\n「唉，你們看這個！」尪伝恺撿起一個吸管，「這麼小一根吸管，丟到海裡，要多久才會不見？」\n\n「一百年，」未晞輕聲說，「或者更久。」\n\n「一百年？！」尪伝恺倒抽一口涼氣，「一百年以後，我都已經……」\n\n「已經變成老爺爺了！」阿釁哈哈大笑，「然後你的吸管，還躺在海裡！」\n\n「那怎麼可以！」尪伝恺捏著那根吸管，表情認真得像在宣戰，「我絕對不要，讓我的吸管比我活得還久！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑成一片。\n\n「對了對了！你們快來看這個！」老巫忽然大喊，舉著一個奇怪的東西跑過來，「我挖到一個『古董』！」\n\n「古董？」孩子們圍過去一看——那是一支生鏽的鐵罐，上面依稀還能看出「汽水」兩個字。\n\n「哇！這至少是三十年前的汽水罐！」阿釁瞪大眼睛，「老巫，你發財了！這可以賣給博物館！」\n\n「賣什麼博物館！」晴晴哭笑不得，「這是垃圾！丟進『金屬類』！」\n\n「喔！」老巫乖乖地把「古董」放進分類袋，嘴裡還唸唸有詞，「三十年前的汽水罐……當年喝它的人，一定想不到，三十年後，會有一個小學生在海邊撿到它……」\n\n「所以說，」未晞走過來，輕聲說，「我們丟的每一樣東西，都不會真正消失。它們會一直留在這個世界上，等著被某一天、某一個人，重新看見。」\n\n孩子們沉默了。\n\n「那我們就多撿一點！」阿釁大聲說，「把那些『等著被看見』的垃圾，全部『帶回家』！」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲應和。\n\n「對了！你們看我撿到什麼！」林芸芸舉起一個小小的、褪色的玩具車，「這個小車車……一定是哪個小朋友不小心弄丟的。」\n\n「說不定它從很遠的海上漂來！」老巫湊過去，「它可能已經環遊世界一圈了！」\n\n「那我們幫它完成願望！」阿釁把玩具車小心翼翼地放進袋子，「讓它留在沙灘上，等它的主人回來找它！」\n\n「阿釁，你什麼時候變得這麼感性了？」晴晴哭笑不得。\n\n「我一直都很感性！」阿釁理直氣壯，「我只是平常不表現出來！」\n\n「你明明只是捨不得丟玩具！」老巫吐槽。\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑成一團。\n\n「同學們，」未晞忽然開口，聲音輕輕的，「你們知道嗎？有人做過統計——全世界每年流進海洋的塑膠垃圾，足足有八百萬噸。」\n\n「八百萬噸？！」孩子們瞪大了眼睛。\n\n「八百萬噸是什麼概念呢？」未晞低頭想了想，「大概……每一分鐘，就有一卡車的塑膠，倒進海裡。」\n\n「每一分鐘？！」阿釁倒抽一口涼氣，「那我們剛剛講話的這幾分鐘，又有好幾卡車的塑膠倒進海裡了？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞輕輕點頭，「可是，我們今天撿起來的這七十六公斤，就是從這『每一分鐘』裡，搶回來的。」\n\n「搶回來的……」孩子們看著那些垃圾袋，眼睛裡，忽然多了一種說不出的光。\n\n「所以，我們要繼續搶！」阿釁大聲說。\n\n「繼續搶！」孩子們齊聲回應。\n\n淨灘進行到一半，溜溜叼著一個小袋子，氣喘吁吁地跑回來。\n\n「嗶嗶！統計出來了！」溜溜把袋子往沙灘上一倒，「剛剛一個小時，我們全班一共撿了——寶特瓶一百四十七個！瓶蓋二百三十一個！吸管五十八根！塑膠袋四十二個！保麗龍……數不清了！總重量：二十三公斤！」\n\n「二十三公斤！」孩子們驚呼，「才一個小時？！」\n\n「嗯。」溜溜點頭，「而且我掃描了一下，這些垃圾裡，百分之八十以上，都是『塑膠類』。」\n\n「塑膠……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「塑膠不會消失。」未晞蹲在沙灘上，看著那些垃圾，聲音輕輕的，「它只會，變成越來越小的碎片。小到看不見，小到被魚吃下去，小到……」她停頓了一下，「小到，我們最後，把它吃回肚子裡。」\n\n沙灘上，忽然安靜了。\n\n海風呼嘯而過，吹得孩子們的頭髮亂飛。\n\n「未晞？」阿釁第一個注意到未晞的異樣，小心翼翼地喊了她一聲，「你……你怎麼了？」\n\n其實，從踏上這片沙灘的那一刻起，未晞就有些反常。\n\n她走在沙灘上，不像其他孩子那樣四處跑跳，而是走得特別慢，每一步都像是踩在很脆弱的東西上。\n\n她會蹲下來，盯著沙子裡嵌著的小小塑膠碎片，看了很久很久，然後把它們一顆一顆，撿起來。\n\n「未晞，你在撿什麼？」林芸芸好奇地湊過去。\n\n「這些……塑膠碎片。」未晞輕輕說，「它們太小了，小到大家都不會注意。可是，它們是最大的問題。」\n\n「最大的問題？」林芸芸不懂。\n\n「大垃圾，會被撿走。可是這些小碎片，」未晞把手掌攤開，那些細小的、五顏六色的塑膠碎片，在陽光下閃爍著，「會一直留在沙裡、留進水裡，被魚吃下去，然後……」她沒有說下去，只是把那些碎片，輕輕地放進口袋裡。\n\n「然後呢？」林芸芸追問。\n\n「然後，」未晞的聲音，忽然變得虛弱，「它們會變成……」\n\n她的聲音，戛然而止。\n\n她整個人，像是被什麼東西擊中一樣，僵在原地。\n\n然後，她的瞳孔，猛地放大。\n\n「未晞！」晴晴也發現不對勁，衝了過去，「你怎麼了？！你的臉色……」\n\n「我……」未晞的聲音，忽然開始發抖，「我看到……」\n\n「看到什麼？」阿釁緊張地問。\n\n「我看到……」未晞顫抖著，伸出手，指著眼前的沙灘，「那一片沙灘……」\n\n「這片沙灘怎麼了？」孩子們面面相覷，「這片沙灘……不就是這樣嗎？」\n\n「不是！」未晞猛地搖頭，聲音帶著哭腔，「你們看不到嗎？！那些垃圾……那些垃圾，比人還高！整個沙灘，全部都是垃圾！黑黑的水……天也是灰的……」\n\n「未晞！」晴晴一把抓住她的肩膀，「你冷靜一點！這裡沒有什麼比人還高的垃圾！這裡只有我們剛剛撿的那二十三公斤！」\n\n「可是……」未晞的眼淚，毫無預警地掉了下來，「我看到了……我真的看到了……那就是……那就是我們的未來……」\n\n「未晞！」阿釁也衝過來，擋在她面前，大聲喊，「你看我！看著我！這裡沒有垃圾山！這裡只有我們！只有我們二十六個人，還有這片沙灘！」\n\n未晞愣愣地，看著阿釁。\n\n她的瞳孔，慢慢地，重新對上了焦。\n\n「……阿釁？」她低聲說。\n\n「對！是我！」阿釁鬆了一口氣，「你剛才，是不是看到了什麼可怕的東西？」\n\n未晞沉默了。\n\n她低下頭，眼淚一滴一滴地，落在沙灘上。\n\n「……對不起。」她吸了吸鼻子，勉強擠出一個笑容，「我沒事。我只是……看到了一些……」她搖搖頭，「沒什麼。真的沒什麼。」\n\n「可是你剛才明明……」阿釁還想追問。\n\n「阿釁！」晴晴打斷他，搖了搖頭，「別問了。」\n\n阿釁張了張嘴，最後還是閉上了。\n\n但他看著未晞那張蒼白的、還掛著淚痕的臉，心裡，卻湧起了一個前所未有的疑問。\n\n一個小時後，淨灘行動結束了。\n\n二十六個孩子，排成一排，站在沙灘上，面前是整整齊齊排好的垃圾袋。\n\n「最終統計！」溜溜大聲宣布，「本次淨灘行動，全班共撿拾垃圾——七十六公斤！」\n\n「七十六公斤？！」孩子們發出驚呼。\n\n「寶特瓶三百八十九個！」溜溜繼續報告，「瓶蓋五百七十三個！吸管一百二十九根！塑膠袋九十八個！還有漁網、拖鞋、打火機、牙刷……各式各樣，應有盡有！」\n\n「你們看，」晴晴指著那些垃圾袋，「我們二十六個人，一個下午，就從這片沙灘上，搬走了七十六公斤的垃圾！如果我們每個月都來一次，一年下來……」\n\n「一年可以撿九百多公斤！」阿釁搶著算，「將近一噸！」\n\n「將近一噸的垃圾！」孩子們互相看了看，眼睛裡，都閃著光。\n\n「從今天開始，」晴晴大聲宣布，「每個月，我們都來淨灘！」\n\n「好——！」\n\n孩子們歡呼著，把垃圾袋一袋一袋，抬回學校，交給清潔隊。\n\n「今天，」晴晴站在海堤上，看著孩子們，大聲問，「你們累不累？」\n\n「累——！」孩子們異口同聲，聲音卻帶著笑意。\n\n「可是開不開心？」\n\n「開心——！」\n\n「為什麼開心？」晴晴問。\n\n「因為我們把沙灘變乾淨了！」孩子們齊聲喊。\n\n「對！」晴晴大聲說，「這片沙灘，是我們的地盤！我們不准垃圾，欺負我們的沙灘！」\n\n「不准！」孩子們跟著大喊。\n\n海風呼嘯，孩子們的喊聲，在海面上迴盪。\n\n那天晚上，未晞坐在房間裡，從口袋裡，掏出今天撿到的那些塑膠碎片，一顆一顆，排列在桌上。\n\n月光下，那些碎片，泛著冷冷的光。\n\n「塑膠不會消失，」她低聲說，「可是，我會記得，今天有一群孩子，為了讓這片沙灘乾淨一點點，在海風裡彎了一整天的腰。」\n\n她輕輕地，把那些碎片，收進一個小小的玻璃罐裡。\n\n「這是我在這裡，收到的最好的禮物。」\n\n夕陽下，那片海灘，終於露出了一點點原本的顏色。\n\n那天晚上，阿釁躺在床上，翻來覆去，怎麼也睡不著。\n\n腦海裡，一直迴盪著下午未晞的那一幕——\n\n「那些垃圾，比人還高！整個沙灘，全部都是垃圾！」\n\n「那就是……我們的未來……」\n\n「我們的未來？」阿釁坐起來，喃喃自語，「未晞她……怎麼會看到『未來』？」\n\n他開始回想，認識未晞以來，種種奇怪的事情。\n\n她第一次來班上，就精準預測了下午的大雨。\n\n她說得出每一道菜的產地，說得出水管三天後會漏水。\n\n她手腕上戴著一只，溜溜說「不屬於這個世界」的手環。\n\n她在公園裡，對著枯樹掉眼淚。\n\n她說，她是從一個「很遠很遠、回不去的地方」來的。\n\n她看著新聞裡的天災，會低聲說「已經開始了」。\n\n她看著垃圾、看著浪費、看著被弄髒的海，會露出那種……那種好像親眼見過這些事情發生的眼神。\n\n「該不會……」阿釁的心，怦怦直跳，「該不會未晞她，真的是……」\n\n他沒有說出那個詞。\n\n但他知道，那個詞，已經在他心裡，生了根。\n\n他又想起，上個月，他偷偷跟蹤未晞，看到她一個人蹲在公園的枯樹前。\n\n「你很痛吧。」未晞當時輕輕地，對那棵樹說，「根喝不到水，葉子曬到受不了……我懂那種感覺。」\n\n「在我們那裡，也有很多樹，像你一樣……」\n\n那個時候，阿釁以為她只是在自言自語。\n\n可是現在想起來……「我們那裡」？哪裡？\n\n還有一次，全班在看新聞，新聞播到某個國家發生大水災，所有的孩子都在驚呼，只有未晞，靜靜地看著畫面，低聲說了一句：\n\n「跟以前一樣……」\n\n「跟以前一樣？」阿釁當時沒聽懂。\n\n現在，他好像，有點懂了。\n\n「明天，我一定要問清楚！」阿釁握緊拳頭，下定決心。\n\n其實，那天晚上，阿釁還做了一件事。\n\n他偷偷摸摸地，溜回學校，找到正在通風管裡值勤的溜溜。\n\n「溜溜！溜溜！」阿釁壓低聲音，「我問你一個問題，你要老實回答我！」\n\n「嗶嗶？什麼問題？」溜溜探出頭來。\n\n「未晞手腕上那個手環，」阿釁盯著溜溜的眼睛，「你之前不是說，那個手環的頻段『不屬於這個世界』嗎？你到底知道了什麼？」\n\n溜溜沉默了。\n\n「溜溜！」阿釁追問，「你們是不是……有什麼事情瞞著我們？」\n\n「嗶嗶……」溜溜低下頭，搖了搖尾巴，「阿釁，有些事……不是我不想告訴你，是現在還不能說。」\n\n「為什麼？」\n\n「因為……」溜溜抬起頭，電子眼裡帶著前所未有的認真，「說了，會害了未晞。」\n\n阿釁愣住了。\n\n「阿釁，」溜溜輕輕說，「我知道你是為了未晞好。可是，請你相信我們。等到該說的時候，我們一定會告訴你。」\n\n阿釁沉默了很久。\n\n「……好。」他最後說，「我等。」\n\n「可是溜溜，」他補了一句，「如果有一天，未晞需要幫忙，你們一定要第一個叫我！」\n\n「嗶嗶！一言為定！」溜溜的尾巴，輕輕勾住阿釁的小指。\n\n第二天一早，阿釁早早地來到學校，堵在教室門口。\n\n「未晞！」阿釁擋在她面前，「我有話要問你！」\n\n「阿釁？」未晞愣了一下，「怎麼了？」\n\n「你昨天在沙灘上，到底看到了什麼？」阿釁直視著她的眼睛，語氣認真得不像平常的他，「你說什麼『未來的垃圾山』……你怎麼會看到那個東西？」\n\n未晞的笑容，僵住了。\n\n「阿釁，」她低下頭，聲音輕輕的，「那是……我眼花了。真的。」\n\n「你騙人！」阿釁大聲說，「我知道你不是眼花！你……你有很多事情，都跟我們不一樣！你……」\n\n「阿釁。」未晞打斷他，抬起頭，眼神裡，帶著一種讓人心疼的請求，「別問了，好嗎？」\n\n「為什麼？」\n\n「因為……」未晞的聲音，低到幾乎聽不見，「有些答案，知道了以後，就再也回不去了。」\n\n阿釁愣住了。\n\n他看著未晞那雙微微泛紅的眼睛，第一次發現，這個總是溫柔微笑的轉學生，眼睛裡，藏著一座深不見底的湖。\n\n「……好。」阿釁低下頭，悶悶地應了一句，「我不問了。」\n\n他轉身，往教室走去。\n\n走了兩步，又停下來。\n\n「可是未晞，」阿釁背對著她，聲音悶悶的，「不管你在害怕什麼，你記住——我們『守護地球作戰部隊』，有二十六個人。你的事，就是我們的事。」\n\n未晞站在走廊上，看著阿釁的背影。\n\n風，吹過她的頭髮。\n\n她低下頭，輕輕地，說了一句：\n\n「……謝謝你，阿釁。」\n\n阿釁走後，走廊轉角，晴晴靜靜地，走了出來。\n\n「你都聽到了？」溜溜從晴晴的書包裡探出頭來。\n\n「嗯。」晴晴看著未晞離開的背影，輕輕說，「阿釁他……開始起疑了。」\n\n「那怎麼辦？」溜溜緊張地問，「要告訴他真相嗎？」\n\n「還不到時候。」晴晴搖搖頭，「未晞說過，她的秘密，知道的人越少越好。可是……」\n\n「可是什麼？」\n\n「可是阿釁是我們的朋友，」晴晴低聲說，「他一直瞞著，會很辛苦吧。」\n\n「嗶嗶……」溜溜歪著頭，「班長大人，你覺得，阿釁會保守秘密嗎？」\n\n晴晴想了想，忽然笑了。\n\n「他啊，」晴晴說，「雖然平常瘋瘋癲癲的，可是該守秘密的時候，他比誰都可靠。」\n\n「那就好了！」溜溜鬆了一口氣，「那我繼續盯著那條管線！」\n\n「嗯。」晴晴點頭，「未晞的秘密，我們一起守著。」\n\n風，吹過走廊。\n\n晴晴看著窗外那片海，輕輕地，握緊了拳頭。\n\n「未晞，你放心。在你回去之前，我們會一直，站在你身邊。」\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 10: Beach Cleanup & the Plastic Crisis\n\nIn the second week of the \"Inspect the Drainage Ditch\" mission, Weixi made a suggestion.\n\n\"Instead of just waiting for the truth about the upstream,\" one day after school, Weixi stood at the back of the classroom, gazing at that murky gray sea outside the window, \"let's start with what we can see.\"\n\n\"What we can see?\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"That beach.\" Weixi pointed at the sandy shore beyond the seawall behind the school, \"Have you ever looked closely at what that beach looks like now?\"\n\nThe children looked at each other.\n\nThat beach, they saw it every day. But honestly... it seemed no one had ever really looked at it closely.\n\n\"Let's go see.\" Weixi said.\n\nSo the next day after school, all twenty-six of Class 6-1, plus Liu-Liu, marched in a grand procession over the seawall and stepped onto that beach for the first time.\n\nThen, everyone froze.\n\nThe beach was densely littered with all kinds of trash.\n\nPET bottles, bottle caps, straws, plastic bags, Styrofoam fragments, drink cans, slippers, fishing nets, ropes... stretching from under their feet all the way to the edge of sight, as if someone had deliberately dumped an entire landfill here.\n\n\"This...\" A-Xin's eyes went wide, \"this is way too much! How is there so much trash behind our school?!\"\n\n\"This trash,\" Weixi crouched down and picked up a PET bottle bleached white by seawater, her voice soft, \"for the most part, didn't come from the school. It floated down from the rivers upstream; it was thrown overboard from ships at sea; it was carried here by ocean currents from the other side of the ocean.\"\n\n\"The other side of the ocean?\" Old Wu blinked, \"How far is that?\"\n\n\"Maybe thousands of kilometers away.\" Weixi said, \"The wind blows them out to sea, and the sea brings them here. Every piece of trash we pick up may have traveled halfway around the world.\"\n\n\"Halfway around the world...\" Lin Yunyun crouched on the sand, carefully picking up a bottle cap, murmuring in repetition.\n\n\"Then what do we do?\" Wang Zhuankai asked, \"There's so much trash. Can twenty-six of us really pick it all up?\"\n\n\"We can't pick it all up.\" Weixi shook her head, but her tone was firm, \"But as long as we pick up a handful, this beach gets a little cleaner.\"\n\n\"Right!\" Qingqing stood up and said loudly, \"'Protect Earth' new mission: 'Beach Cleanup'! Each of us takes responsibility for cleaning the little patch of beach in front of us!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\" The children responded in unison.\n\nThe next day was Saturday, overcast, with a salty sea wind that made people shiver.\n\nBut at nine in the morning, at the gate of Luyang Elementary, twenty-six children stood in full gear, wrapped in coats, wearing masks.\n\n\"Everyone got everything?\" Qingqing called the roll.\n\n\"Gloves!\" \"Tongs!\" \"Trash bags!\" \"Water bottles!\" \"Hats!\" The children counted off one by one.\n\n\"And the most important thing!\" A-Xin pulled a small flag made of yellow plastic cloth from his backpack and planted it in the direction of the beach, \"'The Beach Cleanup Battle Flag'! Move out!\"\n\n\"Whoo—!\"\n\nThe twenty-six children, like a tiny army, marched in a grand procession over the seawall and set out for that beach.\n\nAnd so, a \"Beach Cleanup Campaign\" officially began on the beach behind the school.\n\nThe children brought gloves, tongs, and trash bags. A-Xin had even somehow gotten hold of a construction hard hat, which he wore on his head as he directed operations with great ceremony.\n\n\"Everyone to your posts! Sort the trash! PET bottles go in this bag! Bottle caps in this bag! Other trash in that bag! Sort it wrong, and Liu-Liu will return it!\"\n\n\"Beep beep! Roger!\" Liu-Liu dashed around the beach like a strict overseer, \"This beach is our 'battlefield'!\"\n\n\"Battlefield?\" Old Wu picked up a slipper that had rotted in the seawater and held it over his head, \"Then this slipper is my 'war trophy'!\"\n\n\"Yours is nothing!\" A-Xin refused to be outdone, digging a fishing line tangled with seaweed out of the sand, \"Mine here is a 'sea monster tentacle'!\"\n\n\"That fishing line of yours,\" Qingqing walked over, frowning, \"if it gets tangled around a sea turtle's neck, the turtle will die! The news reported that sea turtles get entangled in plastic and grow up with deformed shells!\"\n\n\"Really?!\" A-Xin's eyes went wide, and he immediately and carefully put the fishing line into the trash bag, \"Then I'm going to 'execute' it! Avenge the sea turtle!\"\n\nThe children picked as they chattered.\n\n\"Hey, look at this!\" Wang Zhuankai picked up a straw, \"This little straw—if it gets thrown into the sea, how long before it disappears?\"\n\n\"A hundred years,\" Weixi said softly, \"or longer.\"\n\n\"A hundred years?!\" Wang Zhuankai gasped, \"A hundred years from now, I'll already be...\"\n\n\"Already be a grandpa!\" A-Xin laughed heartily, \"And your straw will still be lying in the sea!\"\n\n\"That can't be!\" Wang Zhuankai clutched the straw, his expression as serious as a declaration of war, \"I absolutely refuse to let my straw outlive me!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed together.\n\n\"Oh right, oh right! Everyone come look at this!\" Old Wu suddenly shouted, running over holding a strange object, \"I dug up an 'antique'!\"\n\n\"Antique?\" The children gathered around to look—it was a rusted iron can, with the word \"soda\" still faintly legible on it.\n\n\"Wow! This is a soda can from at least thirty years ago!\" A-Xin's eyes went wide, \"Old Wu, you're rich! You can sell this to a museum!\"\n\n\"Sell it to a museum, my foot!\" Qingqing laughed helplessly, \"It's trash! Put it in 'metal'!\"\n\n\"Oh!\" Old Wu obediently placed the \"antique\" into the sorting bag, muttering as he did, \"A thirty-year-old soda can... the person who drank it back then surely never imagined that thirty years later, an elementary school student would find it on the beach...\"\n\n\"So you see,\" Weixi walked over and said softly, \"nothing we throw away ever truly disappears. It stays in this world, waiting to be seen again one day, by someone.\"\n\nThe children fell silent.\n\n\"Then we'll pick up more!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"Bring all those 'waiting-to-be-seen' pieces of trash 'home'!\"\n\n\"Right!\" The children responded in unison.\n\n\"Oh! Look what I found!\" Lin Yunyun held up a small, faded toy car, \"This little car... must have been lost by some child by accident.\"\n\n\"Maybe it drifted over from far out at sea!\" Old Wu leaned in, \"It might have traveled around the world once!\"\n\n\"Then let's grant its wish!\" A-Xin carefully placed the toy car into the bag, \"Let it stay on the beach and wait for its owner to come back and find it!\"\n\n\"A-Xin, since when did you get so sentimental?\" Qingqing laughed helplessly.\n\n\"I've always been sentimental!\" A-Xin declared with full confidence, \"I just don't show it usually!\"\n\n\"You clearly just can't bear to throw away a toy!\" Old Wu teased.\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed together.\n\n\"Classmates,\" Weixi suddenly spoke, her voice soft, \"did you know? Someone did the statistics—the amount of plastic trash flowing into the ocean every year worldwide is a full eight million tons.\"\n\n\"Eight million tons?!\" The children's eyes went wide.\n\n\"What does eight million tons even mean?\" Weixi thought for a moment, \"Roughly... every single minute, one truckload of plastic is dumped into the sea.\"\n\n\"Every minute?!\" A-Xin gasped, \"Then in the few minutes we've been talking, several more truckloads of plastic have been dumped into the sea?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded softly, \"But the seventy-six kilograms we picked up today were snatched back from those 'every minutes.'\"\n\n\"Snatched back...\" The children looked at those trash bags, and a nameless light suddenly appeared in their eyes.\n\n\"So we have to keep snatching!\" A-Xin said loudly.\n\n\"Keep snatching!\" The children responded in unison.\n\nHalfway through the cleanup, Liu-Liu came running back panting, carrying a small bag in its mouth.\n\n\"Beep beep! The statistics are out!\" Liu-Liu dumped the bag onto the sand, \"In the last hour, our class picked up—one hundred forty-seven PET bottles! Two hundred thirty-one bottle caps! Fifty-eight straws! Forty-two plastic bags! Styrofoam... too many to count! Total weight: twenty-three kilograms!\"\n\n\"Twenty-three kilograms!\" The children gasped, \"In just one hour?!\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Liu-Liu nodded, \"And I scanned it—over eighty percent of this trash is 'plastic.'\"\n\n\"Plastic...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"Plastic never disappears.\" Weixi crouched on the sand, looking at the trash, her voice soft, \"It only becomes smaller and smaller fragments. Small enough to be invisible, small enough to be eaten by fish, small enough to...\" she paused, \"small enough that, in the end, we eat it back into our own bodies.\"\n\nThe beach suddenly fell quiet.\n\nThe sea wind howled past, whipping the children's hair wildly.\n\n\"Weixi?\" A-Xin was the first to notice something wrong with her, calling out carefully, \"Are... are you okay?\"\n\nActually, from the moment she stepped onto this beach, Weixi had been a little unusual.\n\nShe walked across the sand unlike the other children, who darted about everywhere; she moved especially slowly, each step as if treading on something very fragile.\n\nShe would crouch down, staring for a very long time at the tiny plastic fragments embedded in the sand, then pick them up one by one.\n\n\"Weixi, what are you picking up?\" Lin Yunyun leaned in curiously.\n\n\"These... plastic fragments.\" Weixi said softly, \"They're so small that no one pays attention to them. But they're the biggest problem.\"\n\n\"The biggest problem?\" Lin Yunyun didn't understand.\n\n\"Big trash gets picked up. But these tiny fragments,\" Weixi opened her palm, the tiny, colorful plastic fragments glinting in the sunlight, \"stay in the sand forever, seep into the water, get eaten by fish, and then...\" she didn't finish, just gently put the fragments into her pocket.\n\n\"And then?\" Lin Yunyun pressed.\n\n\"And then,\" Weixi's voice suddenly grew weak, \"they become...\"\n\nHer voice stopped abruptly.\n\nHer whole body stiffened in place, as if struck by something.\n\nThen her pupils suddenly dilated.\n\n\"Weixi!\" Qingqing also noticed something wrong and rushed over, \"What's wrong?! Your face...\"\n\n\"I...\" Weixi's voice suddenly began to tremble, \"I see...\"\n\n\"See what?\" A-Xin asked nervously.\n\n\"I see...\" Weixi trembled, reaching out a hand to point at the beach before her, \"that beach...\"\n\n\"What about this beach?\" The children looked at each other, \"This beach... isn't it just like this?\"\n\n\"No!\" Weixi shook her head violently, her voice choked with tears, \"Can't you see it?! That trash... that trash is taller than people! The whole beach is nothing but trash! Black water... and the sky is gray too...\"\n\n\"Weixi!\" Qingqing grabbed her shoulder, \"Calm down! There's no trash taller than people here! There's only the twenty-three kilograms we just picked up!\"\n\n\"But...\" Weixi's tears fell without warning, \"I saw it... I really saw it... that is... that is our future...\"\n\n\"Weixi!\" A-Xin also rushed over, blocking himself in front of her, shouting, \"Look at me! Look at me! There's no trash mountain here! There's only us! Only the twenty-six of us, and this beach!\"\n\nWeixi stared blankly at A-Xin.\n\nHer pupils slowly refocused.\n\n\"...A-Xin?\" she said softly.\n\n\"Yes! It's me!\" A-Xin breathed a sigh of relief, \"Did you just see something scary?\"\n\nWeixi fell silent.\n\nShe lowered her head, tears falling drop by drop onto the sand.\n\n\"...I'm sorry.\" She sniffled, forcing a smile, \"I'm fine. I just... saw some...\" She shook her head, \"Nothing. Really, nothing.\"\n\n\"But you clearly just—\" A-Xin wanted to press further.\n\n\"A-Xin!\" Qingqing interrupted him, shaking her head, \"Don't ask.\"\n\nA-Xin opened his mouth, but finally closed it.\n\nBut looking at Weixi's pale face, still streaked with tears, an unprecedented question welled up in his heart.\n\nAn hour later, the beach cleanup came to an end.\n\nThe twenty-six children stood in a row on the beach, before them a neat line of trash bags.\n\n\"Final tally!\" Liu-Liu announced loudly, \"For this beach cleanup, our class collected a total of—seventy-six kilograms of trash!\"\n\n\"Seventy-six kilograms?!\" The children exclaimed.\n\n\"Three hundred eighty-nine PET bottles!\" Liu-Liu continued, \"Five hundred seventy-three bottle caps! One hundred twenty-nine straws! Ninety-eight plastic bags! Plus fishing nets, slippers, lighters, toothbrushes... every kind you can imagine!\"\n\n\"Look,\" Qingqing pointed at those trash bags, \"twenty-six of us, in one afternoon, carried seventy-six kilograms of trash off this beach! If we come every month, in a year...\"\n\n\"We can pick up over nine hundred kilograms!\" A-Xin calculated eagerly, \"Nearly one ton!\"\n\n\"Nearly one ton of trash!\" The children looked at each other, light shining in their eyes.\n\n\"Starting today,\" Qingqing announced loudly, \"we come to clean the beach every month!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\"\n\nThe children cheered and carried the trash bags, one by one, back to the school and handed them to the sanitation crew.\n\n\"Today,\" Qingqing stood on the seawall, looking at the children, and asked loudly, \"are you all tired?\"\n\n\"Tired—!\" The children answered in unison, but with laughter in their voices.\n\n\"But are you happy?\"\n\n\"Happy—!\"\n\n\"Why are you happy?\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"Because we made the beach cleaner!\" The children shouted in unison.\n\n\"Right!\" Qingqing said loudly, \"This beach is our turf! We won't let trash bully our beach!\"\n\n\"Never!\" The children shouted along.\n\nThe sea wind howled, and the children's cries echoed across the sea.\n\nThat night, Weixi sat in her room, pulling today's plastic fragments from her pocket, laying them out one by one on the table.\n\nIn the moonlight, those fragments glinted with a cold light.\n\n\"Plastic never disappears,\" she said softly, \"but I will remember that today, a group of children bent their backs in the sea wind all day just to make this beach a little cleaner.\"\n\nGently, she put those fragments into a small glass jar.\n\n\"This is the best gift I've received here.\"\n\nUnder the setting sun, that beach finally revealed a little of its original color.\n\nThat night, A-Xin lay in bed, tossing and turning, unable to fall asleep.\n\nIn his mind, the scene of Weixi this afternoon kept echoing—\n\n\"That trash is taller than people! The whole beach is nothing but trash!\"\n\n\"That is... our future...\"\n\n\"Our future?\" A-Xin sat up and murmured, \"How does Weixi... see the 'future'?\"\n\nHe began to recall all the strange things that had happened since he met Weixi.\n\nOn her first day in class, she accurately predicted the heavy rain that afternoon.\n\nShe could name the origin of every dish, and say that a pipe would leak three days later.\n\nShe wore a bracelet on her wrist that Liu-Liu said \"doesn't belong to this world.\"\n\nIn the park, she wept before a withered tree.\n\nShe said she came from a \"very, very faraway place, a place she could never go back to.\"\n\nWatching disasters in the news, she would whisper \"it's already begun.\"\n\nLooking at trash, at waste, at the dirtied sea, she would get that look... that look of someone who had seen these things happen with her own eyes.\n\n\"Could it be...\" A-Xin's heart pounded, \"could Weixi really be...\"\n\nHe didn't say the word.\n\nBut he knew that word had already taken root in his heart.\n\nHe remembered again—last month, he secretly followed Weixi and saw her crouching alone before the withered tree in the park.\n\n\"It hurts, doesn't it.\" Weixi had said softly to the tree, \"The roots can't drink water, the leaves can't stand the sun... I know that feeling.\"\n\n\"In our place, there are also many trees, just like you...\"\n\nBack then, A-Xin thought she was just talking to herself.\n\nBut thinking about it now... \"our place\"? Where?\n\nAnd once, when the whole class was watching the news about a major flood in some country, all the children gasped—only Weixi watched the screen quietly and murmured:\n\n\"Just like before...\"\n\n\"Just like before?\" A-Xin hadn't understood at the time.\n\nNow, he thought he might understand, a little.\n\n\"Tomorrow, I'm definitely going to ask her!\" A-Xin clenched his fist, his mind made up.\n\nActually, that night, A-Xin did one more thing.\n\nHe sneaked back to school and found Liu-Liu on duty in the ventilation duct.\n\n\"Liu-Liu! Liu-Liu!\" A-Xin lowered his voice, \"I want to ask you something, and you have to answer honestly!\"\n\n\"Beep beep? What question?\" Liu-Liu poked its head out.\n\n\"That bracelet on Weixi's wrist,\" A-Xin stared into Liu-Liu's eyes, \"didn't you say before that its frequency band 'doesn't belong to this world'? What exactly do you know?\"\n\nLiu-Liu fell silent.\n\n\"Liu-Liu!\" A-Xin pressed, \"Are you all... hiding something from us?\"\n\n\"Beep beep...\" Liu-Liu lowered its head and wagged its tail, \"A-Xin, some things... it's not that I don't want to tell you, it's that I can't tell you yet.\"\n\n\"Why?\"\n\n\"Because...\" Liu-Liu looked up, unprecedented seriousness in its electronic eyes, \"telling you would harm Weixi.\"\n\nA-Xin was stunned.\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Liu-Liu said softly, \"I know you mean well for Weixi. But please, trust us. When it's time to tell, we will definitely tell you.\"\n\nA-Xin was silent for a long time.\n\n\"...Fine.\" he finally said, \"I'll wait.\"\n\n\"But Liu-Liu,\" he added, \"if one day Weixi needs help, you must call me first!\"\n\n\"Beep beep! It's a deal!\" Liu-Liu's tail gently hooked around A-Xin's pinky.\n\nThe next morning, A-Xin arrived at school early and planted himself at the classroom door.\n\n\"Weixi!\" A-Xin blocked her way, \"I have something to ask you!\"\n\n\"A-Xin?\" Weixi blinked, \"What's wrong?\"\n\n\"What did you really see on the beach yesterday?\" A-Xin looked straight into her eyes, his tone serious in a way unlike his usual self, \"You talked about a 'future trash mountain'... how could you see something like that?\"\n\nWeixi's smile froze.\n\n\"A-Xin,\" she lowered her head, her voice soft, \"that was... my eyes playing tricks on me. Really.\"\n\n\"You're lying!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"I know you're not seeing things! You... you have so many things about you that are different from us! You...\"\n\n\"A-Xin.\" Weixi interrupted him, looked up, and in her eyes was a plea that pained the heart, \"Don't ask, okay?\"\n\n\"Why?\"\n\n\"Because...\" Weixi's voice was so low it was almost inaudible, \"some answers, once you know them, you can never go back.\"\n\nA-Xin was stunned.\n\nHe looked at Weixi's slightly reddened eyes and, for the first time, discovered that this transfer student, who always smiled so gently, had a bottomless lake hidden in her eyes.\n\n\"...Fine.\" A-Xin lowered his head and answered with a muffled voice, \"I won't ask.\"\n\nHe turned and walked toward the classroom.\n\nAfter two steps, he stopped again.\n\n\"But Weixi,\" A-Xin said with his back to her, his voice muffled, \"whatever you're afraid of, remember this—our 'Protect Earth Operations Unit' has twenty-six people. Your matters are our matters.\"\n\nWeixi stood in the hallway, watching A-Xin's back.\n\nThe wind blew through her hair.\n\nShe lowered her head and said softly:\n\n\"...Thank you, A-Xin.\"\n\nAfter A-Xin left, from the corner of the hallway, Qingqing stepped out quietly.\n\n\"You heard all that?\" Liu-Liu poked its head out of Qingqing's backpack.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Qingqing watched the back of Weixi as she walked away, and said softly, \"A-Xin... is starting to suspect.\"\n\n\"Then what do we do?\" Liu-Liu asked nervously, \"Should we tell him the truth?\"\n\n\"Not yet.\" Qingqing shook her head, \"Weixi said the fewer people who know her secret, the better. But...\"\n\n\"But what?\"\n\n\"But A-Xin is our friend,\" Qingqing said in a low voice, \"keeping it from him... must be hard for him.\"\n\n\"Beep beep...\" Liu-Liu tilted its head, \"Class President, do you think A-Xin can keep a secret?\"\n\nQingqing thought for a moment, then suddenly smiled.\n\n\"Him,\" Qingqing said, \"he's crazy most of the time, but when it comes to keeping a secret, he's more reliable than anyone.\"\n\n\"Then that's settled!\" Liu-Liu breathed a sigh of relief, \"Then I'll keep watching that pipe!\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Qingqing nodded, \"Weixi's secret—we'll guard it together.\"\n\nThe wind blew across the hallway.\n\nQingqing looked at the sea outside the window and gently clenched her fist.\n\n\"Weixi, don't worry. Before you go back, we'll always be standing by your side.\"\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":3,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第十一章：溜溜的異常偵測\n\n淨灘行動結束後的一個星期，六年一班的教室裡，出現了一個小小的「異常」——溜溜不見了。\n\n不是真的不見。牠每天還是準時出現在教室裡，但是行蹤變得神祕兮兮的：常常一個不注意，牠就溜出教室，等到下課鐘響才「嗖」地一聲，從通風管裡鑽回來，電子眼裡跳動著密密麻麻的數據。\n\n「溜溜，你最近在忙什麼？」阿釁湊過去問。\n\n「嗶嗶！沒什麼！例行巡邏！」溜溜理直氣壯地挺起胸膛，「我可是『情報與宣傳突擊隊』的隊長！巡邏是我的本分！」\n\n「可是你以前巡邏都會帶宣傳海報回來，」阿釁狐疑地盯著牠，「現在怎麼什麼都沒帶？」\n\n「嗶……這個嘛……」溜溜的眼神飄了一下，「我、我最近比較注重『內部安全』！對！內部安全！」\n\n阿釁皺起眉頭，總覺得哪裡不對勁，但又說不上來。\n\n他當然不知道——溜溜這幾天，其實一直在做一件事：沿著學校後方那條排水溝，一點一點地，往上游飛。\n\n「嗶嗶……十一月十二日，排水溝異味指數：五十三。比上週上升百分之九。」\n\n「十一月十五日，異味指數：六十一。水色開始轉濁。」\n\n「十一月十八日，異味指數：七十。水面上出現白色泡沫……」\n\n「十一月二十日，」溜溜停在排水溝上空，電子眼裡的數據瘋狂跳動，「異味指數：八十二。水色：灰綠色。PH值：四點七——這是強酸啊！」\n\n溜溜的尾巴，一根一根地炸了開來。\n\n「這條溝的水，已經不能叫『水』了！」溜溜壓低聲音，語氣裡帶著前所未有的凝重，「而且，排放還在繼續！」\n\n第二天，溜溜又飛到入海口。\n\n「嗶嗶……異味指數：五十八。水色：開始轉濁。」溜溜記下數據，正要回頭，電子眼忽然捕捉到水面上的異樣——「那是……」\n\n入海口附近的淺灘上，躺著幾條翻了肚的小魚，一動不動。\n\n「魚……死了？」溜溜飛過去，小心翼翼地掃描，「體表無外傷……體內……天啊，牠們的鰓，是灰色的！」\n\n「這種顏色……」溜溜的資料庫裡，跳出一個可怕的關鍵字，「重金屬中毒？」\n\n牠不死心，沿著淺灘又飛了一圈。\n\n越飛，心越涼。\n\n淺灘的角落裡，還有更多翻肚的小魚，夾雜著死掉的蝦子。牠們靜靜地躺在灰黃色的水裡，像是被這個世界，悄悄遺忘了一樣。\n\n「這不是自然死亡，」溜溜壓低聲音，電子眼裡都是不忍，「這是……被毒死的。」\n\n牠沿著排水溝，飛到三公里外，那個牠在地圖上畫了記號的地方。\n\n那是一條隱藏在雜草叢中的管線，從工業區的方向延伸過來，直接插入排水溝。\n\n管線的盡頭，正源源不絕地，吐著灰綠色的液體。\n\n「……又變快了。」溜溜記下數據，「這條管線的排放量，比上星期增加了百分之四十。到底是誰，在往我們的海裡排這些東西？」\n\n那天傍晚，放學後。\n\n溜溜沒有回家，而是叼著一份數據報告，鑽進了體育器材室——那是祕密同盟的「指揮部」。\n\n晴晴已經等在那裡了。\n\n「溜溜，」晴晴壓低聲音，「這幾天的偵察結果，怎麼樣？」\n\n溜溜把那份數據報告，攤在器材箱上。\n\n「很糟。」溜溜的聲音，難得地沉重，「排水溝的水質，一天比一天糟。異味指數從五十三，一路飆到八十二。水色變濁，出現泡沫，PH值只剩下四點七。」\n\n「PH值四點七……」晴晴倒抽一口涼氣，「那是強酸性！這種水如果流進海裡，海裡的生物……」\n\n「會死。」溜溜說，「我偵測到，排水溝入海口附近的海水，已經開始變色了。再這樣下去，第一個遭殃的，就是那片我們剛剛淨灘的沙灘。」\n\n晴晴沉默了。\n\n她想起那片沙灘，想起孩子們撿起七十六公斤垃圾時的笑容。\n\n「……這條管線，到底是誰的？」晴晴問。\n\n「我查過了。」溜溜搖頭，「那條管線，沒有登記在任何地圖上。它隱藏在雜草裡，從工業區的方向延伸過來。我沿著管線往工業區飛，聞到了……」溜溜頓了頓，「很重的化學味。還有，金屬的味道。」\n\n「金屬？」晴晴皺起眉頭。\n\n「嗯。」溜溜點頭，「像重金屬。電鍍廠、染整廠，那種地方，常常有這種味道。」\n\n「重金屬……」晴晴的心，沉了下去。\n\n「班長大人，」溜溜的聲音，帶著前所未有的認真，「我們要告訴大家嗎？」\n\n晴晴想了很久。\n\n「還不行。」她最後搖搖頭，「未晞說過，在我們找到確切的證據之前，先不要驚動大家。而且……」她停了一下，「她說，她好像……知道這條管線是什麼時候開始的。」\n\n「未晞知道？」溜溜瞪大眼睛。\n\n「嗯。」晴晴低下頭，聲音輕輕的，「她只跟我說了一句話——『跟我記得的時間，一模一樣。』」\n\n溜溜沉默了。\n\n「那我們現在……」溜溜低聲問，「只能繼續偵察？」\n\n「繼續偵察。」晴晴點頭，「但是，我們要開始準備了。我有預感，這件事……很快就會包不住了。」\n\n其實，周嚴主任也注意到了學校的異常。\n\n「這兩個星期，飲水機的水質異常？」校長室裡，周嚴主任翻著保健室的紀錄，眉頭緊鎖。\n\n「嗯。」邱校長端著茶杯，表情難得地嚴肅，「十幾個孩子肚子不舒服，自來水公司卻說水質合格。這中間，一定有什麼地方不對勁。」\n\n「我懷疑，問題不在飲水機。」周嚴主任說。\n\n「哦？」\n\n「學校後面那條排水溝。」周嚴主任放下紀錄，語氣低沉，「我這幾天，注意到那條溝的水，顏色不太對。還有入海口……」他停頓了一下，「我去看過了，有死魚。」\n\n「死魚？」邱校長的手，微微一抖。\n\n「校長，」周嚴主任站起來，「我想去查一查，那條排水溝的上游，到底連著哪裡。」\n\n邱校長沉默了很久，最後，重重地點了頭：「……去查吧。該負責的，一個都不能放過。」\n\n接下來的日子，學校裡，陸陸續續地，出現了一些奇怪的變化。\n\n第一個發現的，是老巫。\n\n「唉！你們有沒有覺得，」某天中午，老巫捧著水壺，皺著鼻子，「學校飲水機的水，味道好像怪怪的？」\n\n「怪怪的？」阿釁湊過去，也喝了一口，「有嗎？不就是普通的水嗎？」\n\n「不是！」老巫搖頭，「有一種……說不上來的味道。像消毒水，又不像消毒水。總之，就是跟以前不一樣！」\n\n「是你鼻子壞了吧！」阿釁哈哈大笑，「你剛才不是吃了兩碗滷肉飯嗎？味道都被蓋過去了！」\n\n「我才沒壞！」老巫不服氣，「我們家狗都聞得出來！」\n\n「你們家哪有狗！」\n\n「我是說『我們家隔壁的狗』！」\n\n孩子們笑成一團。\n\n只有坐在窗邊的未晞，沒有笑。\n\n她捧著自己的水壺，靜靜地，看著窗外那條排水溝的方向。\n\n「……開始了。」她用幾不可聞的聲音說。\n\n「未晞，你說什麼？」林芸芸回頭問。\n\n「沒有。」未晞搖搖頭，把水壺蓋上，「我只是在想……我們是不是應該，讓大家注意一下學校的水。」\n\n「學校的水？」林芸芸疑惑，「水怎麼了？」\n\n「沒什麼。」未晞又搖了搖頭，「我只是……隨便說說。」\n\n然而，未晞「隨便說說」的話，卻在兩天後，應驗了。\n\n那天早上，六年一班的教室裡，傳來一陣驚慌的尖叫。\n\n「啊——！有人吐了！」\n\n「怎麼回事？！」\n\n「是阿達！六年二班的陳阿達！他剛剛在教室門口吐了！」\n\n孩子們議論紛紛。連隔壁班的陳阿達，臉色蒼白地被送去了保健室。\n\n「醫生說，可能是腸胃炎。」晴晴的媽媽在電話裡告訴她，「學校最近，有幾個學生陸續肚子不舒服，保健室的老師說，好像都是喝了飲水機的水之後開始的。」\n\n「飲水機的水？」晴晴的心，猛地一跳。\n\n「對啊，」晴晴媽媽繼續說，「聽學校說，已經請人來檢查水質了。希望沒什麼大事……」\n\n晴晴掛掉電話，看向窗外。\n\n排水溝的方向，灰濛濛的。\n\n她的心裡，湧起一個不好的預感。\n\n下午，保健室裡。\n\n「晴晴，」保健室的老師看著手上的記錄，皺起眉頭，「這兩個星期，全校陸續有十幾個小朋友，因為肚子不舒服來找我。」\n\n「十幾個？」晴晴驚訝地問。\n\n「嗯。」保健室老師點頭，「症狀都差不多：喝了飲水機的水之後，開始肚子痛、噁心。學校已經請自來水公司的人來檢查了，可是……」她嘆了一口氣，「檢查結果說，學校的水質，符合標準。」\n\n「符合標準？」晴晴皺起眉頭。\n\n「對啊，」老師無奈地說，「自來水公司說，水質檢驗全部合格。所以……學校暫時也只能繼續觀察。」\n\n「可是，如果問題不是出在飲水機呢？」一個輕輕的聲音，從保健室門口傳來。\n\n是未晞。\n\n「不是飲水機？」保健室老師疑惑，「那是什麼？」\n\n「學校的飲水機，用的是自來水。」未晞走進來，聲音輕輕的，卻很清楚，「可是，學校後面那條排水溝，還有入海口的海水——它們的水質，已經變了。」\n\n「排水溝？」保健室老師愣住，「那跟學校飲水機有什麼關係？」\n\n「暫時沒有關係。」未晞搖搖頭，「可是，如果放任不管，它總有一天，會跟我們的生活有關係。因為……」她看向窗外，「我們喝的水，跟我們丟的東西，最後都是相通的。」\n\n保健室老師沉默了一會。\n\n「妳這個轉學生，」她看著未晞，語氣裡帶著好奇，「說話怎麼像個大人一樣？」\n\n未晞沒有回答，只是微微笑了。\n\n走出保健室，晴晴追上未晞。\n\n「未晞，你是不是……知道些什麼？」晴晴壓低聲音問。\n\n未晞停下腳步。\n\n「晴晴，」她轉過身，眼神裡帶著一種說不出的複雜，「那條管線，我其實……一直都知道。」\n\n「什麼？！」晴晴瞪大眼睛，「你早就知道了？！那為什麼……」\n\n「因為……」未晞低下頭，「我在我的時代，聽過這個故事。有一條河，被附近工廠排出的廢水污染了，河水變色，魚群死亡。大人們花了幾十年，才讓那條河恢復。可是……」\n\n「可是什麼？」\n\n「可是那個時代的人，」未晞的聲音，輕得像一聲嘆息，「卻已經不記得，那條河原本是什麼樣子了。」\n\n而就在同一天，溜溜也傳回了更糟的消息。\n\n「班長大人！緊急報告！」溜溜從通風管裡鑽出來，聲音都在發抖，「我剛剛沿著排水溝飛到入海口，發現——海水變色了！」\n\n「什麼？！」晴晴瞪大了眼睛。\n\n「入海口附近的海水，」溜溜的電子眼裡，跳動著觸目驚心的數據，「從原本的藍綠色，變成了一種……說不上來的灰黃色！而且，我偵測到，有魚群在附近翻肚！」\n\n「魚……」晴晴的臉色，一下子白了。\n\n「那條管線，」溜溜的聲音越來越急，「排放量又增加了！比上星期，多了一倍！」\n\n「多了一倍？！」晴晴幾乎是喊出來的，「為什麼會突然……」\n\n「我不知道！」溜溜急得團團轉，「可是，這樣下去，那片我們淨灘的沙灘，很快就會被污染的海水淹過！」\n\n晴晴深吸一口氣，強迫自己冷靜下來。\n\n「溜溜，」她壓低聲音，「這條管線，到底是什麼時候開始排放的？」\n\n「我查過之前的數據！」溜溜打開偵察日記，「排水溝的異味，第一次被偵測到，是在……」\n\n溜溜的聲音，忽然頓住了。\n\n「是在什麼時候？」晴晴追問。\n\n「是在……」溜溜顫抖著，讀出那行記錄，「十月十二日。」\n\n「十月十二日……」晴晴喃喃重複著，「那不就是……」\n\n「不就是未晞轉學過來的那一天嗎？」溜溜的聲音，輕得像一片羽毛。\n\n器材室裡，忽然安靜得可怕。\n\n晴晴和溜溜，互相看著對方。\n\n「這不是巧合吧？」溜溜低聲問。\n\n「……」晴晴沒有回答，但她握著數據報告的手，微微發抖。\n\n如果這一切不是巧合……\n\n那未晞，到底還隱瞞了多少事情？\n\n放學後，阿釁做了一件他自己都覺得有點「變態」的事——他開始跟蹤溜溜。\n\n「溜溜最近太奇怪了，」阿釁趴在走廊欄杆上，看著溜溜「嗖」地一聲鑽進排水溝方向，「牠一定有什麼事情瞞著我們！我倒要看看，牠每天偷偷摸摸地，到底在幹嘛！」\n\n阿釁躡手躡腳地，跟在溜溜後面，一路溜到學校後方的海堤邊。\n\n然後，他看到了這一幕——\n\n溜溜蹲在排水溝的入海口，電子眼裡射出藍色的掃描光線，對著水面掃來掃去，嘴裡還唸唸有詞：\n\n「異味指數……九十一。重金屬濃度……超標六倍。水色……灰黃。這下糟了，這下真的糟了……」\n\n其實，阿釁在跳出來之前，已經躲在草叢裡，看了很久很久。\n\n他看到那條灰黃色的排水溝水，一路流進入海口。\n\n他看到淺灘上，那些翻了肚的死魚。\n\n他看到海水變色的那一圈，正在一點一點地擴大。\n\n「這……」阿釁躲在草叢裡，手心全是冷汗，「這是怎麼回事？這條溝，以前不是這樣的……」\n\n他想起，幾個月前，大家還說這只是「學校後方那條臭臭的水溝」；想起未晞第一次聽到「排水溝」三個字時，那張慘白的臉。\n\n「原來是這樣，」阿釁喃喃自語，「未晞她……早就知道會有這一天。」\n\n他握緊拳頭，深吸一口氣，然後——\n\n「溜溜！」阿釁從草叢裡跳出來，「你在這裡做什麼？！」\n\n「哇——！」溜溜嚇得尾巴炸開，電子眼裡都是驚恐，「阿、阿釁？！你怎麼在這裡？！」\n\n「我當然要來！」阿釁雙手叉腰，「你每天鬼鬼祟祟的，不是在教室，就是往這裡跑！你到底在幹嘛？！」\n\n「我……我在……」溜溜緊張得結結巴巴，「我在……觀察生態！對！觀察生態！大自然真美麗！」\n\n「你騙鬼！」阿釁指著入海口那灘灰黃色的水，「這水都變成這樣了，你跟我說『大自然真美麗』？！你剛剛說的『異味指數九十一』、『重金屬超標六倍』是什麼意思？！」\n\n溜溜沉默了。\n\n牠低下頭，尾巴垂下來。\n\n「阿釁……」溜溜的聲音，帶著滿滿的為難，「這件事……我真的不能說。至少現在還不能。」\n\n「又是這句話！」阿釁忍不住大聲說，「上次你說『說了會害了未晞』！這次又是什麼？！是不是跟未晞有關係？！」\n\n溜溜的電子眼，猛地閃了一下。\n\n「……你猜到了？」溜溜低聲問。\n\n「我早就猜到了！」阿釁蹲下來，直視著溜溜的眼睛，「溜溜，我不是笨蛋！未晞有秘密，你們有秘密，我都知道！我只是……」\n\n「只是什麼？」\n\n「只是想知道，」阿釁的聲音，第一次帶著懇求，「這些秘密，是不是跟我們班的『大作戰』有關係？是不是跟這條臭水溝、這片被弄髒的海有關係？」\n\n溜溜沉默了很長、很長時間。\n\n最後，牠輕輕開口：\n\n「阿釁，你聽過一句話嗎？」\n\n「什麼話？」\n\n「『知道的越多，肩上的擔子就越重。』」溜溜說，「晴晴和未晞，不是不想告訴你，是怕……把你也捲進來。」\n\n「捲進來？」阿釁愣了一下，「什麼捲進來？」\n\n「……」溜溜沒有回答，只是低下頭。\n\n阿釁看著溜溜那副欲言又止的模樣，沉默了很久。\n\n「溜溜，」他最後說，「你聽好。不管你們在守著什麼秘密，不管那個秘密有多可怕——我阿釁，從來不是會被『捲進來』的人，我是『自己跳進來』的人！」\n\n「你們守著秘密，我幫你們一起守！」\n\n「可是，」阿釁認真地看著溜溜，「如果有一天，未晞需要有人站在她身邊——你們絕對不能把我排除在外！這是我們的約定！」\n\n溜溜的電子眼裡，閃爍著複雜的光芒。\n\n「……阿釁，」牠低聲說，「你真的，很夠朋友。」\n\n「那當然！」阿釁挺起胸膛，「我可是『植樹認養突擊隊』的隊長！」\n\n那天深夜，溜溜最後一次，飛到那條管線的上空。\n\n月光下，管線依然在吐著灰綠色的液體。\n\n溜溜記下最後一筆數據，然後，飛回學校。\n\n「班長大人，」溜溜鑽進體育器材室，聲音異常平靜，卻讓晴晴的汗毛都豎了起來，「他們……加快了。」\n\n「什麼？」\n\n「那條管線的排放量，今天晚上，又增加了百分之五十。」溜溜說，「照這樣下去，最快再一個月……學校後方整片海，都會變成灰色的。」\n\n器材室裡，安靜了很久。\n\n「……一個月。」晴晴低聲重複著。\n\n她低下頭，看向自己手腕上的錶。\n\n然後，她想起未晞手環上，那行一直在倒數的數字。\n\n「未晞的時間，也快到了。」晴晴喃喃地說，「一個月……夠我們做什麼？」\n\n「夠我們，做很多事情。」溜溜說，「只要我們想。」\n\n「……是啊。」晴晴抬起頭，眼神裡，重新亮起了光，「只要我們想。」\n\n那天晚上，未晞也沒有睡。\n\n她坐在窗邊，看著手腕上的手環。\n\n手環內側的倒數數字，在月光下，靜靜地閃爍。\n\n——三十九。\n\n「還剩三十九天，」她低聲說，「可是……他們已經開始了。」\n\n她想起今天在保健室聽到的消息——學校的學生，陸陸續續肚子不舒服；入海口的海水，開始變色。\n\n「跟奶奶說的一模一樣，」她喃喃地說，「奶奶說，在那個時代，大人們也是這樣：先是小小的味道，然後小小的不舒服，然後……」\n\n她沒有說下去。\n\n她只是輕輕地，把手環貼在自己的胸口，像是在護著什麼重要的東西。\n\n「如果……能再多給我一點時間，」她低聲說，「多到，讓這群孩子，把這個世界，救回來。」\n\n月光，靜靜地照著她。\n\n窗外的排水溝，依然在黑暗中，靜靜地流著。\n\n窗外，月光照在排水溝上。\n\n那條灰綠色的水，依然在靜靜地流著。\n\n流向那片，孩子們剛剛淨灘過的沙灘。\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 11: Liu-Liu's Abnormal Detection\n\nIn the week after the beach cleanup ended, a small \"anomaly\" appeared in the classroom of Class 6-1—Liu-Liu had gone missing.\n\nNot truly missing. It still showed up in the classroom on time every day, but its movements had become mysterious: when no one was watching, it would slip out of the classroom, only to dart back through the ventilation duct when the bell rang, data dancing densely in its electronic eyes.\n\n\"Liu-Liu, what have you been busy with lately?\" A-Xin leaned in to ask.\n\n\"Beep beep! Nothing! Routine patrols!\" Liu-Liu puffed out its chest with righteous confidence, \"I'm the captain of the 'Intel & Publicity Raid Squad'! Patrolling is my duty!\"\n\n\"But you used to bring back promotional posters from your patrols,\" A-Xin stared at it suspiciously, \"now you come back with nothing?\"\n\n\"Beep... well...\" Liu-Liu's gaze drifted, \"I-I've been focusing more on 'internal security' lately! Yes! Internal security!\"\n\nA-Xin frowned, feeling something was off but unable to put his finger on it.\n\nOf course, he didn't know—Liu-Liu had actually been doing one thing these past days: flying up the drainage ditch behind the school, bit by bit, toward the upstream.\n\n\"Beep beep... November 12th, drainage ditch odor index: fifty-three. Up nine percent from last week.\"\n\n\"November 15th, odor index: sixty-one. Water beginning to turn turbid.\"\n\n\"November 18th, odor index: seventy. White foam appearing on the water surface...\"\n\n\"November 20th,\" Liu-Liu hovered above the drainage ditch, data crazily jumping in its electronic eyes, \"odor index: eighty-two. Water color: grayish-green. pH value: 4.7—this is strong acid!\"\n\nLiu-Liu's tail bristled, hair by hair.\n\n\"This ditch water can't even be called 'water' anymore!\" Liu-Liu lowered its voice, unprecedented gravity in its tone, \"And the discharge is still ongoing!\"\n\nThe next day, Liu-Liu flew to the river mouth again.\n\n\"Beep beep... odor index: fifty-eight. Water color: starting to turn turbid.\" Liu-Liu recorded the data and was about to turn back when its electronic eyes suddenly caught an anomaly on the water's surface—\"That's...\"\n\nOn the shallows near the river mouth lay several little fish, bellies up, completely still.\n\n\"Fish... dead?\" Liu-Liu flew over and carefully scanned, \"No external wounds... inside... oh no, their gills are gray!\"\n\n\"This color...\" A dreaded keyword jumped out of Liu-Liu's database, \"heavy metal poisoning?\"\n\nIt refused to give up and flew another circle along the shallows.\n\nThe more it flew, the colder its heart grew.\n\nIn the corner of the shallows lay even more little fish with bellies up, mixed with dead shrimp. They lay quietly in the grayish-yellow water, as if quietly forgotten by the world.\n\n\"This isn't natural death,\" Liu-Liu said in a low voice, its electronic eyes full of reluctance, \"this is... death by poisoning.\"\n\nIt flew along the drainage ditch to the spot three kilometers away, the place it had marked on the map.\n\nIt was a pipe hidden among the weeds, extending from the direction of the industrial zone, plunging straight into the drainage ditch.\n\nAt the end of the pipe, a grayish-green liquid was pouring out endlessly.\n\n\"...It's gotten faster again.\" Liu-Liu recorded the data, \"This pipe's discharge rate is up forty percent from last week. Just who is dumping these things into our sea?\"\n\nThat evening, after school.\n\nLiu-Liu didn't go home. Instead, it carried a data report in its mouth and slipped into the sports equipment room—the Secret Alliance's \"command center.\"\n\nQingqing was already waiting there.\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" Qingqing said in a low voice, \"how did the reconnaissance go these past few days?\"\n\nLiu-Liu spread the data report out on the equipment box.\n\n\"Bad.\" Liu-Liu's voice was unusually heavy, \"The drainage ditch's water quality is getting worse every day. The odor index has shot up from fifty-three all the way to eighty-two. The water has turned turbid, foam has appeared, and the pH has dropped to 4.7.\"\n\n\"pH 4.7...\" Qingqing gasped, \"That's strongly acidic! If this water flows into the sea, the sea creatures...\"\n\n\"They'll die.\" Liu-Liu said, \"I detected that the seawater near the ditch's river mouth has already started to change color. If this keeps up, the first thing to suffer will be that beach we just cleaned.\"\n\nQingqing fell silent.\n\nShe remembered that beach, and the smiles on the children's faces when they picked up seventy-six kilograms of trash.\n\n\"...Whose pipe is this, anyway?\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"I've looked into it.\" Liu-Liu shook its head, \"That pipe isn't registered on any map. It's hidden in the weeds, extending from the industrial zone. I followed the pipe into the industrial zone and smelled...\" Liu-Liu paused, \"a very strong chemical smell. And a metallic smell.\"\n\n\"Metallic?\" Qingqing frowned.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Liu-Liu nodded, \"Like heavy metals. Electroplating plants, dyeing factories—places like that often have this kind of smell.\"\n\n\"Heavy metals...\" Qingqing's heart sank.\n\n\"Class President,\" Liu-Liu's voice carried unprecedented seriousness, \"should we tell everyone?\"\n\nQingqing thought for a long time.\n\n\"Not yet.\" She finally shook her head, \"Weixi said that until we find solid evidence, we shouldn't alarm everyone yet. And...\" she paused, \"she said she seems to... know when this pipe started.\"\n\n\"Weixi knows?\" Liu-Liu's eyes went wide.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Qingqing lowered her head, her voice soft, \"She only told me one sentence—'It's exactly the same as the time I remember.'\"\n\nLiu-Liu fell silent.\n\n\"Then what do we do now...\" Liu-Liu asked in a low voice, \"just keep reconnoitering?\"\n\n\"Keep reconnoitering.\" Qingqing nodded, \"But we need to start preparing. I have a feeling this thing... is about to blow wide open.\"\n\nIn fact, Dean Zhou had also noticed the school's anomaly.\n\n\"Abnormal water quality in the drinking fountains these past two weeks?\" In the principal's office, Dean Zhou flipped through the health room records, brows tightly knit.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Principal Qiu held his tea cup, his expression uncommonly grave, \"Over a dozen children have had stomach discomfort, yet the water company says the water quality passes. There's definitely something wrong in between.\"\n\n\"I suspect the problem isn't the drinking fountains.\" Dean Zhou said.\n\n\"Oh?\"\n\n\"The drainage ditch behind the school.\" Dean Zhou put down the records, his voice low, \"These past few days, I noticed the color of that ditch water isn't right. And at the river mouth...\" he paused, \"I went to look. There are dead fish.\"\n\n\"Dead fish?\" Principal Qiu's hand trembled slightly.\n\n\"Principal,\" Dean Zhou stood up, \"I want to investigate where exactly the upstream of that drainage ditch leads.\"\n\nPrincipal Qiu was silent for a long time, then nodded heavily: \"...Go investigate. Not one of those responsible can be let off.\"\n\nIn the days that followed, strange changes appeared in the school, one after another.\n\nThe first to notice was Old Wu.\n\n\"Hey! Don't you guys feel it,\" one day at noon, Old Wu held up his water bottle, wrinkling his nose, \"the water from the school drinking fountain tastes... weird?\"\n\n\"Weird?\" A-Xin leaned in and took a sip too, \"Does it? Isn't it just regular water?\"\n\n\"No!\" Old Wu shook his head, \"There's a... hard-to-describe taste. Like disinfectant, but not quite. Anyway, it's different from before!\"\n\n\"It's your nose that's broken!\" A-Xin laughed heartily, \"Didn't you just eat two bowls of braised pork rice? That flavor's covering everything!\"\n\n\"I'm not broken!\" Old Wu refused to concede, \"Even our dog can smell it!\"\n\n\"You don't have a dog!\"\n\n\"I meant 'the dog next door'!\"\n\nThe children laughed together.\n\nOnly Weixi, sitting by the window, didn't laugh.\n\nShe held her own water bottle, quietly looking toward the drainage ditch outside the window.\n\n\"...It's begun.\" she said in a barely audible voice.\n\n\"Weixi, what did you say?\" Lin Yunyun turned around to ask.\n\n\"Nothing.\" Weixi shook her head and capped her water bottle, \"I was just thinking... maybe we should get everyone to pay attention to the school's water.\"\n\n\"The school's water?\" Lin Yunyun was puzzled, \"What about the water?\"\n\n\"Nothing.\" Weixi shook her head again, \"I was just... talking casually.\"\n\nHowever, the words Weixi \"said casually\" came true two days later.\n\nThat morning, a flurry of frightened screams erupted in the classroom of Class 6-1.\n\n\"Ah—! Someone threw up!\"\n\n\"What's going on?!\"\n\n\"It's Ada! Chen Ada from Class 6-2! He just threw up at the classroom door!\"\n\nThe children buzzed with discussion. Even Chen Ada from the neighboring class was sent to the health room, his face pale.\n\n\"The doctor said it might be gastroenteritis.\" Qingqing's mother told her over the phone, \"The school has had several students with stomach trouble lately. The health room teacher says it seems to start after drinking the drinking fountain water.\"\n\n\"The drinking fountain water?\" Qingqing's heart leaped.\n\n\"Yeah,\" Qingqing's mother continued, \"I heard the school has asked someone to check the water quality. Hope it's nothing serious...\"\n\nQingqing hung up and looked out the window.\n\nIn the direction of the drainage ditch, everything was gray and hazy.\n\nAn uneasy premonition rose in her heart.\n\nThat afternoon, in the health room.\n\n\"Qingqing,\" the health room teacher looked at the records in her hand, frowning, \"over the past two weeks, more than a dozen students across the school have come to me with stomach trouble.\"\n\n\"A dozen or more?\" Qingqing asked in surprise.\n\n\"Mhm.\" The health room teacher nodded, \"The symptoms are all similar: after drinking the drinking fountain water, stomach pain and nausea begin. The school has already asked the water company to inspect, but...\" she sighed, \"the inspection result says the school's water quality meets the standards.\"\n\n\"Meets the standards?\" Qingqing frowned.\n\n\"Yes,\" the teacher said helplessly, \"the water company said all the water quality tests passed. So... for now, the school can only keep observing.\"\n\n\"But what if the problem isn't the drinking fountains?\" A soft voice came from the health room doorway.\n\nIt was Weixi.\n\n\"Not the drinking fountains?\" The health room teacher was puzzled, \"Then what?\"\n\n\"The school's drinking fountains use tap water.\" Weixi walked in, her voice soft yet clear, \"But the drainage ditch behind the school, and the seawater at the river mouth—their water quality has already changed.\"\n\n\"The drainage ditch?\" The health room teacher blinked, \"What does that have to do with the school drinking fountains?\"\n\n\"Nothing for now.\" Weixi shook her head, \"But if we let it go, one day it will have something to do with our lives. Because...\" she looked out the window, \"the water we drink and the things we throw away are all connected in the end.\"\n\nThe health room teacher was silent for a moment.\n\n\"You transfer student,\" she looked at Weixi, curiosity in her voice, \"why do you talk like an adult?\"\n\nWeixi didn't answer, only smiled faintly.\n\nWalking out of the health room, Qingqing caught up to Weixi.\n\n\"Weixi, do you... know something?\" Qingqing asked in a low voice.\n\nWeixi stopped.\n\n\"Qingqing,\" she turned around, a nameless complexity in her eyes, \"that pipe... I've actually... known about it all along.\"\n\n\"What?!\" Qingqing's eyes went wide, \"You knew all along?! Then why—\"\n\n\"Because...\" Weixi lowered her head, \"in my era, I heard this story. A river was polluted by wastewater discharged from nearby factories. The river changed color, and the fish died. It took the adults decades to restore that river. But...\"\n\n\"But what?\"\n\n\"But the people of that era,\" Weixi's voice was light as a sigh, \"had already forgotten what that river originally looked like.\"\n\nAnd that same day, Liu-Liu brought back even worse news.\n\n\"Class President! Urgent report!\" Liu-Liu burst out of the ventilation duct, its voice trembling, \"I just flew along the ditch to the river mouth and found—the seawater has changed color!\"\n\n\"What?!\" Qingqing's eyes went wide.\n\n\"The seawater near the river mouth,\" Liu-Liu's electronic eyes displayed a shocking stream of data, \"has changed from its original blue-green to an... indescribable grayish-yellow! And I detected fish floating belly-up nearby!\"\n\n\"Fish...\" Qingqing's face turned white.\n\n\"That pipe,\" Liu-Liu's voice grew more and more urgent, \"its discharge rate has increased again! Double what it was last week!\"\n\n\"Doubled?!\" Qingqing almost shouted, \"Why would it suddenly—\"\n\n\"I don't know!\" Liu-Liu spun around frantically, \"But at this rate, the beach we cleaned will soon be flooded by polluted seawater!\"\n\nQingqing took a deep breath, forcing herself to calm down.\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" she lowered her voice, \"when exactly did this pipe start discharging?\"\n\n\"I checked the earlier data!\" Liu-Liu opened its reconnaissance diary, \"The ditch's odor was first detected on...\"\n\nLiu-Liu's voice suddenly stopped.\n\n\"When was it?\" Qingqing pressed.\n\n\"It was on...\" Liu-Liu trembled as it read out the record, \"October 12th.\"\n\n\"October 12th...\" Qingqing repeated softly, \"isn't that...\"\n\n\"Isn't that the day Weixi transferred to our school?\" Liu-Liu's voice was light as a feather.\n\nThe equipment room suddenly fell into a terrifying silence.\n\nQingqing and Liu-Liu stared at each other.\n\n\"This can't be a coincidence, right?\" Liu-Liu asked in a low voice.\n\n\"...\" Qingqing didn't answer, but her hand, holding the data report, trembled slightly.\n\nIf all of this wasn't a coincidence...\n\nThen what else was Weixi hiding?\n\nAfter school, A-Xin did something even he found a little \"creepy\"—he began following Liu-Liu.\n\n\"Liu-Liu's been too strange lately,\" A-Xin leaned on the hallway railing, watching Liu-Liu dart with a \"swish\" in the direction of the drainage ditch, \"it must be hiding something from us! I'm going to find out what it's sneaking around doing every day!\"\n\nA-Xin crept along behind Liu-Liu, following it all the way to the seawall behind the school.\n\nThen he saw this—\n\nLiu-Liu crouched at the river mouth of the drainage ditch, its electronic eyes shooting blue scanning beams back and forth across the water's surface, muttering to itself:\n\n\"Odor index... ninety-one. Heavy metal concentration... six times over the limit. Water color... grayish-yellow. This is bad, this is really bad...\"\n\nActually, before jumping out, A-Xin had already been hiding in the grass, watching for a very, very long time.\n\nHe saw the grayish-yellow drainage water flowing all the way into the river mouth.\n\nHe saw the dead fish with bellies up on the shallows.\n\nHe saw the ring of discolored seawater, expanding little by little.\n\n\"This...\" A-Xin hid in the grass, his palms covered in cold sweat, \"what's going on? This ditch... wasn't like this before...\"\n\nHe remembered that months ago, everyone had simply called it \"that stinky ditch behind the school\"; he remembered the deathly pale face Weixi made the first time she heard the words \"drainage ditch.\"\n\n\"So that's how it is,\" A-Xin murmured to himself, \"Weixi... she knew this day would come.\"\n\nHe clenched his fist, took a deep breath, and then—\n\n\"Liu-Liu!\" A-Xin jumped out of the grass, \"What are you doing here?!\"\n\n\"Waaah—!\" Liu-Liu's tail exploded in fright, terror in its electronic eyes, \"A-A-Xin?! How did you get here?!\"\n\n\"Of course I'm here!\" A-Xin planted his hands on his hips, \"You've been sneaking around every day, either in the classroom or running here! What exactly are you doing?!\"\n\n\"I... I'm...\" Liu-Liu stammered nervously, \"I'm... observing the ecosystem! Yes! Observing the ecosystem! Nature is so beautiful!\"\n\n\"Tell that to the ghosts!\" A-Xin pointed at the grayish-yellow water at the river mouth, \"This water has turned like this, and you're telling me 'nature is so beautiful'?! What did you mean by 'odor index ninety-one' and 'heavy metals six times over the limit'?!\"\n\nLiu-Liu fell silent.\n\nIt lowered its head, tail drooping.\n\n\"A-Xin...\" Liu-Liu's voice was full of difficulty, \"this matter... I really can't say. At least not yet.\"\n\n\"That phrase again!\" A-Xin couldn't help shouting, \"Last time you said 'telling would harm Weixi'! What about this time?! Does it have something to do with Weixi?!\"\n\nLiu-Liu's electronic eyes flashed suddenly.\n\n\"...You guessed it?\" Liu-Liu asked in a low voice.\n\n\"I guessed it long ago!\" A-Xin crouched down, looking straight into Liu-Liu's eyes, \"Liu-Liu, I'm not stupid! Weixi has secrets, you have secrets, I know all that! I just...\"\n\n\"Just what?\"\n\n\"Just want to know,\" A-Xin's voice carried a plea for the first time, \"are these secrets connected to our class's 'Campaign'? Connected to this stinking ditch and this dirtied sea?\"\n\nLiu-Liu was silent for a very, very long time.\n\nFinally, it spoke softly:\n\n\"A-Xin, have you heard a saying?\"\n\n\"What saying?\"\n\n\"'The more you know, the heavier the burden on your shoulders.'\" Liu-Liu said, \"Qingqing and Weixi aren't unwilling to tell you—they're afraid of... dragging you into it too.\"\n\n\"Dragging me in?\" A-Xin blinked, \"Dragged into what?\"\n\n\"...\" Liu-Liu didn't answer, only lowered its head.\n\nA-Xin looked at Liu-Liu's hesitant expression and was silent for a long time.\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" he finally said, \"listen to me. No matter what secret you're guarding, no matter how scary it is—I, A-Xin, am not someone who gets 'dragged into' things. I'm someone who 'jumps in' of his own accord!\"\n\n\"You guard your secret, and I'll help you guard it together!\"\n\n\"But,\" A-Xin looked at Liu-Liu seriously, \"if one day Weixi needs someone standing by her side—you absolutely must not leave me out! That's our promise!\"\n\nA complex light flickered in Liu-Liu's electronic eyes.\n\n\"...A-Xin,\" it said softly, \"you really are a true friend.\"\n\n\"Of course!\" A-Xin puffed out his chest, \"I'm the captain of the 'Tree Adoption Raid Squad'!\"\n\nLate that night, Liu-Liu made one last flight to the top of that pipe.\n\nIn the moonlight, the pipe was still spewing grayish-green liquid.\n\nLiu-Liu recorded the final data point, then flew back to school.\n\n\"Class President,\" Liu-Liu slipped into the sports equipment room, its voice unusually calm, yet making Qingqing's hairs stand on end, \"they've... sped up.\"\n\n\"What?\"\n\n\"That pipe's discharge rate increased another fifty percent tonight.\" Liu-Liu said, \"At this rate, within a month at most... the entire sea behind the school will turn gray.\"\n\nThe equipment room was silent for a long time.\n\n\"...One month.\" Qingqing repeated softly.\n\nShe lowered her head and looked at the watch on her wrist.\n\nThen she remembered the countdown number on Weixi's bracelet.\n\n\"Weixi's time is almost up too.\" Qingqing murmured, \"One month... what can we do with one month?\"\n\n\"Enough to do a lot of things.\" Liu-Liu said, \"As long as we want to.\"\n\n\"...Yeah.\" Qingqing looked up, light returning to her eyes, \"As long as we want to.\"\n\nThat night, Weixi wasn't asleep either.\n\nShe sat by the window, looking at the bracelet on her wrist.\n\nThe countdown number on the inside of the bracelet flickered quietly in the moonlight.\n\n—Thirty-nine.\n\n\"Thirty-nine days left,\" she said in a low voice, \"but... they've already begun.\"\n\nShe remembered the news she had heard today at the health room—the students falling ill one after another; the seawater at the river mouth starting to change color.\n\n\"Exactly as Grandma said,\" she murmured, \"Grandma said that in that era, the adults were the same: first a small smell, then a small discomfort, and then...\"\n\nShe didn't finish.\n\nShe just gently pressed the bracelet against her chest, as if protecting something precious.\n\n\"If... I could be given a little more time,\" she said softly, \"enough for these children to save this world.\"\n\nThe moonlight shone quietly on her.\n\nThe drainage ditch outside the window still flowed quietly in the darkness.\n\nOutside the window, moonlight shone on the drainage ditch.\n\nThat grayish-green water was still flowing silently.\n\nFlowing toward that beach, which the children had just cleaned.\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":4,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第十二章：全校綠色園遊會\n\n「我們需要錢。」\n\n那天放學後，晴晴站在講台上，語氣嚴肅地，說了這句話。\n\n「錢？」阿釁瞪大眼睛，「班長，你缺錢嗎？」\n\n「不是我缺錢，」晴晴搖搖頭，「是『守護地球大作戰』缺錢。你們想想——我們要查排水溝的管線，需要工具；我們每個月要淨灘，需要手套和垃圾袋；我們要種樹，需要樹苗和肥料……這些，都要錢。」\n\n「對耶！」老巫恍然大悟，「我們總不能一直跟校長要錢吧！」\n\n「所以，」晴晴深吸一口氣，「我想到一個辦法——我們來辦園遊會！」\n\n「園遊會？！」全班的眼睛，瞬間亮了。\n\n「對！辦一場『綠色園遊會』！」晴晴大聲宣布，「主題就是環保！我們用園遊會來宣導環保、募款，讓全校、讓所有家長都來參加！」\n\n「這個主意太棒了！」阿釁興奮地跳起來，「園遊會耶！我最會玩了！」\n\n「不只是玩！」晴晴補充，「我們要讓大家在玩的過程中，學會環保！所以，每一個攤位，都要跟環保有關係！」\n\n「那我們要擺什麼攤位？」孩子們議論紛紛。\n\n「大家分組想！」晴晴說，「每個突擊隊，負責一個攤位！」\n\n於是，接下來的一個星期，六年一班的教室，每天晚上，都亮著燈。\n\n孩子們像一群小蜜蜂，忙著設計海報、製作道具、準備材料。\n\n「我這個『減塑神射手』，可是經過精密計算的！」阿釁得意地展示他的設計圖，上面畫滿了彈道計算，「箭的射程、塑膠袋靶的懸掛高度、風向的影響……全部考慮進去了！」\n\n「你連風向都考慮？」尪伝恺瞪大眼睛，「你是要射擊，還是要登陸月球？」\n\n「登陸月球也是需要射擊計算的！」阿釁理直氣壯。\n\n「阿釁，」晴晴湊過來看了一眼設計圖，忍不住扶額，「你這個靶子……掛在兩公尺高的地方？小朋友怎麼射得到？」\n\n「所以……」阿釁神秘兮兮地，從背後掏出一個小凳子，「我準備了『矮子專用梯』！」\n\n「你這叫『矮子專用梯』，」老巫湊過來，「那不就是板凳嗎？」\n\n「是『輔助射擊平台』！」阿釁鄭重糾正。\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑成一團。\n\n「大家快來看這個！」林芸芸舉著一張畫得歪歪扭扭的海報跑過來，「我設計的『垃圾分類九宮格』海報！你們覺得怎麼樣？」\n\n海報上，九個格子裡，畫著各種垃圾：寶特瓶、衛生紙、電池、舊書、壞掉的玩具、廚餘……\n\n「林芸芸，」阿釁指著其中一格，「你畫的那個『舊書』，怎麼長得像一隻烏龜？」\n\n「啊！」林芸芸臉紅了，「我……我畫得不好……」\n\n「不會不會！」晴晴連忙安慰，「畫得很有創意！烏龜也……也是書的一種！呃，我是說，很有辨識度！」\n\n「噗！」尪伝恺忍不住笑出來。\n\n「你們……」林芸芸氣鼓鼓地，「我不理你們了！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」\n\n孩子們的歡笑聲，在教室裡迴盪。\n\n「垃圾分類突擊隊！」林芸芸攤開一張設計圖，「我們的攤位，叫『垃圾分類九宮格』！用軟球丟九宮格，丟到哪一格，就要回答那一格的垃圾該怎麼分！答對了，送小獎品！」\n\n「好！這個有教育意義！」晴晴點頭。\n\n「減塑神射手！」阿釁得意地舉起一把用紙板做的「環保弓箭」，「我們的攤位，用紙做的箭，射塑膠袋做的靶！射中一個，就代表『消滅』一個塑膠袋！」\n\n「你這個……」晴晴哭笑不得，「弓箭不會傷到人吧？」\n\n「怎麼可能！」阿釁拍胸脯保證，「箭頭是軟的！而且靶子離三公尺！我可是計算過彈道的！」\n\n「節電大考驗！」尪伝恺拿出厚厚一疊題目卡，「我們出題考大家：冷氣應該定幾度？電視待機耗多少電？洗衣機什麼時候用最省電？答對一題，蓋一個章！」\n\n「植樹認養突擊隊！」老巫扛著一堆小盆栽過來，「我們賣『種子盆栽』！一盆五十元！買回家種，發芽了，就多一棵小樹！」\n\n「這些種子是……」晴晴問。\n\n「是我們撿的！」老巫拍著胸脯，「學校後面的樹，掉的種子！我們一顆一顆撿起來，種在小盆子裡！賣出去的每一盆，都是一棵『未來的小樹』！」\n\n「零浪費點心吧！」輪到阿釁小組的鄰桌，幾個女生舉手，「我們用『醜蔬果』做點心！市場阿姨說，那些長得不好看、賣不出去的蔬果，都要被丟掉！我們把它們做成水果茶和蔬菜煎餅！讓大家知道，『醜』的東西，也很好吃！」\n\n「這個我喜歡！」老巫口水都快流出來了。\n\n「情報與宣傳突擊隊！」溜溜「啪」地立正，「我們的攤位，叫『守護地球情報站』！我會現場展示排水溝的水質數據、淨灘的照片，還有環保小知識問答！」\n\n「還有！」阿釁神秘兮兮地補充，「我們要擺一個最特別的攤位——『寫給未來的一封信』！」\n\n「寫給未來？」孩子們面面相覷。\n\n「對！」阿釁拿出厚厚一疊明信片，「園遊會那天，我們讓每一個人，寫一張明信片，寄給『四十年後的未來』！寫下你希望未來的地球是什麼樣子！一張二十元，募款用！」\n\n「寫給四十年後的未來……」孩子們沉默了一下。\n\n「那……那些明信片，要寄到哪裡？」林芸芸小聲問。\n\n「寄到……」阿釁想了想，「寄到『未來的地球』！反正，地球一直都在，信一定收得到！」\n\n孩子們笑了。\n\n只有未晞，看著那些明信片，眼神裡，閃過一抹複雜的光芒。\n\n園遊會當天，天氣出奇地好。\n\n陽光灑在鹿陽國小的操場上，把每一面旗子都照得亮晶晶的。\n\n「綠色園遊會，正式開始——！」\n\n邱守仁校長，端著他的保溫茶杯，笑瞇瞇地，替園遊會剪了綵。\n\n「各位家長、各位同學！」邱校長的聲音透過麥克風，傳遍整個操場，「今天這場園遊會，是六年一班的孩子們，自己籌辦的！主題，是環保！請大家多多捧場！」\n\n「好——！」操場上，響起一片歡呼聲。\n\n園遊會的攤位，在操場上一字排開。\n\n「垃圾分類九宮格」攤位前，排著長長的人龍。\n\n「丟這裡！丟這裡！」林芸芸緊張地指揮著，「寶特瓶，要丟『回收類』！」\n\n「答對了！蓋章！」\n\n「下一題！」阿釁一把抓過軟球，「嘿嘿，這題是我出的——『用過的衛生紙』，丟哪裡？」\n\n「衛生紙？！」排隊的小朋友們愣住了，「衛生紙不是……丟馬桶嗎？」\n\n「答錯！」阿釁得意地搖搖手指，「用過的衛生紙，要丟『一般垃圾』！丟馬桶會堵塞，丟回收會污染整袋回收物！正確答案——『一般垃圾』！」\n\n「啊——！」小朋友們哀嚎，「太難了啦！」\n\n「簡單怎麼會叫『大作戰』！」阿釁哈哈大笑。\n\n「減塑神射手」前，阿釁大聲吆喝：「來喔來喔！射塑膠袋！一箭消滅一個！」\n\n「老闆！我要射那個最大的！」一個低年級的小男生，指著最大的塑膠袋靶。\n\n「好！看你的！」阿釁把「環保弓箭」遞給他。\n\n「咻——！」紙箭歪歪斜斜地飛出去，「啪」地黏在靶子旁邊。\n\n「哎呀！差一點！」阿釁惋惜地大叫，「塑膠袋逃過一劫！再來一次！」\n\n「節電大考驗」前，尪伝恺忙得滿頭大汗：「冷氣定幾度？！二十六度！答對了！」\n\n「洗衣機什麼時候洗最省電？！離峰時段！」\n\n「電燈泡要用哪一種？！LED！」\n\n「哇！你怎麼什麼都知道？」一位媽媽讚嘆。\n\n「因為……因為我們班每天都在考！」尪伝恺不好意思地抓抓頭。\n\n「種子盆栽」攤位前，老巫嗓門最大：「一盆五十！種下未來的小樹！買回去，發芽了記得拍照給我們看！」\n\n「老闆，這個盆栽要怎麼照顧？」一位阿嬤問。\n\n「每天澆水，放在有陽光的地方！」老巫拍著胸脯，「我幫您保證，它一定發芽！要是不發芽，您來找我，我賠您十盆！」\n\n「要是賠十盆，你就沒樹苗了！」阿釁在旁邊吐槽。\n\n「那我就再去撿！」老巫理直氣壯。\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」攤位前響起一片笑聲。\n\n「零浪費點心吧」前，更是大排長龍。\n\n「這是用『醜蘋果』做的果茶！這是用『歪歪的胡蘿蔔』做的煎餅！」女生們熱情地招呼，「長得醜，不代表不好吃！支持醜蔬果，就是支持零浪費！」\n\n「太好喝了！」一位媽媽驚呼，「這真的是『賣不出去』的蘋果做的？！」\n\n「對！是市場阿姨送我們的！」女生們得意地挺起胸膛。\n\n「那我也要支持醜蔬果！」「我也是！」「阿姨，再來一杯！」\n\n「排隊！排隊！」老巫從隔壁攤位衝過來維持秩序，「醜蔬果點心，人人有份！」\n\n「你不去顧你的盆栽嗎？」晴晴哭笑不得。\n\n「盆栽賣完了！」老巫驕傲地宣布，「八十七盆，全部賣光光！」\n\n「哇！」晴晴瞪大眼睛。\n\n「而且，」老巫壓低聲音，神秘兮兮地，「我偷偷看到，周嚴主任，剛剛買了兩盆！」\n\n「主任買盆栽？！」晴晴愣住了。\n\n「對！」老巫點頭，「而且他買完，還看了好久，然後偷偷跟林芸芸說：『種子要是發芽了，記得拿去校長室給他看。』」\n\n晴晴的心裡，湧起一股暖暖的感覺。\n\n而在操場角落，「寫給未來的一封信」攤位前，孩子們排著隊，拿起筆，認真地寫著。\n\n「我要寫——『希望未來的地球，有乾淨的海！』」\n\n「我要寫——『希望未來的人，不要再丟垃圾到海裡！』」\n\n「我要寫——『希望未來還看得到鳳凰樹！』」\n\n一張一張明信片，被投進一個大大的、畫著地球圖案的郵筒裡。\n\n「未晞！未晞！你看我寫的！」阿釁舉著明信片，得意洋洋地跑過來。\n\n未晞接過來一看——\n\n「給未來的地球：你好！我是阿釁！我今年十二歲！我跟你保證，等我長大，我一定會把海邊的垃圾都撿光光！──阿釁」\n\n「寫得……很有精神！」未晞忍不住笑了。\n\n「那當然！」阿釁驕傲地挺起胸膛，「我寫的可是『保證書』！」\n\n「那我也要看看我的！」老巫擠過來，「我寫的是——『給未來的地球：你好，我是老巫！我保證以後不浪費食物！可是我還是想吃肉包！──老巫』」\n\n「你怎麼還在想肉包！」阿釁吐槽。\n\n「肉包跟環保不衝突！」老巫理直氣壯。\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑成一團。\n\n「換我！換我！」林芸芸小聲說，「我寫的是……『給未來的地球：希望你可以好好的。希望那裡的樹，都可以活得長長久久。──芸芸』」\n\n「寫得好！」晴晴豎起大拇指。\n\n「還有我的！」尪伝恺舉起明信片，上面歪歪扭扭地寫著：「給未來的人：請你們記得，現在有一群小孩，為了讓你們有乾淨的水喝，很努力很努力！──尪伝恺」\n\n孩子們一封一封地寫著。\n\n一封一封地，投進那個畫著地球的郵筒裡。\n\n未晞站在一旁，靜靜地看著。\n\n她看見孩子們寫下的每一句話，都是關於乾淨的海、綠色的樹、喝不完的水。\n\n「……大家寫的，」她低聲說，「都是我最想看到的未來。」\n\n「未晞，」晴晴走過來，輕聲說，「你寫的那封，我也看到了。」\n\n「啊？」未晞愣了一下。\n\n「『請記得，這裡的人，曾經為了保護地球，努力過。』」晴晴重複著那行字，「未晞，其實……你不用擔心。就算有一天，你回到你的時代，看不到我們寫的這些信——我們也會記得，我們曾經努力過。」\n\n未晞的鼻頭，忽然酸酸的。\n\n「嗯。」她低下頭，輕輕地，「我會記得的。」\n\n未晞站在攤位旁邊，看著那些明信片，眼眶微微泛紅。\n\n「未晞，」晴晴走過來，輕聲問，「你要不要也寫一張？」\n\n「我……」未晞愣了一下，「我可以嗎？」\n\n「當然可以！」晴晴遞給她一張明信片，「你是我們的一分子！」\n\n未晞接過明信片，拿起筆，想了很久很久。\n\n然後，她寫下了一行字。\n\n晴晴偷偷看了一眼——那行字是：\n\n「給四十年後的自己：如果有一天，你收到這封信，請記得——這裡的人，曾經為了保護地球，努力過。」\n\n未晞寫完，輕輕地，把明信片投進郵筒。\n\n「會寄到嗎？」晴晴問。\n\n「不知道。」未晞搖搖頭，微微笑了，「可是，我會記得，我投過這一封信。」\n\n園遊會進行到一半，溜溜忽然不見了。\n\n阿釁眼尖，發現溜溜鬼鬼祟祟地，往學校後方的排水溝方向溜去。\n\n「溜溜！」阿釁壓低聲音追過去，「園遊會正熱鬧，你跑來這裡做什麼？」\n\n「嗶嗶……阿釁……」溜溜蹲在排水溝邊，電子眼裡都是凝重，「我來看看……今天，那條管線，是不是又在排了。」\n\n「今天是園遊會耶！」阿釁說，「那條管線，也會看日子嗎？」\n\n「污染不看日子。」溜溜搖搖頭，飛到入海口，掃描了一圈，然後，臉色大變，「嗶嗶！不好了！阿釁！」\n\n「怎麼了？！」\n\n「海水！」溜溜的聲音都在發抖，「入海口的海水，變色範圍，又擴大了！比昨天，足足大了一倍！」\n\n「一倍？！」阿釁的心，猛地一沉。\n\n「那條管線，」溜溜低聲說，「它排放的速度，一天比一天快。這樣下去……」\n\n「這樣下去，我們的園遊會，就白辦了。」阿釁低聲說，「就算我們在園遊會上教大家一百遍『愛護地球』，那片海還是會被弄髒。」\n\n溜溜沉默了。\n\n「溜溜，」阿釁忽然開口，語氣前所未有地認真，「園遊會募到的錢，我們拿來做什麼？」\n\n「班長說，要買水質檢測的工具。」\n\n「那太慢了。」阿釁搖搖頭，「我們要拿那筆錢，去查那條管線的真相。」\n\n「阿釁……」溜溜愣住。\n\n「我知道你們還在守著秘密，」阿釁蹲下來，直視著溜溜的眼睛，「可是，守著秘密，跟查明真相，是兩回事！我們要查的，是那條管線的真相！這總可以吧？」\n\n溜溜想了很久，最後，輕輕點頭：\n\n「……可以。這筆錢，我們拿來查真相。」\n\n「好！」阿釁站起來，握緊拳頭，「那園遊會結束後，我們就正式行動！」\n\n黃昏時分，攤位陸陸續續收攤。\n\n孩子們雖然累得東倒西歪，眼睛卻都亮晶晶的。\n\n「阿釁，」未晞走到正在收攤的阿釁身邊，輕聲問，「你今天……開心嗎？」\n\n「開心啊！」阿釁想都不想，「我從來沒有這麼累過，可是也從來沒有這麼開心過！」\n\n「為什麼開心？」未晞問。\n\n「因為……」阿釁想了想，忽然認真起來，「我今天看到好多人，因為我們做的東西，開心地笑。有人學會了怎麼分類，有人買了種子盆栽說要種在家裡，有人寫了信給未來……未晞，我今天忽然覺得，我們做這些事，好像真的有用。」\n\n未晞愣了一下。\n\n「阿釁，」她輕輕笑了，「你知道嗎？你剛才說的那些話，就是我最想聽到的話。」\n\n「什麼話？」\n\n「『我們做這些事，好像真的有用。』」未晞說，「只要有一個人，因為今天的園遊會，願意少用一個塑膠袋、多種一棵樹、把垃圾分好類……今天的園遊會，就沒有白辦。」\n\n「對！」阿釁用力點頭，然後，他忽然脫口而出，「未晞，等我長大，我要開一家店！」\n\n「開店？」未晞好奇地問，「什麼店？」\n\n「一間『專門賣環保用品』的店！」阿釁的眼睛亮晶晶的，「賣環保袋、賣種子、賣太陽能小玩具！我要讓大家都知道，環保也可以很好玩！」\n\n未晞看著阿釁那張神采飛揚的臉，眼眶忽然有點熱熱的。\n\n「阿釁，」她輕輕說，「我相信，你一定做得到。」\n\n「那當然！」阿釁拍著胸脯，「我可是『守護地球作戰部隊』的隊員！」\n\n園遊會，在黃昏時分，圓滿落幕。\n\n孩子們把攤位收拾乾淨，圍成一圈，坐在操場上，等著最後的「結算」。\n\n「最終統計！」溜溜叼著一張大帳單，跳上講台，「本次『綠色園遊會』，總收入——三萬八千六百五十元！」\n\n「三萬八千多？！」孩子們發出驚呼。\n\n「其中，『寫給未來的一封信』募到五千兩百元！『種子盆栽』賣出八十七盆！『零浪費點心吧』……全部賣光！」\n\n「耶——！」孩子們爆出震天的歡呼。\n\n「這些錢，」晴晴站起來，大聲宣布，「我們要用來——購買水質檢測工具，還有，調查學校後方排水溝污染的真相！」\n\n「調查真相！」孩子們齊聲大喊。\n\n「好！『守護地球作戰部隊』，下一個任務——『追查管線！』」\n\n「好——！」\n\n孩子們的歡呼聲，在黃昏的操場上，久久迴盪。\n\n而站在操場邊緣的周嚴主任，看著那群孩子，默默地，把口袋裡那張「寫給未來的一封信」，收好。\n\n信上寫著：\n\n「給未來的主任：謝謝您，曾經相信我們。」\n\n周嚴主任沒有說話。\n\n他只是把信收進胸前的口袋，然後，靜靜地，轉身離開。\n\n「主任！」一個輕輕的聲音，叫住了他。\n\n周嚴主任停下腳步，回頭一看——是未晞。\n\n「主任，」未晞走到他面前，微微鞠躬，「謝謝您。」\n\n「謝我做什麼？」周嚴主任語氣平淡，「我只是……把園遊會的垃圾，收一收。」\n\n「不是的。」未晞搖搖頭，「我聽林芸芸說，您買了兩盆種子盆栽；還聽說，您一直在看孩子們寫的信。」\n\n周嚴主任沉默了。\n\n「主任，」未晞的聲音輕輕的，「其實，您一直都知道，孩子們做的事情是對的，對嗎？」\n\n周嚴主任看著她，看了很久很久。\n\n「……我不知道什麼是『對的』，」他最後開口，聲音低沉，「我只知道，我當了二十年主任，第一次看到，一群孩子，會為了學校後面一條臭水溝，這麼拼命。」\n\n「所以，」他看著未晞，語氣裡帶著一種連他自己都沒發現的溫柔，「既然他們這麼拼命，我這個大人，總不能輸給一群小孩吧。」\n\n未晞愣住了。\n\n然後，她笑了，笑得眼眶泛紅。\n\n「主任，」她輕輕說，「孩子們會很高興的。」\n\n「哼，」周嚴主任板著臉，轉身就走，「少來這套！我只是……覺得那兩盆盆栽，放在校長室門口挺好看！」\n\n「主任，盆栽會害羞的！」\n\n「……」周嚴主任沒有回頭，但未晞看見，他的肩膀，微微顫抖了一下。\n\n夕陽下，黑面判官的背影，好像沒有那麼「黑」了。\n\n夕陽西下。\n\n未晞一個人，坐在海堤上，看著遠方那片海。\n\n海水，在夕陽下，泛著一層說不清的灰。\n\n她輕輕地，摸了摸手腕上的手環。\n\n手環內側，那行倒數數字，在夕陽下微微閃爍。\n\n——三十八。\n\n「孩子們寫的那些信，」她低聲說，「會寄到我的時代嗎？」\n\n「如果會……那四十年後的我，會看到嗎？」\n\n海風，吹過她的臉頰。\n\n她低下頭，輕輕地，笑了。\n\n「……真希望，能看到啊。」\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 12: The Schoolwide Green Fair\n\n\"We need money.\"\n\nThat day after school, Qingqing stood at the podium and said those words with a serious tone.\n\n\"Money?\" A-Xin's eyes went wide, \"Class President, are you short on cash?\"\n\n\"It's not me who's short on cash,\" Qingqing shook her head, \"it's 'Protect Earth' that's short on cash. Think about it—to investigate the drainage ditch's pipe, we need tools; to clean the beach every month, we need gloves and trash bags; to plant trees, we need saplings and fertilizer... all of that costs money.\"\n\n\"That's right!\" Old Wu suddenly understood, \"We can't keep asking the principal for money forever!\"\n\n\"So,\" Qingqing took a deep breath, \"I came up with an idea—let's hold a fair!\"\n\n\"A fair?!\" The whole class's eyes lit up instantly.\n\n\"Yes! A 'Green Fair'!\" Qingqing announced loudly, \"With environmental protection as the theme! We'll use the fair to promote environmental protection and raise funds, and invite the whole school and all the parents!\"\n\n\"This idea is amazing!\" A-Xin jumped up excitedly, \"A fair! I'm the best at playing!\"\n\n\"It's not just playing!\" Qingqing added, \"We'll make everyone learn environmental protection while they play! So every booth has to be connected to environmental protection!\"\n\n\"Then what booths should we set up?\" The children buzzed with discussion.\n\n\"Everyone, think in your groups!\" Qingqing said, \"Each raid squad is in charge of one booth!\"\n\nAnd so, for the next week, the lights in the classroom of Class 6-1 stayed on every evening.\n\nThe children buzzed about like little bees, designing posters, making props, and preparing materials.\n\n\"My 'Plastic-Free Sharpshooter' went through precision calculations!\" A-Xin proudly displayed his design drawing, covered with trajectory calculations, \"The arrow's range, the hanging height of the plastic bag target, the effect of wind direction... all taken into account!\"\n\n\"You're even considering wind direction?\" Wang Zhuankai's eyes went wide, \"Are you shooting, or landing on the moon?\"\n\n\"Landing on the moon also requires ballistic calculations!\" A-Xin declared with full confidence.\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Qingqing leaned in for a look at the design drawing and couldn't help holding her forehead, \"your target... is hanging two meters high? How are little kids supposed to hit it?\"\n\n\"So...\" A-Xin mysteriously pulled a small stool from behind his back, \"I prepared a 'shorty ladder'!\"\n\n\"You call that a 'shorty ladder,'\" Old Wu leaned in, \"isn't that just a stool?\"\n\n\"It's an 'auxiliary shooting platform'!\" A-Xin corrected with great ceremony.\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children burst into laughter.\n\n\"Everyone, come look at this!\" Lin Yunyun came running over holding a crookedly drawn poster, \"My 'Trash-Sorting Nine-Grid' poster! What do you think?\"\n\nOn the poster, nine squares contained various kinds of trash: PET bottles, tissue, batteries, old books, broken toys, food waste...\n\n\"Lin Yunyun,\" A-Xin pointed at one of the squares, \"that 'old book' you drew looks like a turtle!\"\n\n\"Ah!\" Lin Yunyun blushed, \"I... I don't draw very well...\"\n\n\"No, no!\" Qingqing quickly comforted her, \"It's very creative! A turtle is also... a kind of book! I mean, it's very recognizable!\"\n\n\"Pfft!\" Wang Zhuankai couldn't help laughing.\n\n\"You guys...\" Lin Yunyun puffed up angrily, \"I'm not talking to you anymore!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\"\n\nThe children's laughter echoed through the classroom.\n\n\"Trash-Sorting Raid Squad!\" Lin Yunyun spread out a design drawing, \"Our booth is called 'Trash-Sorting Nine-Grid'! Throw a soft ball at a nine-grid board; whichever square you hit, you have to answer how that square's trash should be sorted! Answer right, win a small prize!\"\n\n\"Good! This is educational!\" Qingqing nodded.\n\n\"The Plastic-Free Sharpshooter!\" A-Xin proudly raised a \"eco-bow\" made of cardboard, \"Our booth uses paper arrows to shoot targets made of plastic bags! Hit one, and you've 'destroyed' one plastic bag!\"\n\n\"Your...\" Qingqing laughed helplessly, \"the bow and arrow won't hurt anyone, right?\"\n\n\"Impossible!\" A-Xin patted his chest in assurance, \"The arrowheads are soft! And the target is three meters away! I calculated the trajectory!\"\n\n\"The Electricity-Saving Challenge!\" Wang Zhuankai brought out a thick stack of question cards, \"We'll quiz everyone: what temperature should the AC be set to? How much electricity does a TV in standby mode use? When is the best time to run the washing machine? Answer right, get a stamp!\"\n\n\"Tree Adoption Raid Squad!\" Old Wu carried over a pile of small potted plants, \"We're selling 'seed pots'! Fifty dollars each! Take one home, plant it, and when it sprouts, that's one more little tree!\"\n\n\"These seeds are...\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"They're seeds we picked!\" Old Wu patted his chest, \"From the trees behind the school! We picked them up one by one and planted them in little pots! Every pot sold is a 'future little tree'!\"\n\n\"The Zero-Waste Snack Bar!\" The girls of a neighboring group raised their hands, \"We're making snacks from 'ugly fruits and vegetables'! The market auntie said that all the produce that looks bad and can't be sold gets thrown away! We're turning them into fruit tea and vegetable pancakes! So everyone knows that 'ugly' things can be delicious too!\"\n\n\"I like this one!\" Old Wu was nearly drooling.\n\n\"Intel & Publicity Raid Squad!\" Liu-Liu snapped to attention, \"Our booth is called 'Protect Earth Intel Station'! I'll display the drainage ditch's water quality data, the beach cleanup photos, and host an eco-knowledge quiz!\"\n\n\"And!\" A-Xin added mysteriously, \"we're setting up the most special booth—'A Letter to the Future'!\"\n\n\"To the future?\" The children looked at each other.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin brought out a thick stack of postcards, \"On fair day, we'll have everyone write a postcard, addressed to 'the future forty years from now'! Write down what you want the Earth of the future to be like! Twenty dollars each, for fundraising!\"\n\n\"To the future forty years from now...\" The children fell silent for a moment.\n\n\"Then... where do those postcards get mailed to?\" Lin Yunyun asked softly.\n\n\"To...\" A-Xin thought for a moment, \"to 'the future Earth'! The Earth will always be there, so the letters will definitely be received!\"\n\nThe children laughed.\n\nOnly Weixi, looking at those postcards, had a complex light flicker in her eyes.\n\nOn fair day, the weather was unexpectedly beautiful.\n\nSunlight spilled across the playground of Luyang Elementary, making every flag sparkle.\n\n\"The Green Fair officially begins—!\"\n\nPrincipal Qiu Shouren, holding his thermos cup of tea, smiling, cut the ribbon for the fair.\n\n\"Dear parents, dear students!\" Principal Qiu's voice carried through the microphone across the whole playground, \"Today's fair was organized by the children of Class 6-1 themselves! The theme is environmental protection! Please come and support them!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\" A wave of cheers rose from the playground.\n\nThe fair's booths lined up in a row across the playground.\n\nIn front of the \"Trash-Sorting Nine-Grid\" booth, a long line had formed.\n\n\"Throw here! Throw here!\" Lin Yunyun directed nervously, \"PET bottles go in 'recyclables'!\"\n\n\"Correct! Stamp!\"\n\n\"Next question!\" A-Xin grabbed the soft ball, \"Hehe, this one I wrote—where does 'used tissue' go?\"\n\n\"Tissue?!\" The waiting kids were stunned, \"Doesn't tissue go... in the toilet?\"\n\n\"Wrong!\" A-Xin wagged his finger smugly, \"Used tissue goes in 'general waste'! Flushing it clogs the pipes, and recycling it contaminates the whole recycling bag! The correct answer—'general waste'!\"\n\n\"Ah—!\" The kids wailed, \"That's too hard!\"\n\n\"If it were easy, it wouldn't be called a 'Campaign'!\" A-Xin laughed heartily.\n\nIn front of the \"Plastic-Free Sharpshooter,\" A-Xin shouted loudly: \"Come, come! Shoot the plastic bags! Destroy one with each arrow!\"\n\n\"Boss! I want to shoot the biggest one!\" A young boy from the lower grades pointed at the largest plastic bag target.\n\n\"Alright! Go for it!\" A-Xin handed him the \"eco-bow.\"\n\n\"Swish—!\" The paper arrow flew crookedly and \"thwacked\" onto the spot beside the target.\n\n\"Oh! So close!\" A-Xin lamented dramatically, \"The plastic bag escaped! Try again!\"\n\nIn front of the \"Electricity-Saving Challenge,\" Wang Zhuankai worked up a sweat: \"What temperature for the AC?! Twenty-six degrees! Correct!\"\n\n\"When is the best time to use the washing machine?! Off-peak hours!\"\n\n\"What kind of light bulb should you use?! LED!\"\n\n\"Wow! How do you know all this?\" A mother marveled.\n\n\"Because... because our class gets quizzed every day!\" Wang Zhuankai scratched his head sheepishly.\n\nIn front of the \"Seed Pots\" booth, Old Wu's voice was the loudest: \"Fifty dollars a pot! Plant a future little tree! Take one home, and when it sprouts, remember to take a photo and show us!\"\n\n\"Boss, how do I take care of this pot?\" An elderly woman asked.\n\n\"Water it every day and put it in a sunny spot!\" Old Wu patted his chest, \"I guarantee it will sprout! If it doesn't, come find me, and I'll give you ten pots!\"\n\n\"If you give away ten pots, you'll run out of saplings!\" A-Xin teased from the side.\n\n\"Then I'll go pick more!\" Old Wu declared with full confidence.\n\n\"Hahaha!\" Laughter rose around the booth.\n\nIn front of the \"Zero-Waste Snack Bar,\" there was an even longer line.\n\n\"This is fruit tea made from 'ugly apples'! These are pancakes made from 'crooked carrots'!\" The girls greeted everyone enthusiastically, \"Just because it's ugly doesn't mean it isn't delicious! Supporting ugly produce means supporting zero waste!\"\n\n\"So delicious!\" A mother exclaimed, \"This is really made from apples that 'couldn't be sold'?!\"\n\n\"Yes! The market auntie gave them to us!\" The girls puffed out their chests proudly.\n\n\"Then I want to support ugly produce too!\" \"Me too!\" \"Auntie, one more cup!\"\n\n\"Line up! Line up!\" Old Wu dashed over from the neighboring booth to keep order, \"Ugly produce snacks for everyone!\"\n\n\"Aren't you supposed to be watching your pots?\" Qingqing laughed helplessly.\n\n\"The pots are sold out!\" Old Wu announced proudly, \"All eighty-seven pots, completely sold out!\"\n\n\"Wow!\" Qingqing's eyes went wide.\n\n\"And,\" Old Wu lowered his voice mysteriously, \"I secretly saw Dean Zhou just buy two pots!\"\n\n\"The Dean bought pots?!\" Qingqing was stunned.\n\n\"Yes!\" Old Wu nodded, \"And after buying them, he stared at them for a long time, then quietly told Lin Yunyun: 'When the seeds sprout, remember to take them to the principal's office to show him.'\"\n\nA warm feeling welled up in Qingqing's heart.\n\nWhile in the corner of the playground, at the \"A Letter to the Future\" booth, children lined up, picked up pens, and wrote seriously.\n\n\"I'm writing—'I hope the Earth of the future has a clean sea!'\"\n\n\"I'm writing—'I hope the people of the future won't throw trash into the sea anymore!'\"\n\n\"I'm writing—'I hope the phoenix trees will still be here in the future!'\"\n\nOne postcard after another was dropped into a big mailbox painted with the Earth's image.\n\n\"Weixi! Weixi! Look what I wrote!\" A-Xin came running over triumphantly, holding up his postcard.\n\nWeixi took it and looked—\n\n\"To the future Earth: Hello! I'm A-Xin! I'm twelve years old! I promise you, when I grow up, I will pick up every piece of trash on the beach!—A-Xin\"\n\n\"Well written... full of spirit!\" Weixi couldn't help laughing.\n\n\"Of course!\" A-Xin puffed out his chest proudly, \"What I wrote is a 'letter of guarantee'!\"\n\n\"Then I want to see mine too!\" Old Wu squeezed over, \"I wrote—'To the future Earth: Hello, I'm Old Wu! I promise not to waste food from now on! But I still want to eat pork buns!—Old Wu'\"\n\n\"Why are you still thinking about pork buns!\" A-Xin teased.\n\n\"Pork buns and environmental protection don't conflict!\" Old Wu declared with full confidence.\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children burst into laughter.\n\n\"Me! Me!\" Lin Yunyun said softly, \"I wrote... 'To the future Earth: I hope you can be well. I hope the trees there can live long, long lives.—Yunyun'\"\n\n\"Well written!\" Qingqing gave a thumbs up.\n\n\"And mine!\" Wang Zhuankai held up his postcard, on which was written crookedly: \"To the people of the future: Please remember, there are kids right now working very, very hard so that you can have clean water to drink!—Wang Zhuankai\"\n\nThe children wrote, letter after letter.\n\nOne after another, they dropped them into that mailbox painted with the Earth.\n\nWeixi stood to the side, quietly watching.\n\nShe saw that every sentence the children wrote was about clean seas, green trees, and endless drinking water.\n\n\"...What everyone wrote,\" she said in a low voice, \"is the future I want most to see.\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing walked over and said softly, \"I saw the one you wrote too.\"\n\n\"Huh?\" Weixi blinked.\n\n\"'Please remember, the people here once worked hard to protect the Earth.'\" Qingqing repeated those words, \"Weixi, actually... you don't need to worry. Even if one day you return to your era and can't see the letters we wrote—we will still remember that we once worked hard.\"\n\nWeixi's nose suddenly tingled.\n\n\"Mhm.\" She lowered her head, softly, \"I will remember.\"\n\nWeixi stood by the booth, watching those postcards, her eyes slightly reddened.\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing walked over and asked softly, \"do you want to write one too?\"\n\n\"I...\" Weixi blinked, \"Can I?\"\n\n\"Of course!\" Qingqing handed her a postcard, \"You're one of us!\"\n\nWeixi took the postcard, picked up a pen, and thought for a very, very long time.\n\nThen she wrote down a line.\n\nQingqing peeked at it—the line read:\n\n\"To myself, forty years from now: If you receive this letter one day, please remember—the people here once worked hard to protect the Earth.\"\n\nAfter writing, Weixi gently dropped the postcard into the mailbox.\n\n\"Will it get delivered?\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"I don't know.\" Weixi shook her head and smiled faintly, \"But I will remember that I sent this letter.\"\n\nHalfway through the fair, Liu-Liu suddenly disappeared.\n\nA-Xin caught it with his sharp eyes, seeing Liu-Liu sneak off toward the drainage ditch behind the school.\n\n\"Liu-Liu!\" A-Xin chased after it in a low voice, \"The fair is in full swing! Why are you coming here?\"\n\n\"Beep beep... A-Xin...\" Liu-Liu crouched by the ditch, gravity in its electronic eyes, \"I came to check... whether that pipe is discharging again today.\"\n\n\"It's fair day!\" A-Xin said, \"Does that pipe keep a calendar too?\"\n\n\"Pollution doesn't keep calendars.\" Liu-Liu shook its head, flew to the river mouth, scanned a circle, and then its face fell dramatically, \"Beep beep! Bad news! A-Xin!\"\n\n\"What is it?!\"\n\n\"The sea!\" Liu-Liu's voice was trembling, \"The seawater at the river mouth—the discolored area has expanded again! Twice as large as yesterday!\"\n\n\"Twice as large?!\" A-Xin's heart sank heavily.\n\n\"That pipe,\" Liu-Liu said in a low voice, \"its discharge speed is getting faster every day. At this rate...\"\n\n\"At this rate, our fair was all for nothing.\" A-Xin said in a low voice, \"Even if we teach everyone at the fair to 'love the Earth' a hundred times, that sea will still get dirtied.\"\n\nLiu-Liu fell silent.\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" A-Xin suddenly spoke, his tone more serious than ever before, \"what are we using the money raised at the fair for?\"\n\n\"The Class President said to buy water quality testing tools.\"\n\n\"That's too slow.\" A-Xin shook his head, \"We should use that money to investigate the truth about that pipe.\"\n\n\"A-Xin...\" Liu-Liu froze.\n\n\"I know you're still guarding your secrets,\" A-Xin crouched down, looking straight into Liu-Liu's eyes, \"but guarding secrets and finding out the truth are two different things! What we want to investigate is the truth about that pipe! That's allowed, right?\"\n\nLiu-Liu thought for a long time, then nodded softly:\n\n\"...Fine. That money, we'll use to find out the truth.\"\n\n\"Great!\" A-Xin stood up and clenched his fist, \"Then once the fair is over, we officially take action!\"\n\nAt dusk, the booths were packed up one after another.\n\nThe children, though exhausted and swaying on their feet, all had sparkling eyes.\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Weixi walked over to A-Xin, who was packing up his booth, and asked softly, \"were you... happy today?\"\n\n\"Happy!\" A-Xin answered without a second thought, \"I've never been this tired, but I've also never been this happy!\"\n\n\"Why are you happy?\" Weixi asked.\n\n\"Because...\" A-Xin thought for a moment, then suddenly turned serious, \"today I saw so many people smiling because of the things we made. Some people learned how to sort trash, some bought seed pots and said they'd plant them at home, some wrote letters to the future... Weixi, today I suddenly felt that the things we're doing really do make a difference.\"\n\nWeixi froze.\n\n\"A-Xin,\" she smiled softly, \"do you know? What you just said is the thing I most wanted to hear.\"\n\n\"What thing?\"\n\n\"'The things we're doing really do make a difference.'\" Weixi said, \"As long as one person, because of today's fair, is willing to use one less plastic bag, plant one more tree, sort their trash properly... then today's fair wasn't held in vain.\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin nodded hard, and then he suddenly blurted out, \"Weixi, when I grow up, I'm going to open a shop!\"\n\n\"Open a shop?\" Weixi asked curiously, \"What kind of shop?\"\n\n\"A shop that 'sells eco-friendly stuff'!\" A-Xin's eyes sparkled, \"Selling eco-bags, seeds, solar-powered little toys! I want everyone to know that environmental protection can be fun too!\"\n\nLooking at A-Xin's radiant face, Weixi's eyes suddenly felt a little hot.\n\n\"A-Xin,\" she said softly, \"I believe you'll definitely do it.\"\n\n\"Of course!\" A-Xin patted his chest, \"I'm a member of the 'Protect Earth Operations Unit'!\"\n\nThe fair came to a perfect close at dusk.\n\nThe children cleaned up the booths, sat in a circle on the playground, and waited for the final \"settlement.\"\n\n\"Final tally!\" Liu-Liu carried a big account sheet and jumped onto the stage, \"For this 'Green Fair,' total revenue—thirty-eight thousand six hundred fifty dollars!\"\n\n\"Over thirty-eight thousand?!\" The children gasped.\n\n\"Of which, 'A Letter to the Future' raised five thousand two hundred! 'Seed Pots' sold eighty-seven pots! The 'Zero-Waste Snack Bar'... completely sold out!\"\n\n\"Yay—!\" The children erupted in thunderous cheers.\n\n\"This money,\" Qingqing stood up and announced loudly, \"we're going to use it to—buy water quality testing tools, and investigate the truth behind the pollution of the drainage ditch behind our school!\"\n\n\"Investigate the truth!\" The children shouted in unison.\n\n\"Alright! 'Protect Earth Operations Unit,' next mission—'Track the Pipe'!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\"\n\nThe children's cheers echoed across the playground at dusk for a long time.\n\nAnd Dean Zhou, standing at the edge of the playground, quietly tucked the \"Letter to the Future\" in his pocket properly.\n\nThe letter read:\n\n\"To the Dean of the future: Thank you for believing in us once.\"\n\nDean Zhou said nothing.\n\nHe simply tucked the letter into the pocket over his chest and quietly turned to leave.\n\n\"Dean!\" A soft voice called out to him.\n\nDean Zhou stopped and turned around—it was Weixi.\n\n\"Dean,\" Weixi walked up to him and bowed slightly, \"thank you.\"\n\n\"Thank me for what?\" Dean Zhou's tone was flat, \"I just... cleaned up the fair's trash.\"\n\n\"No.\" Weixi shook her head, \"I heard from Lin Yunyun that you bought two seed pots; and I heard that you kept reading the letters the children wrote.\"\n\nDean Zhou fell silent.\n\n\"Dean,\" Weixi's voice was soft, \"you've always known that what the children are doing is right, haven't you?\"\n\nDean Zhou looked at her, for a very, very long time.\n\n\"...I don't know what counts as 'right,'\" he finally spoke, his voice low, \"I only know that in my twenty years as dean, this is the first time I've seen a group of children fight this hard over a stinking ditch behind the school.\"\n\n\"So,\" he looked at Weixi, a gentleness in his tone that even he hadn't noticed, \"since they're fighting this hard, this adult can't afford to lose to a bunch of kids.\"\n\nWeixi froze.\n\nThen she smiled, her eyes reddening.\n\n\"Dean,\" she said softly, \"the children will be very happy.\"\n\n\"Hmph,\" Dean Zhou put on a stern face and turned to leave, \"Save it! I just... think those two pots look nice in front of the principal's office!\"\n\n\"Dean, the pots will get shy!\"\n\n\"...\" Dean Zhou didn't turn back, but Weixi saw his shoulders tremble slightly.\n\nUnder the setting sun, the Black-Faced Judge's silhouette didn't seem so \"black\" anymore.\n\nThe sun was setting.\n\nWeixi sat alone on the seawall, looking at that stretch of sea in the distance.\n\nThe seawater, under the setting sun, carried a nameless gray.\n\nShe gently touched the bracelet on her wrist.\n\nThe countdown number on the inside of the bracelet flickered faintly in the setting sun.\n\n—Thirty-eight.\n\n\"The letters the children wrote,\" she said in a low voice, \"will they reach my era?\"\n\n\"If they do... will the me of forty years from now get to see them?\"\n\nThe sea wind blew across her cheeks.\n\nShe lowered her head and smiled softly.\n\n\"...I really hope I can see them.\"\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":5,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第十三章：未晞的未來記憶與倒數\n\n「追查管線」行動，如火如荼地展開了。\n\n孩子們用園遊會募到的錢，買了水質檢測工具，分成四組，沿著排水溝，一點一點地往上游調查。\n\n「這一段的水，異味指數八十五！」「我這一段九十二！」「入海口那邊，海水變色的範圍，又擴大了！」\n\n「加油！我們一定要查出那條管線的真相！」晴晴大聲為大家打氣。\n\n一切看起來，都在往好的方向發展。\n\n除了……未晞。\n\n「未晞，你怎麼了？」那天早自習，林芸芸第一個發現未晞的異樣，「你的臉色，怎麼這麼白？」\n\n「沒事。」未晞搖搖頭，勉強擠出一個笑容，「只是……昨晚沒睡好。」\n\n「沒睡好？」阿釁湊過來，「你最近黑眼圈越來越重了耶！該不會是偷看漫畫看到半夜？」\n\n「我沒有偷看漫畫啦。」未晞哭笑不得。\n\n「那你為什麼睡不好？」阿釁追問。\n\n「因為……」未晞想了想，說，「我常常做夢。夢到……一些很奇怪的地方。」\n\n「什麼地方？」林芸芸好奇地問。\n\n「一個……」未晞低下頭，聲音輕輕的，「灰灰的地方。」\n\n「灰灰的？」孩子們面面相覷。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「沒有鳳凰樹，沒有綠色的草地，天空是灰的，海也是灰的。街上的人，都低著頭走路，好像很累很累的樣子。」\n\n「那一定是噩夢！」阿釁拍著胸脯保證，「放心！你現在在鹿陽國小！這裡有鳳凰樹、有綠草地、有我們！」\n\n「嗯。」未晞笑了，「有你們在，我就不怕了。」\n\n可是，晴晴注意到了。\n\n未晞說「不怕」的時候，她的手，正輕輕地，摸著手腕上的手環。\n\n像是摸著什麼……隨時會消失的東西。\n\n接下來的一個星期，未晞的「噩夢」，越來越嚴重了。\n\n一開始，只是在早上。\n\n後來，變成了上課中。\n\n「未晞？未晞！」自然老師連續叫了她三次，她才回過神來，「你怎麼了？剛才講到哪裡了？」\n\n「啊？我……」未晞茫然地看著黑板，愣了好幾秒，「對不起，老師……我剛才，走神了。」\n\n「身體不舒服嗎？」自然老師擔心地問，「要不要去保健室？」\n\n「不用了，老師。」未晞搖搖頭，「我休息一下就好。」\n\n可是，坐在她前面的晴晴，卻看到了一個不尋常的景象——\n\n未晞低頭的瞬間，她手腕上的手環，忽然閃過一道刺眼的藍光。\n\n那道藍光，只閃了一瞬間。\n\n但晴晴清清楚楚地，看到了手環內側，那一行一直存在的倒數數字。\n\n上個星期，還是三十八。\n\n現在，變成了……三十四。\n\n「才一個星期，就掉了四格？」晴晴的心，猛地一沉。\n\n放學後，晴晴沒有回家。\n\n她守在教室門口，等到所有人都走了，才走到未晞的座位前。\n\n「未晞，」晴晴壓低聲音，「你最近……是不是發生了什麼事？」\n\n未晞正在收拾書包的手，頓了一下。\n\n「沒有啊。」她沒回頭，聲音卻微微發抖，「我很好。」\n\n「你騙人。」晴晴走到她面前，「你上課的時候，會突然發呆；你的黑眼圈，一天比一天深；還有你的手環——」她指著未晞的手腕，「上星期還是三十八，現在只剩下三十四了！」\n\n未晞的動作，徹底僵住了。\n\n「晴晴……」過了很久，她才開口，聲音啞啞的，「你……看到了？」\n\n「嗯。」晴晴點頭，「未晞，這個數字，是不是代表……你剩下的時間？」\n\n未晞沉默了。\n\n她低頭，看著自己手腕上的手環。\n\n過了很久很久，她才輕輕地，說了一句：\n\n「……它變快了。」\n\n「什麼變快了？」晴晴追問。\n\n「倒數。」未晞的聲音，輕得像一片羽毛，「我剛來的時候，它的倒數速度，是穩定的。可是最近……」她停頓了一下，「它越走越快了。」\n\n「為什麼會變快？」\n\n「我不知道。」未晞搖搖頭，「可能……是因為我用了太多『未來的力量』。」\n\n「未來的力量？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞低下頭，「我用手環投影未來給你看、用未來學到的知識幫大家分類垃圾、預測天氣……每一次使用，手環的能量，就會消耗一點。最近……」\n\n「最近？」\n\n「最近，」未晞的聲音，帶著一點點顫抖，「我常常不小心，就『看見』未來。」\n\n「看見未來？」\n\n「就是……」未晞抬起頭，眼神裡帶著一種說不出的茫然，「有時候，我會突然分不清楚，我到底是在這裡，還是在未來。剛才上自然課的時候，我一抬頭，黑板不見了，眼前變成了一片灰黃色的天空。然後老師叫我，我才……」\n\n她沒有說下去。\n\n但晴晴已經懂了。\n\n「未晞……」晴晴抓住她的手，「你這樣，很危險！如果有一天，你『回不來』了……」\n\n「我知道。」未晞輕輕抽回手，聲音平靜得讓人心疼，「我知道。所以……我會努力，不要讓自己『迷失』太久。」\n\n「可是……」\n\n「晴晴，」未晞打斷她，語氣裡帶著懇求，「這件事，不要告訴其他人，好嗎？我不想讓大家擔心。」\n\n晴晴沉默了。\n\n「……好。」她最後說，「我幫你保密。可是未晞，」她認真地看著未晞，「如果你真的很不舒服，一定要告訴我！我們一起想辦法！」\n\n「嗯。」未晞笑了，「謝謝你，晴晴。」\n\n可是，接下來的日子，未晞的狀況，不但沒有好轉，反而越來越嚴重了。\n\n第三天，午休時間。\n\n未晞趴在桌上，閉著眼睛休息。\n\n忽然，她的眼皮，劇烈地跳動起來。她的身體，也開始微微顫抖。\n\n「未晞？未晞！」晴晴發現不對勁，衝過去搖她，「未晞！你醒醒！」\n\n未晞猛地睜開眼睛。\n\n她的瞳孔裡，還殘留著一片灰黃色的景象。\n\n「我……我在哪裡？」她茫然地問。\n\n「你在學校！在我們班！」晴晴握著她的手，「未晞，你剛才怎麼了？！」\n\n「我……」未晞喘著氣，聲音帶著哭腔，「我看到……我看到奶奶了。」\n\n「奶奶？」晴晴愣住，「你奶奶？」\n\n「奶奶她……」未晞的眼眶，一下子紅了，「她在排隊領水。她好瘦好瘦，手一直在發抖。我想叫她，可是她聽不到……」\n\n「未晞……」晴晴的心，揪成了一團。\n\n「然後我看到……」未晞的聲音越來越輕，「我看到她回到我們家，用很小很小的水，煮了一鍋飯。她把大部分的飯，都分給了隔壁的小孩子。自己只喝了一碗水……」\n\n「她說……」未晞的眼淚，一滴一滴地掉下來，「她說，『未晞啊，奶奶吃不下。你把飯，留給別人吃。』」\n\n「她不是吃不下。」未晞哭著說，「她是捨不得吃。她想把食物，留給別人……」\n\n晴晴的眼眶，也紅了。\n\n她緊緊握著未晞的手，一句話都說不出來。\n\n那天晚上，未晞的「閃回」，又出現了。\n\n這次，她看到的，不是未來。\n\n而是「過去」——過去幾十年間，真實發生過的事情。\n\n「我看到好大的水災，」隔天早上，未晞虛弱地，對晴晴說，「一整個城市，都泡在水裡。大人們說，那是幾十年來最大的洪水。」\n\n「然後我又看到，一個很高很高的山上，冰川塌下來了，把一條河堵住了，河水淹沒了下面的村莊……」\n\n「還有好熱好熱的夏天，柏油路被曬到軟掉，有人熱暈在路上……」\n\n「這些……」未晞的聲音顫抖著，「這些都是真實發生過的。在我們那個時代的課本裡，這些都是『歷史』。」\n\n「歷史？」晴晴的心，猛地一跳。\n\n「嗯。」未晞低下頭，「在我們的課本裡，這些事情，都叫做『氣候變遷的教訓』。每一頁，都寫著——『如果當時的人們，願意早一點行動……』」\n\n「『如果當時的人們，願意早一點行動……』」晴晴重複著這句話。\n\n「晴晴，」未晞抬起頭，看著她，「你們現在做的每一件事，都是在改寫我們課本裡的『歷史』。你懂嗎？」\n\n晴晴沉默了。\n\n「我懂。」她最後說，聲音裡，帶著前所未有的一種沉重，「可是未晞……你付出的代價，太大了。」\n\n那天晚上，晴晴做了一件「奇怪」的事。\n\n她拜託溜溜，把過去幾十年間，世界各地發生過的極端天氣事件，全部整理出來。\n\n「嗶嗶！資料量很大，班長大人！」溜溜一邊調資料，一邊報告，「從我記憶體裡的舊新聞開始——」\n\n「二〇〇五年的超級颶風，淹沒了一座城市。」\n\n「二〇一〇年，俄羅斯的熱浪，燒掉了大片的森林。」\n\n「二〇二一年的洪水，整個小鎮一夜之間消失。」\n\n「二〇二五年，歐洲的熱浪，熱死了幾萬人。」\n\n「二〇二六年……」溜溜的聲音，忽然變慢了，「尼泊爾的冰川崩落，摧毀了邊境口岸；中國南方的破紀錄暴雨，一天下完一整年的雨；全球海溫創下新高……」\n\n晴晴盯著那些資料，久久說不出話。\n\n「溜溜，」她最後開口，「你有沒有發現……這些『新聞』，好像……」\n\n「好像在變多？」溜溜接著說，「而且，一次比一次嚴重？」\n\n「對。」晴晴點頭，「就像未晞說的——『如果當時的人們，願意早一點行動』。」\n\n「班長大人，」溜溜低聲問，「你是想說……這些新聞，就是未晞課本裡的『歷史』？」\n\n「我不知道。」晴晴搖搖頭，「可是，如果這些事情，一件一件地繼續發生下去……四十年後，未晞課本裡寫的那些『教訓』，就會變成真的。」\n\n「那……」溜溜的聲音，帶著一點點害怕，「我們現在做的這些，還來得及嗎？」\n\n「我不知道。」晴晴最後說，「可是……如果連我們都不做了，那就真的來不及了。」\n\n那天晚上，未晞的閃回，比以往任何一次，都要清晰。\n\n她看到自己，站在未來的街道上。\n\n天空是灰黃色的，太陽被一層厚厚的煙霧擋住，只露出一個模糊的輪廓。街道兩旁的樹，全都枯了，只剩下光禿禿的枝幹，像一隻隻朝天空伸著的手。\n\n她沿著街道往前走。\n\n路邊的牆上，貼著一張褪色的海報：「節約用水，人人有責。本週配給量：每人每日四公升。」\n\n「四公升……」未晞低頭，看著路邊一排排提著水桶、沉默排隊的人們，「一公升的水，只能……」\n\n「洗一把臉。」排在她前面的一個婦人，頭也不回地，喃喃地說，「或者，煮一小鍋飯。或者，給小孩喝。」\n\n「阿姨，」未晞輕輕問，「你們……這樣生活多久了？」\n\n「多久了？」婦人想了想，「我小的時候，河水還是清的。我奶奶說，她小時候，河水可以喝。」\n\n「可是……」婦人低下頭，聲音裡沒有一絲情緒，「我女兒出生的時候，河水，已經變成灰色的了。」\n\n未晞的腳，忽然像被釘在地上。\n\n她低頭，看著自己的手。\n\n那雙手，在這個時代，曾經撿起過孩子們寫的信。\n\n「我……」她喃喃地說，「我好像……快要想起來了。」\n\n「想起來什麼？」婦人問。\n\n「想起來……」未晞抬起頭，看著灰黃色的天空，「想起來，在很久很久以前，有一個小女孩，對我說過——」\n\n「『你做的每一件事，都是為了讓地球，活下去。』」\n\n「誰說的？」婦人問。\n\n未晞沉默了很久。\n\n「……一個，我最重要的人說的。」她低聲說。\n\n然後，閃回結束了。\n\n未晞猛地回過神，發現自己正坐在教室裡，滿頭冷汗。\n\n「未晞！」晴晴擔心地看著她，「你剛才……又發作了？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞喘著氣，輕輕點頭，「可是……我看到了，一些重要的東西。」\n\n「什麼？」\n\n「我看到……」未晞低下頭，「未來的我，正站在一條街上。而她的心裡，一直記得一句話。」\n\n「什麼話？」\n\n「『你做的每一件事，都是為了讓地球，活下去。』」未晞輕輕說，「那是……我對未來的自己，說過的話。」\n\n「沒關係。」未晞微微笑了，「只要……值得。」\n\n然而，命運，並沒有給未晞太多「值得」的時間。\n\n第四天晚上，未晞的手環，出現了新的變化。\n\n那晚，未晞坐在窗邊，看著手環。\n\n手環內側的數字，在月光下，靜靜地閃爍。\n\n——三十一。\n\n「三天，掉了三格……」未晞低聲說，「速度，又變快了。」\n\n她輕輕地，把手環貼在胸口。\n\n「奶奶，」她對著夜空，低聲說，「我好像……快要回去了。」\n\n「可是……」她低下頭，「我還沒有，看到大家把地球救回來的樣子。」\n\n「我還沒有看到，孩子們寫的那些信，被寄到我時代的那一天。」\n\n「我還沒有……」她輕輕閉上眼睛，「好好地，跟他們說再見。」\n\n未晞想起，她離開未來的那一天，奶奶塞給她的那個布包。\n\n布包裡，除了那張泛黃的照片，還有一張紙條。\n\n紙條上，奶奶用歪歪扭扭的字，寫著：\n\n「未晞：\n奶奶不會寫字，這幾個字，是請隔壁的小芬姐姐幫我寫的。\n奶奶要跟你說——不管你去了哪裡，奶奶都在這裡等你。\n你要好好吃飯，好好睡覺，好好地，替奶奶看看那個世界。\n如果有一天，你真的回不來了……也沒關係。\n奶奶會在夢裡，繼續等你。」\n\n「奶奶……」未晞把紙條貼在胸口，眼淚一滴一滴地掉下來，「我會回來的。我一定會回來的……」\n\n「可是……」她低下頭，「我回來的時候，要帶著好消息回來。」\n\n「我要告訴奶奶——」她抬起頭，看著夜空，眼神裡閃爍著堅定的光芒，「有一群孩子，正在拯救地球。」\n\n「他們……」她輕輕地笑了，「比任何大人，都還要努力。」\n\n就在這時，她的眼前，忽然又是一片灰黃——\n\n「未晞！未晞！」晴晴的聲音，焦急地響起。\n\n未晞回過神來，發現自己不知道什麼時候，已經倒在房間的地板上。\n\n「我……怎麼了？」她茫然地問。\n\n「你昏倒了！」晴晴蹲在她面前，氣喘吁吁，「你媽媽打電話給我，說你一直沒有回訊息！我衝過來，發現你倒在這裡！」\n\n「我……」未晞低頭，看著自己的手環。\n\n手環上的數字，正從三十一，跳成了……三十。\n\n「又掉了一格。」未晞喃喃地說，「剛才……我看到了什麼？」\n\n「你看到了什麼？」晴晴緊張地問。\n\n「我看到了……」未晞皺著眉頭，努力回想，「一個小女孩。她穿著……跟我們一樣的制服。她在一棵樹下面……」\n\n「然後呢？」\n\n「然後……」未晞的眉頭，越皺越緊，「然後她抬頭，看到了一封信。一封……從很遠很遠的過去，寄來的信。」\n\n「信？」晴晴的心，猛地一跳。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「信上好像寫著……『給未來的地球：你好！我是阿釁！』」\n\n晴晴愣住了。\n\n「阿釁？」她難以置信地重複，「那是阿釁寫的信！」\n\n「是啊……」未晞也愣住了，「可是……我怎麼會看到阿釁寫的信？」\n\n「未晞，」晴晴的聲音，微微發抖，「你看到的……會不會是『未來的你』？」\n\n「未來的我？」\n\n「就是……」晴晴深吸一口氣，「四十年後的你！你在未來，收到了我們現在寄出去的信！」\n\n未晞愣住了。\n\n她低下頭，看著自己的手環，又抬頭，看向窗外。\n\n「四十年後的我……」她喃喃地說，「會收到他們的信嗎？」\n\n月光，靜靜地照著她。\n\n她輕輕地，笑了。\n\n「……如果會的話，」她低聲說，「那一定，是這個世界上，最溫暖的信。」\n\n然而，那一晚，晴晴回家之後，卻怎麼也睡不著。\n\n她躺在黑暗裡，看著天花板，腦海裡，一直迴盪著未晞那句「它變快了」。\n\n「倒數變快了……」她低聲說，「代表未晞剩下的時間，越來越少了。」\n\n她爬起來，打開手機，開始搜尋資料。\n\n「溜溜，」她對著手機裡的溜溜通訊器問，「手環的倒數，有沒有可能……突然加速？」\n\n「嗶嗶……」溜溜的聲音，難得地低沉，「理論上……有可能。如果使用者，在某一段時間內，消耗了過多的能量，倒數速度就會加快。」\n\n「就像……」晴晴問，「電量用太快？」\n\n「對。」溜溜說，「就像手機的電池，如果一直開著最耗電的程式，電量就會一下子掉光。未晞她……」\n\n「她一直在用『未來的力量』。」晴晴喃喃地說，「幫我們分類、預測、投影……她把自己的『電量』，都用在了我們身上。」\n\n「班長大人……」溜溜低聲說，「這樣下去，未晞她……」\n\n「我知道。」晴晴握緊手機，聲音微微顫抖，「她可能會……比預計的時間，更早回去。」\n\n從那天起，晴晴的鉛筆盒裡，多了一本小小的筆記本。\n\n筆記本的第一頁，寫著一行字：「未晞的倒數紀錄。」\n\n每天早上，晴晴都會趁未晞不注意，偷偷看一眼她手腕上的手環，然後在筆記本上，記下那個數字。\n\n「一月十五日：三十。」\n\n「一月十八日：二十七。」\n\n「一月二十日：二十五。」\n\n數字，一格一格地，往下掉。\n\n「班長大人，」溜溜看著那些數字，聲音越來越低，「倒數的速度……好像又快了一點。」\n\n「我知道。」晴晴握緊筆，輕輕說。\n\n「要不要……告訴大家？」溜溜問，「至少，讓阿釁知道？」\n\n「還不行。」晴晴搖搖頭，「未晞說過，她想讓大家，在不知道倒數的情況下，開開心心地做環保。她不想讓大家……為她擔心。」\n\n「可是……」溜溜低下頭，「這樣下去，大家總有一天會發現的。」\n\n「那就……」晴晴放下筆，看向窗外，「那就等到那一天再說吧。現在，我們能做的，就是在她回去之前……讓這個世界，變得好一點。」\n\n「……」溜溜沉默了。\n\n牠看著晴晴筆記本上那些數字，忽然覺得，那些數字，不只是「倒數」。\n\n那是……一個孩子，對另一個孩子的，最溫柔的承諾。\n\n那一夜，晴晴一直坐到天亮。\n\n她沒有哭。\n\n她只是在筆記本上，一筆一筆地，記下那行數字：\n\n「三十八、三十四、三十一、三十……」\n\n「從今天開始，」她低聲說，「我要好好記錄這個數字。」\n\n「然後……」她抬起頭，眼神裡，閃爍著堅定的光芒，「我要在數字歸零之前，讓大家……都學會保護地球。」\n\n「這樣，未晞她……」她輕輕地，在筆記本上寫下最後一行字：\n\n「才能安心地，回到屬於她的時代。」\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 13: Weixi's Future Memories & the Countdown\n\nThe \"Track the Pipe\" operation was unfolding in full swing.\n\nThe children used the money raised at the fair to buy water quality testing tools, split into four groups, and investigated along the drainage ditch, bit by bit toward the upstream.\n\n\"This stretch of water—odor index eighty-five!\" \"Mine is ninety-two over here!\" \"At the river mouth, the discolored area of the seawater has expanded again!\"\n\n\"Keep going! We're definitely going to find out the truth about that pipe!\" Qingqing cheered everyone on loudly.\n\nEverything seemed to be moving in a good direction.\n\nExcept... Weixi.\n\n\"Weixi, what's wrong?\" During morning self-study that day, Lin Yunyun was the first to notice something different about Weixi, \"Why is your face so pale?\"\n\n\"It's nothing.\" Weixi shook her head, forcing a smile, \"I just... didn't sleep well last night.\"\n\n\"Didn't sleep well?\" A-Xin leaned in, \"Your dark circles have been getting worse lately! You're not secretly reading comics until midnight, are you?\"\n\n\"I'm not secretly reading comics.\" Weixi laughed helplessly.\n\n\"Then why can't you sleep?\" A-Xin pressed.\n\n\"Because...\" Weixi thought for a moment and said, \"I keep having dreams. Dreams about... some very strange places.\"\n\n\"What places?\" Lin Yunyun asked curiously.\n\n\"A...\" Weixi lowered her head, her voice soft, \"a gray place.\"\n\n\"Gray?\" The children looked at each other.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"No phoenix trees, no green grass. The sky is gray, and so is the sea. The people on the streets all walk with their heads down, as if they're very, very tired.\"\n\n\"That must be a nightmare!\" A-Xin patted his chest in assurance, \"Don't worry! You're at Luyang Elementary now! There are phoenix trees, green grass, and us!\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi smiled, \"With you all here, I'm not afraid.\"\n\nBut Qingqing noticed something.\n\nWhen Weixi said \"not afraid,\" her hand was gently touching the bracelet on her wrist.\n\nAs if touching something... that could disappear at any moment.\n\nOver the next week, Weixi's \"nightmares\" grew more and more serious.\n\nAt first, it was only in the mornings.\n\nThen, it spread to class time.\n\n\"Weixi? Weixi!\" The natural science teacher called her name three times before she snapped back to reality, \"What's wrong? Where were we?\"\n\n\"Ah? I...\" Weixi looked at the blackboard in a daze for several seconds, \"I'm sorry, teacher... I just... zoned out.\"\n\n\"Are you feeling unwell?\" The natural science teacher asked worriedly, \"Do you want to go to the health room?\"\n\n\"No need, teacher.\" Weixi shook her head, \"I'll be fine after a little rest.\"\n\nBut Qingqing, sitting in front of her, saw an unusual sight—\n\nThe moment Weixi lowered her head, the bracelet on her wrist suddenly flashed with a blinding blue light.\n\nThat blue light lasted only an instant.\n\nBut Qingqing saw it clearly—the countdown number on the inside of the bracelet that had always been there.\n\nLast week, it was still thirty-eight.\n\nNow, it had become... thirty-four.\n\n\"In just one week, it dropped four digits?\" Qingqing's heart sank heavily.\n\nAfter school, Qingqing didn't go home.\n\nShe waited at the classroom door until everyone had left, then walked to Weixi's seat.\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing lowered her voice, \"have you... been going through something lately?\"\n\nThe hand Weixi was using to pack her backpack paused.\n\n\"Nothing.\" She didn't turn around, but her voice trembled slightly, \"I'm fine.\"\n\n\"You're lying.\" Qingqing walked in front of her, \"You zone out during class; your dark circles get deeper every day; and your bracelet—\" she pointed at Weixi's wrist, \"it was thirty-eight last week, and now it's only thirty-four!\"\n\nWeixi's movements froze completely.\n\n\"Qingqing...\" it was a long moment before she spoke, her voice hoarse, \"you... saw it?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Qingqing nodded, \"Weixi, does this number mean... how much time you have left?\"\n\nWeixi fell silent.\n\nShe lowered her head and looked at the bracelet on her wrist.\n\nAfter a very, very long moment, she finally said softly:\n\n\"...It's gotten faster.\"\n\n\"What's gotten faster?\" Qingqing pressed.\n\n\"The countdown.\" Weixi's voice was light as a feather, \"When I first arrived, its countdown speed was steady. But lately...\" she paused, \"it's been moving faster and faster.\"\n\n\"Why would it get faster?\"\n\n\"I don't know.\" Weixi shook her head, \"Maybe... because I've been using too much 'power of the future.'\"\n\n\"The power of the future?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi lowered her head, \"I projected the future for you with the bracelet, used future knowledge to help everyone sort trash, predicted the weather... every use consumes a little of the bracelet's energy. Lately...\"\n\n\"Lately?\"\n\n\"Lately,\" Weixi's voice carried a hint of trembling, \"I keep accidentally... 'seeing' the future.\"\n\n\"Seeing the future?\"\n\n\"It's like...\" Weixi looked up, a nameless bewilderment in her eyes, \"sometimes, I suddenly can't tell whether I'm here or in the future. Just now in natural science class, when I looked up, the blackboard was gone, and in front of me was a grayish-yellow sky. Then the teacher called me, and I...\"\n\nShe didn't finish.\n\nBut Qingqing already understood.\n\n\"Weixi...\" Qingqing grabbed her hand, \"you're in danger like this! If one day, you can't 'come back'...\"\n\n\"I know.\" Weixi gently withdrew her hand, her voice so calm it was heartbreaking, \"I know. So... I'll try hard not to 'lose myself' for too long.\"\n\n\"But...\"\n\n\"Qingqing,\" Weixi interrupted her, a plea in her tone, \"don't tell the others about this, okay? I don't want to worry everyone.\"\n\nQingqing fell silent.\n\n\"...Fine.\" She finally said, \"I'll keep it secret for you. But Weixi,\" she looked at her seriously, \"if you really feel unwell, you must tell me! We'll figure it out together!\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi smiled, \"Thank you, Qingqing.\"\n\nBut in the days that followed, Weixi's condition didn't improve; instead, it grew more and more severe.\n\nOn the third day, at nap time.\n\nWeixi lay on her desk with her eyes closed, resting.\n\nSuddenly, her eyelids twitched violently. Her body also began to tremble slightly.\n\n\"Weixi? Weixi!\" Qingqing sensed something wrong and rushed over, shaking her, \"Weixi! Wake up!\"\n\nWeixi's eyes snapped open.\n\nA grayish-yellow scene still lingered in her pupils.\n\n\"I... where am I?\" she asked in a daze.\n\n\"You're at school! In our class!\" Qingqing held her hand, \"Weixi, what just happened?!\"\n\n\"I...\" Weixi gasped, her voice choked with tears, \"I saw... I saw Grandma.\"\n\n\"Grandma?\" Qingqing froze, \"Your grandmother?\"\n\n\"Grandma...\" Weixi's eyes suddenly turned red, \"she was lining up for water. She was so thin, her hands shaking the whole time. I wanted to call her, but she couldn't hear me...\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" Qingqing's heart twisted into a knot.\n\n\"Then I saw...\" Weixi's voice grew softer and softer, \"she went back to our house and cooked a pot of rice with a tiny bit of water. She gave most of the rice to the kids next door. She only drank a bowl of water herself...\"\n\n\"She said...\" Weixi's tears fell drop by drop, \"she said, 'Weixi ah, Grandma can't eat. Give the food to others.'\"\n\n\"It's not that she couldn't eat.\" Weixi sobbed, \"She couldn't bear to eat. She wanted to save the food for others...\"\n\nQingqing's eyes turned red too.\n\nShe held Weixi's hand tightly, unable to say a word.\n\nThat night, Weixi's \"flashback\" appeared again.\n\nThis time, what she saw wasn't the future.\n\nIt was the \"past\"—things that had really happened over the past few decades.\n\n\"I saw a huge flood,\" the next morning, Weixi said weakly to Qingqing, \"a whole city underwater. The adults said it was the biggest flood in decades.\"\n\n\"Then I saw a glacier on a very high mountain collapsing, blocking a river, and the water flooding the villages below...\"\n\n\"And a very, very hot summer, the asphalt melting and people fainting on the roads...\"\n\n\"These...\" Weixi's voice trembled, \"these really happened. In the textbooks of our era, these are all 'history.'\"\n\n\"History?\" Qingqing's heart leaped.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi lowered her head, \"In our textbooks, all of these are called 'the lessons of climate change.' Every page says—'if the people of that time had been willing to act a little earlier...'\"\n\n\"'If the people of that time had been willing to act a little earlier...'\" Qingqing repeated the phrase.\n\n\"Qingqing,\" Weixi looked up at her, \"every thing you're doing now is rewriting the 'history' in our textbooks. Do you understand?\"\n\nQingqing fell silent.\n\n\"I understand.\" She finally said, her voice carrying an unprecedented heaviness, \"But Weixi... the price you're paying is too great.\"\n\nThat night, Qingqing did something \"strange.\"\n\nShe asked Liu-Liu to compile all the extreme weather events that had occurred around the world over the past few decades.\n\n\"Beep beep! The amount of data is huge, Class President!\" Liu-Liu reported while pulling up data, \"Starting with the old news in my memory—\"\n\n\"The super hurricane of 2005 flooded a whole city.\"\n\n\"In 2010, Russia's heatwave burned up vast forests.\"\n\n\"In 2021, a flood made an entire town disappear overnight.\"\n\n\"In 2025, Europe's heatwave killed tens of thousands of people.\"\n\n\"In 2026...\" Liu-Liu's voice suddenly slowed, \"the glacier collapse in Nepal destroyed the border crossing; record-breaking torrential rain in southern China dumped a whole year's rain in one day; global sea temperatures hit a new high...\"\n\nQingqing stared at those records, unable to speak for a long time.\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" she finally spoke, \"have you noticed... these 'news' items, seem to...\"\n\n\"Seem to be increasing?\" Liu-Liu continued, \"And getting more severe each time?\"\n\n\"Yes.\" Qingqing nodded, \"Just like Weixi said—'if the people of that time had been willing to act a little earlier.'\"\n\n\"Class President,\" Liu-Liu asked in a low voice, \"are you saying... these news items are the 'history' in Weixi's textbook?\"\n\n\"I don't know.\" Qingqing shook her head, \"But if these things keep happening one after another... then forty years from now, the 'lessons' written in Weixi's textbook will come true.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Liu-Liu's voice carried a hint of fear, \"is what we're doing now... still in time?\"\n\n\"I don't know.\" Qingqing finally said, \"But... if even we stop doing it, then it really will be too late.\"\n\nThat night, Weixi's flashback was clearer than ever before.\n\nShe saw herself standing on a street of the future.\n\nThe sky was grayish-yellow, the sun blocked by a thick layer of smog, showing only a blurry outline. The trees on both sides of the street were all dead, leaving only bare branches, like hands reaching toward the sky.\n\nShe walked along the street.\n\nOn the wall beside the road hung a faded poster: \"Save water, everyone's duty. This week's ration: four liters per person per day.\"\n\n\"Four liters...\" Weixi lowered her head, looking at the rows of silent people lining up with water buckets by the roadside, \"one liter of water can only...\"\n\n\"Wash a face.\" The woman in front of her said without turning her head, her voice flat, \"Or cook a small pot of rice. Or give it to the kids to drink.\"\n\n\"Auntie,\" Weixi asked softly, \"how long have you... been living like this?\"\n\n\"How long?\" The woman thought for a moment, \"When I was little, the river was still clear. My grandmother said that when she was little, you could drink the river water.\"\n\n\"But...\" the woman lowered her head, no emotion in her voice, \"when my daughter was born, the river had already turned gray.\"\n\nWeixi's feet suddenly felt nailed to the ground.\n\nShe lowered her head and looked at her own hands.\n\nThose hands, in this era, had once picked up the letters the children wrote.\n\n\"I...\" she murmured, \"I think I'm... about to remember.\"\n\n\"Remember what?\" The woman asked.\n\n\"Remember...\" Weixi looked up at the grayish-yellow sky, \"that a long, long time ago, a little girl once said to me—\"\n\n\"'Everything you do is to keep the Earth alive.'\"\n\n\"Who said that?\" The woman asked.\n\nWeixi was silent for a long time.\n\n\"...Someone who is the most important person to me.\" she said softly.\n\nThen the flashback ended.\n\nWeixi snapped back to reality, finding herself sitting in the classroom, covered in cold sweat.\n\n\"Weixi!\" Qingqing looked at her worriedly, \"did you... have an episode again?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi gasped and nodded gently, \"But... I saw something important.\"\n\n\"What?\"\n\n\"I saw...\" Weixi lowered her head, \"the future me, standing on a street. And in her heart, she always remembered one sentence.\"\n\n\"What sentence?\"\n\n\"'Everything you do is to keep the Earth alive.'\" Weixi said softly, \"That was... what I said to the future me.\"\n\n\"It doesn't matter.\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"As long as... it's worth it.\"\n\nHowever, fate didn't give Weixi much time for \"worth it.\"\n\nOn the fourth night, a new change appeared on Weixi's bracelet.\n\nThat night, Weixi sat by the window, looking at her bracelet.\n\nThe number on the inside of the bracelet flickered quietly in the moonlight.\n\n—Thirty-one.\n\n\"Three days, three digits...\" Weixi said in a low voice, \"the speed has gotten faster again.\"\n\nShe gently pressed the bracelet against her chest.\n\n\"Grandma,\" she said softly to the night sky, \"I think... I'm about to go back.\"\n\n\"But...\" she lowered her head, \"I haven't yet seen everyone save the Earth.\"\n\n\"I haven't yet seen the day when the letters the children wrote are delivered to my era.\"\n\n\"I haven't yet...\" she closed her eyes gently, \"said goodbye to them properly.\"\n\nWeixi remembered the day she left the future, and the cloth bundle her grandmother had pressed into her arms.\n\nInside the bundle, besides that yellowed photograph, there was also a note.\n\nOn the note, in her grandmother's crooked handwriting, was written:\n\n\"Weixi:\nGrandma can't write, so I asked Sister Xiaofen next door to write these words for me.\nGrandma wants to tell you—no matter where you go, Grandma will be here waiting for you.\nEat well, sleep well, and see that world properly for Grandma.\nIf one day, you really can't come back... that's okay too.\nGrandma will keep waiting for you in her dreams.\"\n\n\"Grandma...\" Weixi pressed the note against her chest, tears falling drop by drop, \"I will come back. I will definitely come back...\"\n\n\"But...\" she lowered her head, \"when I come back, I want to bring good news.\"\n\n\"I want to tell Grandma—\" she looked up at the night sky, a resolute light flickering in her eyes, \"there's a group of children saving the Earth.\"\n\n\"They...\" she smiled softly, \"are trying even harder than any adult.\"\n\nJust then, her vision suddenly turned grayish-yellow again—\n\n\"Weixi! Weixi!\" Qingqing's voice rang out anxiously.\n\nWeixi snapped back to reality, realizing she had somehow collapsed on the floor of her room.\n\n\"I... what happened?\" she asked in a daze.\n\n\"You fainted!\" Qingqing crouched in front of her, panting, \"Your mom called me, saying you hadn't replied to messages! I rushed over and found you collapsed here!\"\n\n\"I...\" Weixi lowered her head and looked at the bracelet on her wrist.\n\nThe number on the bracelet was jumping from thirty-one to... thirty.\n\n\"Dropped another digit.\" Weixi murmured, \"Just now... what did I see?\"\n\n\"What did you see?\" Qingqing asked nervously.\n\n\"I saw...\" Weixi frowned, trying hard to recall, \"a little girl. She was wearing... the same uniform as us. She was under a tree...\"\n\n\"And then?\"\n\n\"And then...\" Weixi's brow furrowed tighter and tighter, \"she looked up and saw a letter. A letter... mailed from a very, very distant past.\"\n\n\"A letter?\" Qingqing's heart leaped.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"The letter seemed to say... 'To the future Earth: Hello! I'm A-Xin!'\"\n\nQingqing froze.\n\n\"A-Xin?\" She repeated in disbelief, \"That's the letter A-Xin wrote!\"\n\n\"Yes...\" Weixi froze too, \"But... how could I see A-Xin's letter?\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing's voice trembled slightly, \"what you saw... could it be 'the future you'?\"\n\n\"The future me?\"\n\n\"It's...\" Qingqing took a deep breath, \"the you of forty years from now! In the future, you received the letters we sent out now!\"\n\nWeixi froze.\n\nShe lowered her head, looked at her bracelet, then looked up out the window.\n\n\"The me of forty years from now...\" she murmured, \"will receive their letters?\"\n\nThe moonlight shone quietly on her.\n\nShe smiled softly.\n\n\"...If that's the case,\" she said in a low voice, \"then that must be the warmest letter in the world.\"\n\nHowever, that night, after Qingqing went home, she couldn't sleep at all.\n\nShe lay in the darkness, staring at the ceiling, the phrase Weixi had said echoing in her mind—\"it's gotten faster.\"\n\n\"The countdown's gotten faster...\" she said in a low voice, \"that means Weixi has less and less time left.\"\n\nShe got up, opened her phone, and began searching for information.\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" she asked into the Liu-Liu communicator on her phone, \"is it possible for the bracelet's countdown... to suddenly speed up?\"\n\n\"Beep beep...\" Liu-Liu's voice was unusually low, \"theoretically... possible. If the user consumes too much energy in a certain period of time, the countdown speed will increase.\"\n\n\"Like...\" Qingqing asked, \"a phone battery draining too fast?\"\n\n\"Right.\" Liu-Liu said, \"Like a phone battery—if you keep running the most power-hungry app, the charge drops all at once. Weixi...\"\n\n\"She's been using the 'power of the future' all along.\" Qingqing murmured, \"Sorting for us, predicting, projecting... she's been spending all her 'battery' on us.\"\n\n\"Class President...\" Liu-Liu said in a low voice, \"at this rate, Weixi...\"\n\n\"I know.\" Qingqing gripped her phone, her voice trembling slightly, \"she might... have to go back much earlier than expected.\"\n\nFrom that day on, a small notebook appeared in Qingqing's pencil case.\n\nOn the first page of the notebook was written: \"Weixi's Countdown Record.\"\n\nEvery morning, Qingqing would steal a glance at the bracelet on Weixi's wrist when she wasn't looking, then write down the number in her notebook.\n\n\"January 15th: thirty.\"\n\n\"January 18th: twenty-seven.\"\n\n\"January 20th: twenty-five.\"\n\nThe numbers kept dropping, one by one.\n\n\"Class President,\" Liu-Liu looked at those numbers, its voice growing lower and lower, \"the countdown speed... seems to have gotten a little faster again.\"\n\n\"I know.\" Qingqing gripped her pen and said softly.\n\n\"Should we... tell everyone?\" Liu-Liu asked, \"At least let A-Xin know?\"\n\n\"Not yet.\" Qingqing shook her head, \"Weixi said she wants everyone to do environmental protection happily, without knowing about the countdown. She doesn't want everyone... to worry about her.\"\n\n\"But...\" Liu-Liu lowered its head, \"at this rate, everyone will find out eventually.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Qingqing put down her pen and looked out the window, \"we'll deal with that when the day comes. For now, what we can do is... make this world a little better before she goes back.\"\n\n\"...\" Liu-Liu fell silent.\n\nLooking at those numbers in Qingqing's notebook, it suddenly felt that those numbers weren't just a \"countdown.\"\n\nThey were... one child's gentlest promise to another child.\n\nThat night, Qingqing sat until dawn.\n\nShe didn't cry.\n\nShe just wrote, stroke by stroke, on her notebook, that string of numbers:\n\n\"Thirty-eight, thirty-four, thirty-one, thirty...\"\n\n\"From today on,\" she said in a low voice, \"I'm going to record this number carefully.\"\n\n\"Then...\" she looked up, a resolute light flickering in her eyes, \"before the number reaches zero, I'm going to make everyone... learn to protect the Earth.\"\n\n\"That way, Weixi...\" she wrote the final line softly in her notebook:\n\n\"can return to her era with peace of mind.\"\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":6,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第十四章：阿釁的發現與同盟擴大\n\n阿釁有一個祕密。\n\n這個祕密，連晴晴都不知道。\n\n那就是——阿釁的書包裡，藏著一本小小的筆記本。\n\n筆記本的封面，畫著一個歪歪斜斜的地球。\n\n筆記本的第一頁，寫著一行字：\n\n「未晞觀察紀錄（第一號）」\n\n「十月：轉學生報到。第一天就精準預測下午會下雨。可疑指數：★★」\n\n「她說她是從『很遠很遠、回不去的地方』來的。可疑指數：★★★★」\n\n「她手腕上的手環，溜溜說『不屬於這個世界』。可疑指數：★★★★★★」\n\n「十一月：她看著新聞裡的水災，低聲說『跟以前一樣』。『以前』？哪個以前？可疑指數：★★★★★★★★」\n\n「公園的枯樹前，她說『在我們那裡，也有很多樹，像你一樣』。『我們那裡』是哪裡？可疑指數：★★★★★★★★★★」\n\n「十二月：淨灘時，她突然大哭，說『整個沙灘都是垃圾，比人還高』。可是我們眼前明明沒有垃圾山。可疑指數：★★★★★★★★★★★★」\n\n「園遊會那天，她寫了一封信，寄給『四十年後的自己』。可疑指數：★★★★★★★★★★★★★★」\n\n「一月：她越來越常發呆。手環上的數字，一直往下掉。可疑指數：★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★」\n\n「結論：未晞她……」\n\n筆記本裡，還有更多密密麻麻的紀錄：\n\n「十月十五日：她又說中了。說下午三點會下雨，結果真的下了。她說她『聽得到風的聲音』。我聽風，只聽得到樹葉沙沙響。」\n\n「十月二十日：她對著窗外的鳳凰樹說『你好』。對一棵樹說你好？好吧，也許她只是有禮貌。」\n\n「十一月二日：自然課，老師講到『全球暖化』。她一整節課都沒說話，下課後，她一個人站在走廊上，看了很久很久的天。」\n\n「十一月十八日：她說出午餐的高麗菜是『三天前從山腳下的農場運來的』。我問她怎麼知道，她說『它們告訴我的』。菜會說話嗎？」\n\n「十二月八日：她看著學校後面的排水溝，發了整整五分鐘的呆。那條溝很臭，我連一秒都不想多待。」\n\n「十二月二十五日：聖誕節。她送給全班一人一張手繪的小卡片。我的是『給阿釁：你是最棒的點子王』。她怎麼知道我喜歡當點子王？」\n\n「一月五日：她又發呆了。這次是在午餐時間，眼睛直直地看著前面，我叫了她三次，她才回過神來，跟我說『對不起』。」\n\n「一月十日：園遊會。她寫了一封信，投進『給未來』的郵筒。我偷偷看了她的信——她是寫給『四十年後的自己』的。」\n\n「一月十二日：她放學後，一個人坐在海堤上。夕陽下，她看起來……好孤單。」\n\n「一月十四日：今天，她說了一句話，讓我決定，一定要查清楚她的祕密。」\n\n「她說：『阿釁，如果有一天，我不在了，請你們繼續保護地球。』」\n\n「她說這句話的時候，眼睛裡，帶著一種……好像早就知道自己會離開的眼神。」\n\n阿釁握著筆，猶豫了很久很久，才在那行字下面，寫下兩個字：\n\n「……未來。」\n\n「如果她是從未來來的，」阿釁看著窗外，喃喃自語，「那她來這裡，是為了什麼？」\n\n「還有，」他低下頭，看著筆記本上最後一行紀錄，「她手環上的數字，為什麼一直在掉？」\n\n那天下午，阿釁做了一個決定。\n\n他要去看看，未晞放學後，到底在做什麼。\n\n放學鐘聲響起，孩子們三三兩兩地走出校門。\n\n未晞沒有回家。\n\n她一個人，沿著學校後方的海堤，慢慢地走著。\n\n阿釁躲在樹叢後面，小心翼翼地跟著。\n\n未晞走到海堤盡頭，坐了下來，看著遠方那片灰濛濛的海。\n\n然後，她做了一件讓阿釁的心，猛地一揪的事。\n\n她低頭，看著手腕上的手環，輕輕地，說了一句：\n\n「二十四了。」\n\n「二十四？」阿釁躲在樹叢裡，屏住呼吸，「什麼二十四？！」\n\n「上星期還是三十……」未晞低聲喃喃著，「再這樣下去……」\n\n「再這樣下去，會怎樣？」阿釁的心跳，越來越快。\n\n就在這時——\n\n「嗯？」未晞忽然抬起頭，眼神猛地失焦，聲音也變了調，「這……這裡是……？」\n\n她的瞳孔，瞬間變得渙散，整個人像是被抽走了靈魂一樣，僵在原地。\n\n「未晞！」阿釁再也顧不得隱藏，從樹叢裡衝出來，跑到她面前，「未晞！你怎麼了？！」\n\n未晞沒有反應。\n\n她的眼睛，直勾勾地，看著前方，嘴裡喃喃地唸著：「灰灰的天……好多水……淹過來了……」\n\n「未晞！！」阿釁抓住她的肩膀，用力搖晃，「你醒醒！！你看清楚！這裡是鹿陽國小的海堤！沒有水淹過來！」\n\n「阿釁……」未晞的眼神，慢慢地，重新對上了焦，「你……怎麼在這裡？」\n\n「我……」阿釁喘著氣，「我擔心你，所以……」\n\n他話還沒說完，就被未晞手腕上，那行正在快速跳動的數字，吸住了目光。\n\n「二十七……二十六……二十五……」阿釁瞪大眼睛，「這個數字，還在往下掉！」\n\n未晞的臉色，一下子白了。\n\n她猛地，把袖子拉下來，蓋住手環。\n\n「阿釁！」她的聲音，帶著前所未有的慌張，「你……你看到了？」\n\n「我看到了。」阿釁直視著她，語氣裡，帶著一種連他自己都沒發現的認真，「未晞，你告訴我，那個數字，到底是什麼？」\n\n未晞沉默了很久很久。\n\n久到阿釁以為，她永遠不會回答了。\n\n然後，未晞開口了。\n\n「阿釁，」她的聲音，輕得像一片羽毛，「如果我告訴你……我是從未來來的。你信嗎？」\n\n阿釁的心臟，像是被一隻手，猛地握住了。\n\n「……我信。」他說。\n\n未晞愣住了。\n\n「你信？」她難以置信地問，「你……為什麼會信？」\n\n「因為……」阿釁掏出了那本畫著地球的筆記本，「我從十月份開始，就一直在記錄你的『可疑行為』。」\n\n「你預言下雨、說得出菜的產地、對著枯樹說話、看著新聞說『跟以前一樣』、淨灘時看到別人看不到的垃圾山、寄信給四十年後的自己……還有這個手環。」\n\n阿釁指著未晞的手腕：「溜溜說，它的頻段『不屬於這個世界』。而你剛才說，它的數字，從三十掉到了二十四。」\n\n「阿釁……」未晞的聲音，微微發抖，「你……觀察我多久了？」\n\n「從你第一天來學校，就開始了。」阿釁說。\n\n未晞低下頭。\n\n風，吹過海堤。\n\n過了很久，她才輕輕地，開口：\n\n「那……你想知道真相嗎？」\n\n「想。」阿釁毫不猶豫地點頭，「可是，如果你不想說，我也不會逼你。我只是……」\n\n「只是什麼？」\n\n「只是想讓你知道，」阿釁看著她，眼神認真得不像平常的他，「不管你從哪裡來，不管你身上有多少祕密——你都是我們『守護地球作戰部隊』的一員。你的事，就是我的事。」\n\n未晞的眼眶，一下子紅了。\n\n「阿釁……」她吸了吸鼻子，終於，下定決心，「好。我告訴你。」\n\n於是，那天傍晚，海堤上，阿釁聽完了未晞的故事。\n\n她說，四十年後的地球，海平面比現在高了快一公尺。台中港泡在海裡，龍井的海堤，變成了一堵破爛的廢牆。\n\n她說，她小時候，從來沒有見過「下雨下不完」以外的天氣。夏天常常超過四十度，柏油路軟得像布丁。\n\n她說，她的學校，有一堂課叫做「氣候課」。課本裡，寫著這個時代的新聞——二〇二六年的冰川崩落、超級聖嬰、破紀錄洪水。老師說：「這些，都是歷史。」\n\n她說，她一直以為，這些「歷史」，是很久很久以前的事。直到有一天，奶奶指著一張泛黃的照片，對她說：「未晞啊，奶奶小時候的海，不是這個樣子的。」\n\n「那奶奶，」她問，「海，原本是什麼樣子？」\n\n奶奶沉默了很久，才說：「奶奶也快忘了。可是，我記得，它曾經是藍色的。」\n\n「藍色的海……」未晞對阿釁說，「那個時候，我才知道，原來海，可以是藍色的。」\n\n她說，從那天起，她就一直在想——如果能回到過去，告訴那些人，「你們現在做的每一件事，都會變成我們的未來」，那該有多好。\n\n「然後，」未晞低聲說，「我就真的，被送回來了。」\n\n「被送回來？」阿釁問，「是誰送你回來的？」\n\n「是……未來的科學家。」未晞說，「他們說，他們測試了所有的時空裝置，只有一個成功。他們說，我是『最適合的人選』。」\n\n「為什麼是你？」\n\n「因為……」未晞低下頭，「因為我記得這個時代。我是所有候選人裡，唯一一個，還記得『藍色的海』是什麼樣子的人。」\n\n聽她說，四十年後的地球，是如何一步步變成灰黃色的。\n\n聽她說，她是怎麼被選中，帶著手環，回到這個時代。\n\n聽她說，她必須在能量耗盡之前，回到未來，否則時空就會錯亂，大家都會消失。\n\n聽她說，她剩下的時間，已經不多了。\n\n「所以，」阿釁聽完，沉默了很久，才開口問，「你手環上的數字，就是你剩下的『日子』？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「從最開始的五十七，到現在的二十四。」\n\n「二十四天……」阿釁喃喃地重複著，「只有二十四天了……」\n\n「阿釁，」未晞看著他，眼神裡帶著請求，「這件事，只有晴晴知道。現在，又多了一個你。」\n\n「我希望……你不要告訴其他人。我不想讓大家……」\n\n「為你擔心。」阿釁替她接完，「我懂。」\n\n他低下頭，看著自己的筆記本。\n\n「未晞，」他忽然開口，「你知道嗎？其實，我早就猜到了。」\n\n「猜到什麼？」\n\n「猜到你不屬於這裡。」阿釁說，「可是，我一直不知道該怎麼面對這件事。因為……」\n\n「因為什麼？」\n\n「因為……」阿釁抬起頭，眼眶微微泛紅，「如果你真的會回去……那我們，就再也見不到你了。」\n\n未晞愣住了。\n\n她看著阿釁那張難得認真的臉，眼淚，忽然毫無預警地掉了下來。\n\n「阿釁……」她哽咽著，「你……」\n\n「別哭！」阿釁慌張地手忙腳亂，「我、我跟你開玩笑的！我、我這人最不會講這種話了！你、你別哭啊！」\n\n「誰哭了！」未晞破涕為笑，擦了擦眼淚，「我只是……沙子跑進眼睛裡了。」\n\n「好好好！沙子！都是沙子的錯！」阿釁連忙附和，「都怪這片海！」\n\n海堤上，兩個孩子，一個哭一個笑，鬧成一團。\n\n而海堤的另一頭，晴晴靜靜地站在樹後，看著這一幕，嘴角，微微上揚。\n\n「果然，」她低聲說，「瞞不過阿釁啊。」\n\n那天晚上，體育器材室。\n\n祕密同盟的「指揮部」，第一次，迎來了第三位成員。\n\n「所以，」阿釁雙手抱胸，坐在器材箱上，表情嚴肅，「我們的現況是：未晞剩下二十四天，而排水溝的污染，還在持續加劇。」\n\n「對。」晴晴點頭，「而且，那條管線的排放速度，一天比一天快。」\n\n「那我們要做什麼？」阿釁問。\n\n「我們原本的計畫是，」未晞說，「在倒數結束之前，盡可能地，讓大家學會保護地球。然後……」\n\n「然後，你就要回去。」阿釁替她說完，「對吧？」\n\n未晞低下頭，輕輕地，「嗯」了一聲。\n\n「可是，」阿釁忽然站起來，語氣裡帶著一股不服輸的勁兒，「我有一個更好的主意！」\n\n「什麼主意？」晴晴和未晞異口同聲地問。\n\n「既然我們只有二十四天，」阿釁的眼睛，亮晶晶的，「那我們就不要慢吞吞地『慢慢來』了！我們要——『加倍』！『加速』！把剩下的時間，用得比別人多一倍！」\n\n「加倍？」未晞愣住。\n\n「對！」阿釁用力點頭，「我們可以用『大作戰』的名義，把全班都動員起來！然後，我們三個，在背後偷偷加速！」\n\n「你是說……」晴晴的眼睛也亮了。\n\n「把『追查管線』的行動，提前！」阿釁說，「我們不是有溜溜的偵察數據嗎？不是有園遊會募到的錢嗎？我們就直接——查到底！看看那條管線的後面，到底是誰！」\n\n「可是……」未晞有些猶豫，「這樣，會不會把大家捲進危險裡？」\n\n「不會！」阿釁拍著胸脯，「我們會保護大家的！而且……」他看著未晞，語氣認真，「未晞，你只剩下二十四天了。與其讓大家『慢慢學習』，不如讓大家『親眼看到』——看到我們是怎麼把一條被污染的排水溝，追查到底的！」\n\n未晞沉默了。\n\n她看著阿釁那張充滿鬥志的臉，又看了看晴晴那張堅定的臉。\n\n「……好。」她輕輕地笑了，「那我們就，加速！」\n\n「好——！」阿釁興奮地跳起來，「『追查管線・極速作戰』，啟動！」\n\n「嗶嗶！算我一份！」溜溜從通風管裡鑽出來，「我有最新的偵察數據！」\n\n「當然有你！」阿釁大手一揮，「你是我們的『情報總管』！」\n\n「嗶嗶嗶！遵命！」溜溜興奮地轉了一圈。\n\n「好，那我們來規劃！」阿釁跳下器材箱，攤開溜溜的偵察地圖，「溜溜，你的最新數據！」\n\n「嗶嗶！」溜溜跳到地圖前，「根據我今天的偵察：那條管線，位於排水溝上游三公里，隱藏在雜草裡。排放時間：不固定，但晚上排放量最大。排放物：灰綠色液體，含重金屬，PH值四點七。」\n\n「晚上排放量最大？」晴晴皺起眉頭，「那不就代表……他們在『偷排』？」\n\n「偷排？」阿釁眼睛一亮，「這個詞我喜歡！偷偷摸摸地排，見不得光！」\n\n「那我們要怎麼查？」未晞問。\n\n「我們有溜溜的數據、有園遊會募到的錢、有全校最會『想辦法』的頭腦！」阿釁雙手抱胸，「接下來，我們要做的，就是——」\n\n「找到那條管線，」晴晴接著說，「然後，沿著管線，找到它的『主人』！」\n\n「對！」阿釁一拍大腿，「找到主人，我們就能知道，到底是誰，在毒我們的海！」\n\n「可是，」未晞擔心地說，「如果對方是大人……我們小孩，能怎麼辦？」\n\n「大人？」阿釁嘿嘿一笑，「未晞，你忘了嗎？我們班的『守護地球作戰部隊』，可是連周嚴主任都支持我們！大人有什麼了不起？我們有『證據』！」\n\n「證據……」\n\n「對！」阿釁大聲說，「只要我們拿到證據，交給校長、交給周嚴主任、交給記者——大人們，就不能假裝沒看到了！」\n\n未晞看著阿釁那張信心滿滿的臉，忽然覺得，心裡那股一直繃著的力量，鬆了一點點。\n\n「……好。」她笑了，「那我們就，一起查！」\n\n器材室裡，四個夥伴的身影，在昏黃的燈光下，第一次，完整地重合在一起。\n\n「對了，」晴晴忽然想起什麼，「老巫呢？他最近都在幹嘛？」\n\n「老巫？」阿釁想了想，「他最近啊……在研究午餐的新菜色。」\n\n「新菜色？」\n\n「對啊！」阿釁哈哈大笑，「他說，他要用『醜蔬果』發明一道『拯救地球的肉包』！他完全沒發現我們三個在搞什麼！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑成一團。\n\n「也好，」未晞輕聲說，「就讓他，繼續開開心心地吃肉包吧。」\n\n「那當然！」阿釁拍著胸脯，「老巫的任務，就是吃飽喝足，替我們『守護地球作戰部隊』，保留體力！」\n\n第二天一早，阿釁就開始了他的「演技大作戰」。\n\n「未晞，早啊！」阿釁一進教室，就用一種「我什麼都不知道」的表情，跟未晞打招呼。\n\n「早……」未晞看著他那張過度燦爛的笑臉，忍不住提醒，「阿釁，你這樣……看起來更可疑。」\n\n「有嗎？」阿釁一愣，連忙收起笑容，「那這樣呢？」\n\n「……」未晞看著他那張瞬間板起來的撲克臉，無奈地嘆了一口氣，「算了，你還是笑吧。」\n\n「哈哈哈！我就知道我天生適合演戲！」阿釁得意忘形。\n\n「阿釁！」晴晴走過來，壓低聲音，「你小聲一點！你是想讓全班都知道嗎？！」\n\n「呃！」阿釁連忙捂住嘴巴，「抱歉抱歉！我太興奮了！我昨天晚上，興奮得睡不著！」\n\n「興奮什麼？」老巫咬著肉包，湊過來問。\n\n「呃……」阿釁嚇了一跳，急中生智，「我、我在興奮……今天的午餐！」\n\n「午餐？」老巫眼睛一亮，「你怎麼知道午餐要吃什麼？」\n\n「我……」阿釁冷汗直流，「我猜的！」\n\n「那你猜猜看！」老巫興奮地湊得更近，「今天是雞腿還是排骨？」\n\n「雞、雞腿？」阿釁胡亂猜了一個。\n\n「錯了！」老巫得意洋洋地宣布，「今天是滷雞翅！我早上經過廚房，聞到了！」\n\n「滷雞翅……」阿釁鬆了一口氣，擦了擦冷汗，「對、對！我說的雞腿，是『雞翅的腿』！」\n\n「雞翅哪有腿！」老巫吐槽。\n\n「雞翅的翅膀，就是雞的『手』！那雞的『腿』，就是雞翅附近的肉！」阿釁胡扯，「總之，滷雞翅！讚！」\n\n「……」老巫看了他兩秒，搖搖頭，走了，「你今天怪怪的。」\n\n「怪怪的才好！」阿釁在心裡默念，「這樣才不會被發現！」\n\n然而，阿釁的「演技」，撐不過一個上午。\n\n第二節下課，未晞一個人站在走廊上，看著窗外發呆。\n\n阿釁立刻湊過去，小聲問：「未晞，你又在『閃回』了嗎？」\n\n「沒有。」未晞搖搖頭，「我只是……在看那五根煙囪。」\n\n「煙囪？」阿釁抬頭看去，「哦！台中火力發電廠的煙囪！它們整天都在冒白煙！」\n\n「嗯。」未晞輕輕說，「我在想……如果有一天，那些煙囪不再冒煙了，我們的天，是不是就會變藍？」\n\n「一定會！」阿釁拍著胸脯，「等我們查清楚管線、讓大家學會保護地球……總有一天，煙囪會停下來！」\n\n「嗯。」未晞笑了，「那一天，一定會來的。」\n\n「而且，」阿釁壓低聲音，神秘兮兮地，「我已經開始計畫『極速作戰』了！明天放學，我們就去『現場勘查』！」\n\n「好。」未晞輕輕點頭，「那我們，明天見。」\n\n「明天見！」阿釁說完，忽然又補了一句，「不對，是『今天見、明天見、天天見』！在你要回去之前，我們要天天見！」\n\n未晞愣了一下。\n\n然後，她低下頭，輕輕地笑了。\n\n「……嗯。」她說，「天天見。」\n\n那天深夜，阿釁回到家，躺在床上，翻來覆去，怎麼也睡不著。\n\n他看著天花板，腦海裡，一直迴盪著未晞的話。\n\n「我必須在能量耗盡之前，回到未來，否則時空就會錯亂，大家都會消失。」\n\n「大家都會消失……」阿釁喃喃地重複著，「意思是……如果未晞回不去，我們……全部都會不見？」\n\n「那……」他猛地坐起來，「那我們豈不是，一定要把她『送回去』才行？」\n\n「可是……」他低下頭，看著自己的手，「如果真的把她送回去了……那我們，就再也見不到她了。」\n\n窗外的月光，靜靜地照著他。\n\n阿釁的眼眶，忽然有點酸酸的。\n\n「未晞，」他低聲說，「你放心。在你回去之前，我們會讓這個世界，變得好好的。」\n\n「然後……」他閉上眼睛，「我會好好地，跟你說再見。」\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 14: A-Xin's Discovery & the Expanding Alliance\n\nA-Xin had a secret.\n\nA secret that even Qingqing didn't know.\n\nThat secret was—hidden inside A-Xin's backpack was a small notebook.\n\nOn the cover of the notebook was drawn a crooked Earth.\n\nOn the first page of the notebook was written:\n\n\"Weixi Observation Record (No. 1)\"\n\n\"October: Transfer student arrived. Predicted the afternoon rain accurately on her first day. Suspicion index: ★★\"\n\n\"She said she came from 'a very, very faraway place, a place she could never go back to.' Suspicion index: ★★★★\"\n\n\"The bracelet on her wrist—Liu-Liu said it 'doesn't belong to this world.' Suspicion index: ★★★★★★\"\n\n\"November: Watching a flood on the news, she murmured 'just like before.' 'Before'? Which before? Suspicion index: ★★★★★★★★\"\n\n\"In front of the withered tree in the park, she said 'in our place, there are also many trees, just like you.' Where is 'our place'? Suspicion index: ★★★★★★★★★★\"\n\n\"December: At the beach cleanup, she suddenly burst into tears, saying 'the whole beach is covered in trash, taller than people.' But there was clearly no trash mountain in front of us. Suspicion index: ★★★★★★★★★★★★\"\n\n\"On fair day, she wrote a letter addressed to 'myself forty years from now.' Suspicion index: ★★★★★★★★★★★★★★\"\n\n\"January: She zones out more and more often. The numbers on her bracelet keep dropping. Suspicion index: ★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★\"\n\n\"Conclusion: Weixi is...\"\n\nThe notebook contained even more densely packed records:\n\n\"October 15th: She called it again. Said it would rain at three in the afternoon, and it really rained. She said she can 'hear the voice of the wind.' When I listen to the wind, all I hear is leaves rustling.\"\n\n\"October 20th: She said 'hello' to the phoenix tree outside the window. Saying hello to a tree? Well, maybe she's just polite.\"\n\n\"November 2nd: In natural science class, the teacher talked about 'global warming.' She didn't say a word the whole period. After class, she stood alone in the hallway, staring at the sky for a very, very long time.\"\n\n\"November 18th: She said the cabbage at lunch was 'shipped from the farm at the foot of the mountain three days ago.' I asked how she knew, and she said 'they told me.' Can vegetables talk?\"\n\n\"December 8th: She stared at the drainage ditch behind the school for a full five minutes. That ditch stinks; I don't even want to stay near it for a second.\"\n\n\"December 25th: Christmas. She gave everyone in the class a hand-drawn little card. Mine said 'To A-Xin: You're the best King of Ideas.' How did she know I like being the King of Ideas?\"\n\n\"January 5th: She zoned out again. This time during lunch, eyes staring straight ahead. I called her name three times before she snapped back and said 'sorry' to me.\"\n\n\"January 10th: Fair day. She wrote a letter and dropped it into the 'To the Future' mailbox. I secretly peeked at her letter—it was addressed to 'myself forty years from now.'\"\n\n\"January 12th: After school, she sat alone on the seawall. In the sunset, she looked... so lonely.\"\n\n\"January 14th: Today, she said something that made me decide I have to find out her secret.\"\n\n\"She said: 'A-Xin, if one day I'm gone, please keep protecting the Earth.'\"\n\n\"When she said those words, there was a look in her eyes... like someone who already knew she was going to leave.\"\n\nA-Xin held his pen, hesitating for a very, very long time, before writing two words below that line:\n\n\"...from the future.\"\n\n\"If she's from the future,\" A-Xin looked out the window and murmured to himself, \"then why did she come here?\"\n\n\"And,\" he lowered his head, looking at the last record in his notebook, \"why do the numbers on her bracelet keep dropping?\"\n\nThat afternoon, A-Xin made a decision.\n\nHe was going to find out what Weixi did after school.\n\nThe school dismissal bell rang, and the children filed out of the school gate in twos and threes.\n\nWeixi didn't go home.\n\nShe walked alone, slowly, along the seawall behind the school.\n\nA-Xin hid behind the bushes, following her carefully.\n\nWeixi walked to the end of the seawall and sat down, looking at that murky gray sea in the distance.\n\nThen, she did something that made A-Xin's heart clench.\n\nShe lowered her head, looked at the bracelet on her wrist, and said softly:\n\n\"Twenty-four now.\"\n\n\"Twenty-four?\" A-Xin hid in the bushes, holding his breath, \"What's twenty-four?!\"\n\n\"Last week it was still thirty...\" Weixi murmured softly, \"at this rate...\"\n\n\"At this rate, what will happen?\" A-Xin's heart beat faster and faster.\n\nJust then—\n\n\"Huh?\" Weixi suddenly looked up, her eyes losing focus, her voice changing tone, \"This... where is this...?\"\n\nHer pupils instantly became vacant, her whole body stiffening in place as if her soul had been drained away.\n\n\"Weixi!\" A-Xin could no longer hide; he rushed out of the bushes and ran to her, \"Weixi! What's wrong?!\"\n\nWeixi didn't respond.\n\nHer eyes stared straight ahead, her mouth murmuring: \"Gray-gray sky... so much water... flooding over...\"\n\n\"Weixi!!\" A-Xin grabbed her shoulders and shook her hard, \"Wake up!! Look clearly! This is the seawall at Luyang Elementary! No water is flooding over!\"\n\n\"A-Xin...\" Weixi's eyes slowly refocused, \"how... are you here?\"\n\n\"I...\" A-Xin panted, \"I was worried about you, so...\"\n\nBefore he could finish, his gaze was caught by the rapidly jumping numbers on Weixi's wrist.\n\n\"Twenty-seven... twenty-six... twenty-five...\" A-Xin's eyes went wide, \"this number is still dropping!\"\n\nWeixi's face turned white in an instant.\n\nShe yanked her sleeve down, covering the bracelet.\n\n\"A-Xin!\" Her voice carried unprecedented panic, \"you... you saw it?\"\n\n\"I saw it.\" A-Xin looked straight at her, his tone carrying a seriousness even he hadn't noticed, \"Weixi, tell me, what exactly is that number?\"\n\nWeixi was silent for a very, very long time.\n\nSo long that A-Xin thought she would never answer.\n\nThen, Weixi spoke.\n\n\"A-Xin,\" her voice was light as a feather, \"if I told you... that I came from the future. Would you believe me?\"\n\nA-Xin's heart felt like it was being gripped by a hand.\n\n\"...I believe you.\" he said.\n\nWeixi froze.\n\n\"You believe me?\" she asked in disbelief, \"why... why would you believe me?\"\n\n\"Because...\" A-Xin pulled out that notebook with the Earth drawn on it, \"I've been recording your 'suspicious behavior' since October.\"\n\n\"You predicted the rain, you could name where the vegetables came from, you talked to withered trees, you watched the news and said 'just like before,' you saw a trash mountain at the beach that no one else could see, you mailed a letter to yourself forty years from now... and this bracelet.\"\n\nA-Xin pointed at Weixi's wrist: \"Liu-Liu said its frequency band 'doesn't belong to this world.' And you just said its number dropped from thirty to twenty-four.\"\n\n\"A-Xin...\" Weixi's voice trembled slightly, \"how long have you... been watching me?\"\n\n\"Since your first day at school.\" A-Xin said.\n\nWeixi lowered her head.\n\nThe wind blew across the seawall.\n\nAfter a long time, she finally spoke softly:\n\n\"Then... do you want to know the truth?\"\n\n\"Yes.\" A-Xin nodded without hesitation, \"But if you don't want to tell me, I won't force you. I just...\"\n\n\"Just what?\"\n\n\"Just want you to know,\" A-Xin looked at her, his eyes serious in a way unlike his usual self, \"no matter where you came from, no matter how many secrets you carry—you're a member of our 'Protect Earth Operations Unit.' Your matters are my matters.\"\n\nWeixi's eyes suddenly turned red.\n\n\"A-Xin...\" she sniffled and finally made up her mind, \"Alright. I'll tell you.\"\n\nSo, that evening, on the seawall, A-Xin listened to Weixi's story.\n\nShe said that forty years from now, the Earth's sea level would be nearly a meter higher than now. The Taichung Harbor would be underwater, and the seawall of Longjing would become a broken, crumbling wall of ruins.\n\nShe said that when she was little, she had never known any weather other than \"rain that never ends.\" Summers often exceeded forty degrees, and the asphalt softened like pudding.\n\nShe said that her school had a class called \"Climate Class.\" In the textbook were written the news of this era—the 2026 glacier collapse, the Super El Niño, the record-breaking floods. The teacher said: \"These are all history.\"\n\nShe said she had always thought these \"history\" events were from a very, very long time ago. Until one day, her grandmother pointed at a yellowed photograph and said to her: \"Weixi ah, the sea of Grandma's childhood didn't look like this.\"\n\n\"Then Grandma,\" she asked, \"what did the sea originally look like?\"\n\nHer grandmother was silent for a long time, then said: \"Grandma almost forgot too. But I remember, it used to be blue.\"\n\n\"A blue sea...\" Weixi said to A-Xin, \"that was when I learned that the sea could be blue.\"\n\nShe said that from that day on, she kept thinking—if only she could go back in time and tell those people, \"Every thing you do now will become our future,\" how wonderful that would be.\n\n\"Then,\" Weixi said in a low voice, \"I really was sent back.\"\n\n\"Sent back?\" A-Xin asked, \"Who sent you back?\"\n\n\"It was... scientists of the future.\" Weixi said, \"They said they tested all the time machines, and only one succeeded. They said I was 'the most suitable candidate.'\"\n\n\"Why you?\"\n\n\"Because...\" Weixi lowered her head, \"because I remember this era. Of all the candidates, I was the only one who still remembered what a 'blue sea' looked like.\"\n\nHe listened to her tell how the Earth of forty years from now had gradually turned grayish-yellow.\n\nHe listened to her tell how she had been chosen, and how she had returned to this era carrying the bracelet.\n\nHe listened to her tell how she had to return to the future before the energy ran out, or else the timeline would collapse and everyone would disappear.\n\nHe listened to her tell how little time she had left.\n\n\"So,\" A-Xin listened, and after a long silence, finally asked, \"the number on your bracelet is the 'days' you have left?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"From fifty-seven at the very beginning, to twenty-four now.\"\n\n\"Twenty-four days...\" A-Xin murmured in repetition, \"only twenty-four days left...\"\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Weixi looked at him, a plea in her eyes, \"this matter—only Qingqing knows. Now, there's you too.\"\n\n\"I hope... you won't tell the others. I don't want everyone to...\"\n\n\"Worry about you.\" A-Xin finished for her, \"I understand.\"\n\nHe lowered his head and looked at his own notebook.\n\n\"Weixi,\" he suddenly spoke, \"do you know? Actually, I guessed it a long time ago.\"\n\n\"Guessed what?\"\n\n\"Guessed that you don't belong here.\" A-Xin said, \"But I never knew how to face it. Because...\"\n\n\"Because what?\"\n\n\"Because...\" A-Xin looked up, his eyes slightly reddened, \"if you really go back... then we'll never see you again.\"\n\nWeixi froze.\n\nLooking at A-Xin's face, so rare in its seriousness, tears suddenly fell without warning.\n\n\"A-Xin...\" she choked, \"you...\"\n\n\"Don't cry!\" A-Xin panicked, flailing his hands, \"I-I was just kidding! I-I'm the worst at saying things like that! Don't cry!\"\n\n\"Who's crying!\" Weixi broke into a smile through her tears, wiping her eyes, \"I just... got sand in my eyes.\"\n\n\"Fine, fine! Sand! It's all the sand's fault!\" A-Xin quickly agreed, \"Blame this sea!\"\n\nOn the seawall, two children, one crying and one laughing, made a racket together.\n\nAnd at the other end of the seawall, Qingqing stood quietly behind a tree, watching this scene, the corners of her mouth lifting slightly.\n\n\"Just as I thought,\" she said in a low voice, \"you can't hide anything from A-Xin.\"\n\nThat night, in the sports equipment room.\n\nThe Secret Alliance's \"command center\" welcomed its third member for the first time.\n\n\"So,\" A-Xin crossed his arms, sitting on the equipment box, his expression serious, \"the current situation is: Weixi has twenty-four days left, and the pollution in the drainage ditch is still worsening.\"\n\n\"Right.\" Qingqing nodded, \"And that pipe's discharge speed is getting faster every day.\"\n\n\"Then what do we do?\" A-Xin asked.\n\n\"Our original plan was,\" Weixi said, \"before the countdown ends, do our best to make everyone learn to protect the Earth. Then...\"\n\n\"Then, you go back.\" A-Xin finished for her, \"right?\"\n\nWeixi lowered her head and softly said, \"Mhm.\"\n\n\"But,\" A-Xin suddenly stood up, a fighting spirit in his voice, \"I have a better idea!\"\n\n\"What idea?\" Qingqing and Weixi asked in unison.\n\n\"Since we only have twenty-four days,\" A-Xin's eyes sparkled, \"then let's not dawdle with 'taking it slow'! We're going to—'double up'! 'Speed up'! Use the remaining time twice as hard as others!\"\n\n\"Double up?\" Weixi froze.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin nodded hard, \"We can use the 'Campaign' as our cover and mobilize the whole class! And the three of us will secretly speed things up behind the scenes!\"\n\n\"You mean...\" Qingqing's eyes lit up too.\n\n\"Bring the 'Track the Pipe' operation forward!\" A-Xin said, \"We have Liu-Liu's reconnaissance data, don't we? And the money raised at the fair? Then let's just—investigate to the end! Find out who's behind that pipe!\"\n\n\"But...\" Weixi hesitated, \"won't that drag everyone into danger?\"\n\n\"No!\" A-Xin patted his chest, \"We'll protect everyone! And...\" he looked at Weixi seriously, \"Weixi, you only have twenty-four days left. Instead of having everyone 'learn slowly,' let everyone 'see with their own eyes'—see how we track a polluted drainage ditch to the end!\"\n\nWeixi fell silent.\n\nShe looked at A-Xin's determined face, then at Qingqing's resolute face.\n\n\"...Alright.\" She smiled softly, \"Then let's speed up!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\" A-Xin jumped up excitedly, \"'Track the Pipe · Extreme Speed Operation' begins!\"\n\n\"Beep beep! Count me in!\" Liu-Liu popped out of the ventilation duct, \"I have the latest reconnaissance data!\"\n\n\"Of course you're in!\" A-Xin waved his hand grandly, \"You're our 'Intel Chief'!\"\n\n\"Beep beep beep! At your command!\" Liu-Liu spun around excitedly.\n\n\"Alright, let's plan!\" A-Xin jumped off the equipment box and spread out Liu-Liu's reconnaissance map, \"Liu-Liu, your latest data!\"\n\n\"Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu jumped to the map, \"Based on today's reconnaissance: that pipe is located three kilometers upstream of the drainage ditch, hidden in the weeds. Discharge schedule: irregular, but the volume is highest at night. Discharge substance: grayish-green liquid, containing heavy metals, pH 4.7.\"\n\n\"Highest at night?\" Qingqing frowned, \"Doesn't that mean... they're 'sneakily discharging'?\"\n\n\"Sneakily discharging?\" A-Xin's eyes lit up, \"I like that term! Discharging in secret, afraid of the light!\"\n\n\"Then how do we investigate?\" Weixi asked.\n\n\"We have Liu-Liu's data, the money from the fair, and the smartest 'thinking' brains in the whole school!\" A-Xin crossed his arms, \"Next, what we need to do is—\"\n\n\"Find that pipe,\" Qingqing continued, \"and then, follow the pipe to its 'owner'!\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin slapped his thigh, \"Find the owner, and we'll know exactly who's poisoning our sea!\"\n\n\"But,\" Weixi said worriedly, \"if the other side is adults... what can we kids do?\"\n\n\"Adults?\" A-Xin chuckled, \"Weixi, have you forgotten? Our class's 'Protect Earth Operations Unit' even has Dean Zhou supporting us! What's so great about adults? We have 'evidence'!\"\n\n\"Evidence...\"\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"As long as we get the evidence and hand it to the principal, to Dean Zhou, to the reporters—the adults can't pretend not to see anymore!\"\n\nLooking at A-Xin's confident face, Weixi felt the tension that had been holding her heart loosen just a little.\n\n\"...Alright.\" She smiled, \"Then let's investigate together!\"\n\nIn the equipment room, the silhouettes of four partners overlapped completely for the first time under the dim light.\n\n\"Oh right,\" Qingqing suddenly remembered something, \"what about Old Wu? What's he been up to lately?\"\n\n\"Old Wu?\" A-Xin thought for a moment, \"Lately, he's been... researching new lunch recipes.\"\n\n\"New recipes?\"\n\n\"Yeah!\" A-Xin laughed heartily, \"He says he's going to invent a 'pork bun that saves the Earth' using 'ugly produce'! He has no idea what the three of us are up to!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed together.\n\n\"It's fine,\" Weixi said softly, \"let him keep happily eating his pork buns.\"\n\n\"Of course!\" A-Xin patted his chest, \"Old Wu's mission is to eat and drink well, and save his strength for our 'Protect Earth Operations Unit'!\"\n\nThe next morning, A-Xin began his \"acting campaign.\"\n\n\"Weixi, good morning!\" A-Xin greeted her with a face that said \"I know nothing\" as he entered the classroom.\n\n\"Morning...\" Weixi looked at his overly bright smile and couldn't help reminding him, \"A-Xin, you look... even more suspicious like this.\"\n\n\"Do I?\" A-Xin blinked and quickly put away his smile, \"How about this?\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi looked at his instantly stern poker face and sighed helplessly, \"Forget it. Just smile.\"\n\n\"Haha! I knew I was born to act!\" A-Xin was beside himself.\n\n\"A-Xin!\" Qingqing walked over and lowered her voice, \"Keep it down! Do you want the whole class to know?!\"\n\n\"Uh!\" A-Xin quickly covered his mouth, \"Sorry, sorry! I'm just too excited! I was so excited last night I couldn't sleep!\"\n\n\"Excited about what?\" Old Wu, chewing a pork bun, leaned in to ask.\n\n\"Uh...\" A-Xin was startled and thought fast, \"I-I'm excited about... today's lunch!\"\n\n\"Lunch?\" Old Wu's eyes lit up, \"How do you know what's for lunch?\"\n\n\"I...\" A-Xin broke into a cold sweat, \"I guessed!\"\n\n\"Then guess!\" Old Wu leaned in excitedly, \"Is it chicken legs or pork ribs today?\"\n\n\"Ch-chicken legs?\" A-Xin guessed at random.\n\n\"Wrong!\" Old Wu announced triumphantly, \"Today is braised chicken wings! I passed by the kitchen this morning and smelled them!\"\n\n\"Braised chicken wings...\" A-Xin breathed a sigh of relief and wiped his cold sweat, \"Ri-right! The chicken legs I meant are 'the legs of the wings'!\"\n\n\"Chicken wings don't have legs!\" Old Wu teased.\n\n\"A wing is a chicken's 'hand'! So the chicken's 'leg' is the meat near the wing!\" A-Xin rambled, \"Anyway, braised chicken wings! Awesome!\"\n\n\"...\" Old Wu stared at him for two seconds, shook his head, and walked away, \"You're acting weird today.\"\n\n\"Weird is good!\" A-Xin said to himself, \"That way I won't be discovered!\"\n\nHowever, A-Xin's \"acting\" didn't last through the morning.\n\nDuring the second-period break, Weixi stood alone in the hallway, staring out the window in a daze.\n\nA-Xin immediately sidled over and asked quietly: \"Weixi, are you having a 'flashback' again?\"\n\n\"No.\" Weixi shook her head, \"I'm just... looking at those five smokestacks.\"\n\n\"Smokestacks?\" A-Xin looked up, \"Oh! The Taichung Thermal Power Plant's smokestacks! They puff white smoke all day!\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi said softly, \"I'm thinking... if one day those smokestacks stop smoking, will our sky turn blue?\"\n\n\"They definitely will!\" A-Xin patted his chest, \"Once we find out the truth about the pipe and teach everyone to protect the Earth... one day, the smokestacks will stop!\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi smiled, \"That day will definitely come.\"\n\n\"And,\" A-Xin lowered his voice mysteriously, \"I've already started planning the 'Extreme Speed Operation'! Tomorrow after school, we go for 'on-site reconnaissance'!\"\n\n\"Alright.\" Weixi nodded softly, \"Then we'll see each other tomorrow.\"\n\n\"See you tomorrow!\" A-Xin finished, then added, \"No wait, it's 'see you today, see you tomorrow, see you every day'! Until you have to go back, we'll see each other every day!\"\n\nWeixi froze for a moment.\n\nThen she lowered her head and smiled softly.\n\n\"...Mhm.\" she said, \"See you every day.\"\n\nLate that night, A-Xin went home and lay in bed, tossing and turning, unable to fall asleep.\n\nHe stared at the ceiling, Weixi's words echoing in his mind.\n\n\"I must return to the future before the energy runs out, or else the timeline will collapse and everyone will disappear.\"\n\n\"Everyone will disappear...\" A-Xin murmured in repetition, \"which means... if Weixi can't go back, then we... will all vanish?\"\n\n\"Then...\" he suddenly sat up, \"then we definitely have to 'send her back'!\"\n\n\"But...\" he lowered his head and looked at his own hands, \"if we really send her back... then we'll never see her again.\"\n\nThe moonlight outside the window shone quietly on him.\n\nA-Xin's eyes suddenly felt a little sour.\n\n\"Weixi,\" he said in a low voice, \"don't worry. Before you go back, we'll make this world right.\"\n\n\"Then...\" he closed his eyes, \"I'll say goodbye to you properly.\"\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":7,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第十五章：水源異味蔓延\n\n「極速作戰」展開的第一個星期，未晞的手環，從二十四，掉到了二十二。\n\n「兩天，掉了兩格。」晴晴在筆記本上記下數字，眉頭緊鎖，「速度……又變快了。」\n\n「沒關係。」未晞輕聲說，「還夠用。」\n\n「夠用什麼！」阿釁忍不住低聲說，「二十二天，哪裡夠！」\n\n「夠你們，把排水溝查清楚。」未晞微微笑了，「我們說好的，不是嗎？」\n\n阿釁張了張嘴，最後還是閉上了。\n\n他覺得，未晞的笑容裡，好像藏著一種……他不敢深想的東西。\n\n而就在三人同盟忙著「極速作戰」的同時，學校裡的異常，也開始「全面爆發」。\n\n先是飲水機。\n\n「唉，你們有沒有覺得，」午餐時間，老巫皺著鼻子，盯著自己的水壺，「飲水機的水，味道越來越怪了？」\n\n「對耶！」尪伝恺跟著點頭，「我昨天喝了一口，覺得有點……說不上來的味道。鹹鹹的，又不像。鹹鹹的，又不像鹹。」\n\n「鹹鹹的？」林芸芸擔心地問，「那……那還能喝嗎？」\n\n「應該可以吧？」阿釁說，「學校不是說，水質檢查合格嗎？」\n\n「可是……」老巫搖搖頭，小聲說，「我爸說，他上班的地方，隔壁工廠偷排廢水被抓到，整個社區的水都變味了。他說，『水變味，就是有東西進來了。』」\n\n「偷排廢水……」孩子們面面相覷。\n\n「不會吧？」尪伝恺乾笑兩聲，「我們學校後面那條排水溝，不就是臭了一點嗎？跟學校的水，哪有關係？」\n\n「可是……」林芸芸低著頭，聲音越來越小，「我昨天肚子痛，保健室老師說，這兩個星期，已經有二十幾個同學肚子不舒服了……」\n\n教室裡，忽然安靜了下來。\n\n一種說不上來的、沉甸甸的氣氛，蔓延開來。\n\n「我……我也不舒服。」角落裡，一個男生小聲說，「我昨天晚上，肚子痛了一整晚。」\n\n「我也是……」另一個女生跟著說，「我媽媽說，如果再不舒服，就要帶我去看醫生。」\n\n「你們怎麼都不早說！」阿釁瞪大眼睛。\n\n「我們……」林芸芸低下頭，「我們怕說出來，會讓大家更擔心……」\n\n「你們這些笨蛋！」阿釁忍不住大聲說，「身體不舒服，就是要說出來啊！你們不說，我們怎麼知道要怎麼辦？！」\n\n教室裡，再次安靜下來。\n\n「對不起……」林芸芸的眼眶，紅了，「我……我不想讓大家害怕……」\n\n「芸芸！」晴晴走過去，握住她的手，「你說得對，我們不該瞞著。可是……」她掃視全班，大聲說，「我們也不該害怕！我們是『守護地球作戰部隊』！越是這種時候，我們越要團結！」\n\n「對！」阿釁跳上講台，「大家聽好了！從今天開始，我們『守護地球作戰部隊』，多了一項任務——『水質監測』！」\n\n「水質監測？」孩子們面面相覷。\n\n「對！」阿釁大聲說，「我們要每天記錄飲水機的水、排水溝的水、還有入海口的海水！記錄它們的顏色、味道、還有變化！我們要用『數據』，保護我們自己！」\n\n「用數據保護自己……」尪伝恺喃喃地重複著。\n\n「對！」晴晴接著說，「大人們說水質合格，那我們就用我們的眼睛、我們的鼻子、我們的記錄，讓大人們看看，真實的水，是什麼樣子！」\n\n「好——！」孩子們的士氣，一下子被點燃了。\n\n「那，誰負責記錄？」老巫問。\n\n「你！」阿釁指著老巫，「你鼻子最靈！你負責『聞』！每天記錄水溝的味道！」\n\n「好！」老巫拍著胸脯，「我聞味道，可是全校第一！」\n\n「那我負責記錄顏色！」林芸芸說。\n\n「我負責拍照！」尪伝恺舉手。\n\n「我負責……負責相信大家！」阿釁大聲說。\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑了，笑得比剛才，安心多了。\n\n「大家別自己嚇自己！」晴晴站起來，大聲說，「學校已經在處理了！我們……」\n\n「晴晴說得對，」未晞也開口了，聲音輕輕的，卻異常安穩，「大家先不要緊張。學校的水，如果真的出問題，大人們一定會發現的。」\n\n「可是……」老巫欲言又止。\n\n「相信我，」未晞看著他，語氣溫柔，「我們一起，把這件事查清楚。」\n\n老巫看著未晞那雙清澈的眼睛，心裡那股不安，好像……稍微安定了下來。\n\n「好！」他點頭，「那我們等未晞的！」\n\n「嗯！」孩子們齊聲應和。\n\n可是，只有晴晴和阿釁知道，未晞那句「把這件事查清楚」，背後背著多重的擔子。\n\n第二天，學校裡，出現了一個「不速之客」。\n\n「咦？那不是周嚴主任嗎？」阿釁趴在走廊欄杆上，看著操場邊，周嚴主任正蹲在排水溝旁，盯著溝裡的水看，「主任在看什麼？」\n\n「他在看排水溝。」未晞走過來，輕聲說。\n\n「排水溝？」阿釁眨眨眼，「主任不是最討厭臭水溝嗎？他以前巡堂，看到我們靠近水溝，都會罵人耶！」\n\n「因為，」未晞的目光，落在周嚴主任身上，「他現在，不是在『巡堂』。他是在『調查』。」\n\n「調查？」阿釁愣住。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「大人發現事情不對勁的時候，就會開始調查。主任他……發現了。」\n\n阿釁看著周嚴主任蹲在水溝邊的身影，心裡，忽然湧起一種說不上來的感覺。\n\n「那……」他低聲問，「主任會查到什麼？」\n\n「不知道。」未晞搖搖頭，「但至少，他不是什麼都沒看到。」\n\n其實，周嚴主任的調查，早在一個星期前就開始了。\n\n他沿著排水溝，從學校後方，一步一步地往上游走。\n\n「第一步：學校後方。水色：灰綠。異味：強烈。」主任在筆記本上，寫下第一筆紀錄。\n\n「第二步：產業道路邊。水色：加深。異味：更強。水面出現白色泡沫。」\n\n「第三步：廢棄農舍旁。水色：幾乎變成黑綠色。異味：刺鼻。水面上，漂浮著……」主任蹲下來，皺起眉頭，「死魚。」\n\n「第四步：工業區外圍。這裡……」主任停下腳步，看向前方那片灰濛濛的工廠區，「有一股很重的化學味。還有……」他低頭，看向水溝，「水溝裡，多了一條不該存在的管線。」\n\n他蹲下來，仔細觀察那條管線。\n\n管線的口徑，比一般的排水管粗；管線的外壁，沾著一層灰白色的結晶——那是化學物質乾涸後留下的痕跡。\n\n「這條管線……」主任低聲說，「沒有登記在工業區的管線圖上。」\n\n他掏出手機，拍了幾張照片，又記錄下管線的位置。\n\n「不管你是誰，」主任看著那條管線，語氣裡帶著一種執拗，「我一定會，把你揪出來。」\n\n下午，校長室。\n\n「老周，」邱校長端著茶杯，神色凝重，「飲水機的水質，自來水公司已經來驗了三次，都說合格。」\n\n「合格？」周嚴主任站在窗前，看著窗外的排水溝，「校長，你不覺得奇怪嗎？」\n\n「什麼奇怪？」\n\n「飲水機的水，」周嚴主任轉過身，「用的是自來水。自來水合格，可是，為什麼學生喝了水，肚子不舒服的，一天比一天多？」\n\n「那是……」邱校長頓住。\n\n「我懷疑，」周嚴主任的聲音，壓得很低，「問題，不在飲水機。」\n\n「那在哪裡？」\n\n周嚴主任沉默了片刻，走到校長面前，攤開一張地圖。\n\n「校長，這是學校後面那條排水溝的地圖。」他指著地圖上的一條線，「這條溝，從學校後方，一路往上游，通到……」\n\n他的手指，停在了地圖上的一個位置。\n\n「工業區。」邱校長的表情，一下子凝重起來。\n\n「我沿著水溝走了一趟，」周嚴主任說，「走到工業區邊緣，我看到了一條管線。一條，沒有登記在任何圖面上的管線。」\n\n「管線？」\n\n「嗯。」周嚴主任點頭，「它藏在雜草裡，從工業區延伸出來，直接插進排水溝。溝裡的水……」他頓了一下，「顏色不對。味道也不對。」\n\n「你是說……」邱校長的手，微微顫抖。\n\n「校長，」周嚴主任深吸一口氣，「我建議，我們應該通知環保局，徹查這條管線。」\n\n邱校長沉默了。\n\n「老周，」過了很久，他才開口，「你知道，這件事一旦查下去，會是什麼後果嗎？」\n\n「我知道。」周嚴主任說，「如果查出來，是工業區哪一家工廠偷排……那家工廠，可能會被停工、被罰錢。牽涉的人，可能會很麻煩。」\n\n「那你還……」\n\n「校長，」周嚴主任打斷他，語氣前所未有地堅定，「我當了二十年學務主任，從來沒有因為『怕麻煩』，放過任何一件該查的事。」\n\n「而且……」他的眼神，閃過一抹柔和，「那群孩子，為了一條臭水溝，拼了整整一個學期。我這個大人，總不能輸給他們吧。」\n\n邱校長看著他，看了很久很久，最後，重重地嘆了一口氣。\n\n「……好。」他點頭，「就照你說的辦。」\n\n然而，周嚴主任的行動，卻觸動了某些人的神經。\n\n那天傍晚，工業區某間工廠的辦公室裡，電話鈴聲，急促地響起。\n\n「喂？是我。」一個低沉的聲音接起電話，「學校那邊……開始查了。」\n\n「嗯。就是那條排水溝。」\n\n「我知道。所以……」那個聲音頓了頓，「把那條管線的排放量，再加大。然後，把管子，往更深的地方埋。」\n\n「對。趁他們還沒查清楚，把證據……」\n\n「處理乾淨。」\n\n電話掛斷。\n\n夜色，悄悄地，籠罩了工業區。\n\n第二天一早，溜溜帶回來一個晴天霹靂般的消息。\n\n「班長大人！不好了！」溜溜從通風管裡衝出來，聲音都在發抖，「那條管線……昨晚的排放量，比平常多了整整一倍！」\n\n「一倍？！」晴晴和阿釁同時瞪大眼睛。\n\n「而且！」溜溜喘著氣，「我沿著管線，飛到工業區裡面，發現……」\n\n「發現什麼？」\n\n「發現……」溜溜的電子眼裡，閃過一抹驚恐，「那條管線，在工業區裡的源頭，被用土埋起來了！而且，他們還在挖更深的溝，要把管子埋得更深！」\n\n「他們在毀滅證據！」阿釁一下子跳起來，「他們知道有人在查了！」\n\n「冷靜！」晴晴壓住他，「我們先別慌！」\n\n「不慌？」阿釁急得直跳腳，「他們在埋管子耶！等他們埋好了，我們就找不到證據了！」\n\n「阿釁說得對，」未晞開口了，聲音輕輕的，卻讓整個器材室安靜下來，「他們在搶時間。我們，也必須搶時間。」\n\n「搶時間……」晴晴喃喃地重複著。\n\n「我們不能等主任一個人了。」未晞說，「我們必須，在他們把證據埋乾淨之前，拿到證據！」\n\n「可是，」阿釁苦著臉，「我們怎麼拿？我們又不能闖進工業區！」\n\n「我們不能闖，」未晞的目光，閃爍著前所未有的堅定，「可是，我們有溜溜。」\n\n「溜溜？」阿釁和晴晴同時看向溜溜。\n\n「溜溜，」未晞蹲下來，輕輕地摸了摸溜溜的頭，「你能做到嗎？」\n\n溜溜挺起胸膛，電子眼裡，燃起一團火焰：\n\n「嗶嗶！我能！」溜溜大聲說，「我是全校情報王！偷拍、錄影、取水樣……我全都會！」\n\n「好！」未晞輕輕笑了，「那我們，就賭一把！」\n\n那天深夜，工業區的圍牆外。\n\n四個小小的身影，躲在草叢裡，屏息凝神。\n\n「阿釁，你確定我們要這樣做嗎？」晴晴壓低聲音，語氣裡帶著緊張，「這裡是工業區耶！要是被發現……」\n\n「不會被發現的！」阿釁拍著胸脯，「我們躲在這裡，誰都看不到！」\n\n「可是……」晴晴看著眼前那堵高高的圍牆，「如果溜溜在裡面出了什麼事……」\n\n「不會的。」未晞輕聲說，「溜溜是全校最快的。而且……」她微微笑了，「溜溜可是我們『守護地球作戰部隊』的『情報總管』，牠一定可以的。」\n\n「你們怎麼都這麼有信心……」晴晴哭笑不得。\n\n「因為，」阿釁看著圍牆，語氣認真起來，「我們相信牠。就像牠相信我們一樣。」\n\n風，吹過草叢。\n\n三個孩子，靜靜地，等待著。\n\n「對了，未晞，」等待的時候，阿釁忽然開口，「你剛剛說，溜溜『還有任務沒完成』。那是什麼任務？」\n\n未晞愣了一下。\n\n「我是說……」她低下頭，輕輕說，「牠還沒看到，我們把排水溝查清楚的那一天。」\n\n「……」阿釁沉默了一下，然後，用力點頭，「對！牠一定要看到！我們一定要讓牠看到！」\n\n「嗯。」未晞笑了，「一定會的。」\n\n「還有，」阿釁忽然想到什麼，壓低聲音，「未晞，你老實告訴我——你的手環，現在剩多少？」\n\n未晞沉默了。\n\n「……二十一。」她最後說。\n\n「二十一……」阿釁的心，猛地一沉，但他努力擠出一個笑容，「沒關係！二十一，夠我們做很多事情！」\n\n「嗯。」未晞輕輕點頭，「夠的。」\n\n「溜溜，」阿釁壓低聲音，交代著，「記住：先拍管線的照片，再取水樣，然後——立刻回來！不准逞強！」\n\n「嗶嗶！收到！」溜溜深吸一口氣，「我出發了！」\n\n「等一下！」未晞叫住牠。\n\n「嗯？」\n\n「溜溜，」未晞輕輕說，「如果……如果被發現了，就放棄任務，先保護自己。證據可以再找，你，只有一個。」\n\n溜溜的電子眼，閃了閃。\n\n「嗶嗶。」牠低聲說，「我知道了。」\n\n然後，溜溜小小的身影，像一道銀白色的閃電，無聲無息地，竄進了工業區。\n\n草叢裡，三個孩子，屏住呼吸，等待著。\n\n一秒鐘……一分鐘……五分鐘……\n\n「怎麼還沒回來……」阿釁緊張地喃喃自語。\n\n「別急。」晴晴壓低聲音，「溜溜是全校最快的。」\n\n「可是……」阿釁的心，怦怦直跳，「要是牠被發現了……」\n\n「不會的。」未晞的聲音，意外地平靜，「溜溜會回來的。因為……」她微微笑了，「牠還有任務沒完成。」\n\n就在這時——\n\n「嗖！」\n\n一道銀白色的身影，從圍牆的另一頭，飛快地竄了回來！\n\n「嗶嗶嗶！任務完成！」溜溜氣喘吁吁地停在三個人面前，嘴裡叼著一個小瓶子，「照片！水樣！都拿到了！」\n\n「太棒了！」阿釁興奮地跳起來，「溜溜！你太厲害了！」\n\n「走！我們回去檢測水樣！」晴晴小心翼翼地捧著那個小瓶子，「園遊會募到的錢買的檢測工具，終於派上用場了！」\n\n回到器材室，晴晴打開檢測工具箱，攤開試紙和檢測劑。\n\n「先測PH值！」晴晴把試紙放進水樣裡，「……四點五。」\n\n「四點五？！」阿釁瞪大眼睛，「比酸梅湯還酸！」\n\n「再測重金屬！」晴晴滴入檢測劑，看著顏色變化，「……顏色變深了。按照色卡比對……」\n\n「多少？」阿釁緊張地問。\n\n「……」晴晴看著色卡，臉色越來越白，「超標。超過標準值……六倍。」\n\n「六倍？！」阿釁倒抽一口涼氣，「這種水，如果真的流進海裡……」\n\n「魚會死。」未晞輕聲接話，「人喝了……會生病。」\n\n器材室裡，一片寂靜。\n\n「我們有證據了。」過了很久，晴晴才開口，聲音乾啞，「照片、水樣、檢測數據……我們有證據了。」\n\n「可是，」阿釁看著那瓶灰綠色的水樣，語氣裡帶著不甘，「光有證據，還不夠。我們要讓大人們，相信我們！」\n\n「對。」未晞點頭，「所以，我們還需要……一個『讓大人們無法忽視』的方式。」\n\n「什麼方式？」晴晴和阿釁同時問。\n\n未晞低下頭，想了很久很久。\n\n然後，她抬起頭，眼神裡，閃爍著堅定的光芒：\n\n「我們……要讓全校，都看見。」\n\n「讓全校都看見？」阿釁愣住。\n\n「嗯。」未晞說，「把證據，貼在全校都看得見的地方。讓每一個人，都親眼看到——我們喝的水，正在被污染。」\n\n「可是……」晴晴皺起眉頭，「如果我們擅自張貼，會不會……」\n\n「會被處罰。」未晞輕輕說，「可是，有些事情，比處罰，更重要。」\n\n器材室裡，三個孩子，靜靜地，看著那瓶灰綠色的水。\n\n「……好。」阿釁最後說，「那我們，就讓全校，都看見！」\n\n「但是，」未晞補充，「在那之前，我們要先做好一件事。」\n\n「什麼事？」\n\n「保護好證據。」未晞把那瓶水樣，小心翼翼地收進盒子裡，「證據在，我們的話，才有人聽。」\n\n「但是……」溜溜喘著氣，聲音帶著一點點凝重，「我在工業區裡面，看到了一些東西。」\n\n「什麼東西？」晴晴問。\n\n「我看到，」溜溜的電子眼裡，閃過一抹複雜的光芒，「那條管線的源頭，連著一家工廠。工廠的招牌上，寫著……」\n\n溜溜頓了頓，說出那個名字：\n\n「『宏遠食品加工廠』。」\n\n「宏遠食品加工廠……」未晞喃喃地重複著這個名字，然後，她的臉色，忽然變得蒼白。\n\n「未晞？」晴晴發現她的異樣，「你怎麼了？」\n\n「這個名字……」未晞低聲說，「我在未來……聽過。」\n\n「聽過？」阿釁愣住，「你聽過這家工廠？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞的臉色，越來越白，「在我那個時代的課本裡……『宏遠食品加工廠』，是一個『教訓』。」\n\n「什麼教訓？」\n\n「課本裡寫著，」未晞的聲音，微微顫抖，「二〇二七年，這家工廠，因為偷排廢水，污染了當地的水源。河水變色，魚群死光，附近的孩子……」\n\n「附近的孩子？」晴晴緊張地問。\n\n「附近的孩子，」未晞閉上眼睛，「有一半，都因為喝了污染的水，生了病。」\n\n「生病……」阿釁倒抽一口涼氣。\n\n「課本裡說，」未晞輕輕說，「如果那時候，有人早一點阻止……那些孩子，就不會生病了。」\n\n「那……」晴晴的聲音乾啞，「如果我們現在……」\n\n「現在，」未晞睜開眼睛，眼神裡，燃起前所未有的決心，「課本裡的那一頁，還沒有寫上。我們……」\n\n「我們還有機會，改寫它！」阿釁大聲接下去。\n\n月光下，四個夥伴的身影，在工業區的圍牆外，靜靜地，站成了一排。\n\n「那我們，就來改寫它吧。」晴晴說。\n\n「好——！」三個人，加上一隻小寵物，異口同聲。\n\n而他們不知道的是，在工業區深處，那間「宏遠食品加工廠」的辦公室裡，一個低沉的聲音，正在講電話：\n\n「……對。把排放時間，調整到深夜三點。」\n\n「再加大排放量。」\n\n「他們不是要查嗎？那就讓他們，查個『夠』。」\n\n「反正……等他們查到證據的時候，那些證據，早就被我們……」\n\n「處理乾淨了。」\n\n深夜的排水溝，靜靜地，流著灰綠色的水。\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 15: The Spreading Taint in the Water\n\nIn the first week of the \"Extreme Speed Operation,\" Weixi's bracelet dropped from twenty-four to twenty-two.\n\n\"Two days, two digits.\" Qingqing recorded the number in her notebook, brows tightly knit, \"The speed... has gotten faster again.\"\n\n\"It's fine.\" Weixi said softly, \"There's still enough.\"\n\n\"Enough for what!\" A-Xin couldn't help lowering his voice, \"Twenty-two days is nowhere near enough!\"\n\n\"Enough for you to find out the truth about the drainage ditch.\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"That's what we agreed on, isn't it?\"\n\nA-Xin opened his mouth, then finally closed it.\n\nHe felt that Weixi's smile seemed to hide something... he didn't dare think deeply about.\n\nAnd while the three-person alliance was busy with the \"Extreme Speed Operation,\" the anomalies at school also began to \"erupt in full force.\"\n\nFirst, the drinking fountains.\n\n\"Hey, don't you guys think,\" at lunchtime, Old Wu wrinkled his nose, staring at his water bottle, \"the drinking fountain water tastes weirder and weirder?\"\n\n\"Yeah!\" Wang Zhuankai nodded along, \"I took a sip yesterday and felt it had a... indescribable taste. Salty, but not quite. Salty, but not exactly salty.\"\n\n\"Salty?\" Lin Yunyun asked worriedly, \"Then... can we still drink it?\"\n\n\"We should be able to, right?\" A-Xin said, \"Didn't the school say the water quality passed inspection?\"\n\n\"But...\" Old Wu shook his head and said quietly, \"My dad said that at his workplace, a nearby factory got caught secretly discharging wastewater, and the water in the whole community changed taste. He said, 'When water changes taste, it means something has gotten in.'\"\n\n\"Secretly discharging wastewater...\" The children looked at each other.\n\n\"Come on, no way?\" Wang Zhuankai forced a dry laugh, \"That drainage ditch behind our school is just a little stinky, right? What does it have to do with the school's water?\"\n\n\"But...\" Lin Yunyun lowered her head, her voice growing smaller and smaller, \"my stomach hurt yesterday. The health room teacher said that over the past two weeks, more than twenty classmates have had stomach trouble...\"\n\nThe classroom suddenly fell quiet.\n\nA heavy, nameless atmosphere spread through the room.\n\n\"I... I'm not feeling well either.\" A boy in the corner said quietly, \"My stomach hurt all night last night.\"\n\n\"Me too...\" Another girl followed, \"My mom said if I'm still unwell, she's taking me to the doctor.\"\n\n\"Why didn't any of you say so earlier!\" A-Xin's eyes went wide.\n\n\"We...\" Lin Yunyun lowered her head, \"we were afraid that saying it would make everyone worry more...\"\n\n\"You idiots!\" A-Xin couldn't help shouting, \"If you're not feeling well, you have to say it! If you don't tell us, how are we supposed to know what to do?!\"\n\nThe classroom fell quiet again.\n\n\"I'm sorry...\" Lin Yunyun's eyes reddened, \"I... I didn't want to scare everyone...\"\n\n\"Yunyun!\" Qingqing walked over and took her hand, \"You're right, we shouldn't hide it. But...\" she swept her gaze across the class and said loudly, \"we also shouldn't be afraid! We're the 'Protect Earth Operations Unit'! The more times like this, the more we need to stick together!\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin jumped onto the podium, \"Everyone listen up! Starting today, our 'Protect Earth Operations Unit' has a new mission—'Water Quality Monitoring'!\"\n\n\"Water quality monitoring?\" The children looked at each other.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"We're going to record the drinking fountain water, the drainage ditch water, and the seawater at the river mouth every day! Record their colors, their smells, their changes! We're going to use 'data' to protect ourselves!\"\n\n\"Using data to protect ourselves...\" Wang Zhuankai murmured in repetition.\n\n\"Right!\" Qingqing continued, \"The adults say the water quality passes, so we'll use our eyes, our noses, our records—and let the adults see what the water really looks like!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\" The children's morale was instantly ignited.\n\n\"Then, who's in charge of recording?\" Old Wu asked.\n\n\"You!\" A-Xin pointed at Old Wu, \"Your nose is the sharpest! You're in charge of 'smelling'! Record the ditch's smell every day!\"\n\n\"Alright!\" Old Wu patted his chest, \"I'm the number one smeller in the whole school!\"\n\n\"Then I'll record the colors!\" Lin Yunyun said.\n\n\"I'll take the photos!\" Wang Zhuankai raised his hand.\n\n\"I'm in charge of... believing in everyone!\" A-Xin said loudly.\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed, feeling much more at ease than before.\n\n\"Everyone, don't scare yourselves!\" Qingqing stood up and said loudly, \"The school is already handling it! We...\"\n\n\"Qingqing is right,\" Weixi also spoke, her voice soft yet unusually steady, \"everyone, don't panic for now. If the school's water really has a problem, the adults will definitely find out.\"\n\n\"But...\" Old Wu hesitated.\n\n\"Trust me,\" Weixi looked at Old Wu, her tone gentle, \"we'll get to the bottom of this together.\"\n\nOld Wu looked at Weixi's clear eyes, and the unease in his heart seemed to... settle a little.\n\n\"Alright!\" He nodded, \"Then we'll wait for Weixi!\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" The children responded in unison.\n\nBut only Qingqing and A-Xin knew how heavy the burden was behind Weixi's words, \"get to the bottom of this.\"\n\nThe next day, an \"unexpected visitor\" appeared at school.\n\n\"Hey? Isn't that Dean Zhou?\" A-Xin leaned on the hallway railing, watching the edge of the playground where Dean Zhou was crouching beside the drainage ditch, staring at the water in the ditch, \"What's the Dean looking at?\"\n\n\"He's looking at the drainage ditch.\" Weixi walked over and said softly.\n\n\"The drainage ditch?\" A-Xin blinked, \"Doesn't the Dean hate stinky ditches? He used to scold us for going near the ditch during patrols!\"\n\n\"Because,\" Weixi's gaze rested on Dean Zhou, \"he's not 'patrolling' now. He's 'investigating.'\"\n\n\"Investigating?\" A-Xin froze.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"When adults sense something wrong, they start investigating. The Dean... has noticed.\"\n\nLooking at Dean Zhou crouching by the ditch, a nameless feeling rose in A-Xin's heart.\n\n\"Then...\" he asked in a low voice, \"what will the Dean find?\"\n\n\"I don't know.\" Weixi shook her head, \"But at least, he isn't pretending not to see.\"\n\nIn fact, Dean Zhou's investigation had begun a week earlier.\n\nHe walked along the drainage ditch, step by step upstream from behind the school.\n\n\"Step one: behind the school. Water color: grayish-green. Odor: strong.\" The Dean wrote down the first record in his notebook.\n\n\"Step two: by the industrial road. Water color: deepened. Odor: stronger. White foam appearing on the surface.\"\n\n\"Step three: beside the abandoned farmhouse. Water color: almost black-green. Odor: pungent. Floating on the surface...\" the Dean crouched down, frowning, \"dead fish.\"\n\n\"Step four: the edge of the industrial zone. Here...\" the Dean stopped, looking at the gray, hazy factory area ahead, \"there's a very strong chemical smell. And...\" he looked down at the ditch, \"there's a pipe in the ditch that shouldn't be there.\"\n\nHe crouched down and examined the pipe closely.\n\nThe pipe's diameter was thicker than an ordinary drainage pipe; its outer wall was coated with a layer of grayish-white crystals—the traces left by dried chemicals.\n\n\"This pipe...\" the Dean said in a low voice, \"isn't registered on the industrial zone's pipe map.\"\n\nHe pulled out his phone, took a few photos, and recorded the pipe's location.\n\n\"Whoever you are,\" the Dean looked at the pipe, a stubbornness in his tone, \"I will definitely catch you.\"\n\nIn the afternoon, in the principal's office.\n\n\"Old Zhou,\" Principal Qiu held his teacup, his expression grave, \"the drinking fountain water—the water company has come to test it three times, and each time they say it passes.\"\n\n\"Passes?\" Dean Zhou stood by the window, looking at the drainage ditch outside, \"Principal, don't you find that strange?\"\n\n\"What's strange?\"\n\n\"The drinking fountain water,\" Dean Zhou turned around, \"uses tap water. The tap water passes. But then why are more and more students getting stomach trouble after drinking it?\"\n\n\"That's...\" Principal Qiu paused.\n\n\"I suspect,\" Dean Zhou's voice was very low, \"the problem isn't the drinking fountains.\"\n\n\"Then where is it?\"\n\nDean Zhou was silent for a moment, then walked to the principal and spread out a map.\n\n\"Principal, this is a map of the drainage ditch behind the school.\" He pointed at a line on the map, \"This ditch starts behind the school and runs all the way upstream, connecting to...\"\n\nHis finger stopped at a spot on the map.\n\n\"The industrial zone.\" Principal Qiu's expression instantly turned grave.\n\n\"I walked the length of the ditch,\" Dean Zhou said, \"and when I reached the edge of the industrial zone, I saw a pipe. A pipe not registered on any map.\"\n\n\"A pipe?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Dean Zhou nodded, \"It's hidden in the weeds, extending from the industrial zone, plunging straight into the drainage ditch. The water in the ditch...\" he paused, \"the color is wrong. And the smell is wrong too.\"\n\n\"You mean...\" Principal Qiu's hand trembled slightly.\n\n\"Principal,\" Dean Zhou took a deep breath, \"I recommend we notify the environmental protection bureau to thoroughly investigate this pipe.\"\n\nPrincipal Qiu was silent.\n\n\"Old Zhou,\" it was a long moment before he spoke, \"do you know what the consequences will be once this is investigated?\"\n\n\"I know.\" Dean Zhou said, \"If it turns out some factory in the industrial zone is secretly discharging... that factory could be shut down and fined. The people involved could be in serious trouble.\"\n\n\"Then you still...\"\n\n\"Principal,\" Dean Zhou interrupted him, his tone more resolute than ever before, \"I've been dean of student affairs for twenty years, and I've never let a single matter that should be investigated go, just because I was 'afraid of trouble.'\"\n\n\"And...\" a softness flickered in his eyes, \"those kids fought for a whole semester over a stinky ditch. This adult can't lose to them.\"\n\nPrincipal Qiu looked at him for a very, very long time, then let out a heavy sigh.\n\n\"...Fine.\" He nodded, \"I'll leave it to you.\"\n\nHowever, Dean Zhou's actions had touched a nerve in someone.\n\nThat evening, in the office of a factory in the industrial zone, the phone rang urgently.\n\n\"Hello? It's me.\" A low voice answered, \"At the school... they've started investigating.\"\n\n\"Mhm. It's about that drainage ditch.\"\n\n\"I know. So...\" the voice paused, \"increase that pipe's discharge volume. And bury the pipe deeper.\"\n\n\"Yes. Before they finish investigating, get the evidence...\"\n\n\"cleaned up.\"\n\nThe phone hung up.\n\nNight quietly enveloped the industrial zone.\n\nThe next morning, Liu-Liu brought back news like a thunderbolt.\n\n\"Class President! Bad news!\" Liu-Liu burst out of the ventilation duct, its voice trembling, \"That pipe... last night's discharge was a full double the usual volume!\"\n\n\"Double?!\" Qingqing and A-Xin's eyes went wide at the same time.\n\n\"And!\" Liu-Liu panted, \"I followed the pipe into the industrial zone and discovered...\"\n\n\"Discovered what?\"\n\n\"Discovered...\" a flicker of fear passed through Liu-Liu's electronic eyes, \"that the pipe's source inside the industrial zone has been covered with dirt! And they're digging a deeper trench to bury the pipe even deeper!\"\n\n\"They're destroying the evidence!\" A-Xin jumped up, \"They know someone's investigating!\"\n\n\"Calm down!\" Qingqing held him back, \"Don't panic yet!\"\n\n\"Don't panic?\" A-Xin hopped frantically, \"They're burying the pipe! Once they're done, we'll never find the evidence!\"\n\n\"A-Xin is right,\" Weixi spoke, her voice soft yet silencing the equipment room, \"they're racing against time. We have to race against time too.\"\n\n\"Racing against time...\" Qingqing murmured in repetition.\n\n\"We can't just wait for the Dean alone.\" Weixi said, \"We have to get the evidence before they bury it all clean!\"\n\n\"But,\" A-Xin grimaced, \"how are we supposed to get it? We can't just break into the industrial zone!\"\n\n\"We can't break in,\" a determination never seen before flickered in Weixi's eyes, \"but we have Liu-Liu.\"\n\n\"Liu-Liu?\" A-Xin and Qingqing looked at Liu-Liu at the same time.\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" Weixi crouched down and gently patted Liu-Liu's head, \"can you do it?\"\n\nLiu-Liu puffed out its chest, a flame burning in its electronic eyes:\n\n\"Beep beep! I can!\" Liu-Liu said loudly, \"I'm the school's intelligence king! Sneak photos, video, collecting water samples... I can do it all!\"\n\n\"Good!\" Weixi smiled softly, \"Then let's take a gamble!\"\n\nLate that night, outside the industrial zone's wall.\n\nFour small figures hid in the grass, holding their breath.\n\n\"A-Xin, are you sure we should do this?\" Qingqing lowered her voice, tension in her tone, \"This is the industrial zone! What if we get caught...\"\n\n\"We won't get caught!\" A-Xin patted his chest, \"We're hidden here; no one can see us!\"\n\n\"But...\" Qingqing looked at the tall wall before them, \"if something happens to Liu-Liu in there...\"\n\n\"It won't.\" Weixi said softly, \"Liu-Liu is the fastest in the school. And...\" she smiled faintly, \"Liu-Liu is our 'Protect Earth Operations Unit's' 'Intel Chief.' It can definitely do it.\"\n\n\"How are you both so confident...\" Qingqing laughed helplessly.\n\n\"Because,\" A-Xin looked at the wall, his tone turning serious, \"we believe in it. Just as it believes in us.\"\n\nThe wind blew through the grass.\n\nThe three children waited quietly.\n\n\"Hey, Weixi,\" A-Xin suddenly spoke during the wait, \"you said earlier that Liu-Liu 'still has a mission to complete.' What mission is that?\"\n\nWeixi froze for a moment.\n\n\"I meant...\" she lowered her head and said softly, \"it hasn't yet seen the day we find out the truth about the drainage ditch.\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin was silent for a moment, then nodded hard, \"Right! It has to see it! We must let it see it!\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi smiled, \"We definitely will.\"\n\n\"And,\" A-Xin suddenly thought of something, lowering his voice, \"Weixi, tell me honestly—how much is left on your bracelet?\"\n\nWeixi fell silent.\n\n\"...Twenty-one.\" she finally said.\n\n\"Twenty-one...\" A-Xin's heart sank, but he forced a smile, \"It's okay! Twenty-one is enough for us to do a lot of things!\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded softly, \"It's enough.\"\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" A-Xin lowered his voice, giving instructions, \"remember: first take photos of the pipe, then collect the water sample, and then—come straight back! No showing off!\"\n\n\"Beep beep! Roger!\" Liu-Liu took a deep breath, \"I'm off!\"\n\n\"Wait!\" Weixi called it back.\n\n\"Hmm?\"\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" Weixi said softly, \"if... if you get discovered, abandon the mission and protect yourself first. Evidence can be found again. You, there's only one of you.\"\n\nLiu-Liu's electronic eyes flickered.\n\n\"Beep beep.\" It said in a low voice, \"I understand.\"\n\nThen, Liu-Liu's small figure, like a silver-white bolt of lightning, darted into the industrial zone, silent and unseen.\n\nIn the grass, the three children held their breath, waiting.\n\nOne second... one minute... five minutes...\n\n\"Why isn't it back yet...\" A-Xin muttered nervously.\n\n\"Easy.\" Qingqing lowered her voice, \"Liu-Liu is the fastest in the school.\"\n\n\"But...\" A-Xin's heart pounded, \"what if it gets caught...\"\n\n\"It won't.\" Weixi's voice was unexpectedly calm, \"Liu-Liu will come back. Because...\" she smiled faintly, \"it still has a mission to complete.\"\n\nJust then—\n\n\"Swish!\"\n\nA silver-white figure darted back from the other side of the wall at lightning speed!\n\n\"Beep beep beep! Mission complete!\" Liu-Liu stopped in front of the three, panting, a small bottle in its mouth, \"Photos! Water sample! Both secured!\"\n\n\"Amazing!\" A-Xin jumped up excitedly, \"Liu-Liu! You're incredible!\"\n\n\"Let's go! Let's go test the water sample!\" Qingqing carefully held the small bottle, \"The testing tools we bought with the fair money finally get to be used!\"\n\nBack in the equipment room, Qingqing opened the testing toolbox and spread out the test strips and reagents.\n\n\"Test the pH first!\" Qingqing dipped a test strip into the water sample, \"...4.5.\"\n\n\"4.5?!\" A-Xin's eyes went wide, \"That's more acidic than plum juice!\"\n\n\"Now test for heavy metals!\" Qingqing dropped in the reagent and watched the color change, \"...the color is deepening. Comparing against the color chart...\"\n\n\"How much?\" A-Xin asked nervously.\n\n\"...\" Qingqing looked at the color chart, her face growing paler and paler, \"Over the limit. Exceeding the standard by... six times.\"\n\n\"Six times?!\" A-Xin gasped, \"If this water really flows into the sea...\"\n\n\"The fish will die.\" Weixi said softly, \"And if people drink it... they'll get sick.\"\n\nThe equipment room fell into silence.\n\n\"We have evidence.\" After a long moment, Qingqing spoke, her voice hoarse, \"Photos, water samples, test data... we have evidence.\"\n\n\"But,\" A-Xin looked at the grayish-green water sample, unwillingness in his tone, \"evidence alone isn't enough. We need the adults to believe us!\"\n\n\"Right.\" Weixi nodded, \"So we also need... a way that the adults can't ignore.\"\n\n\"What way?\" Qingqing and A-Xin asked at the same time.\n\nWeixi lowered her head and thought for a very, very long time.\n\nThen she looked up, a resolute light flickering in her eyes:\n\n\"We... have to make the whole school see.\"\n\n\"Make the whole school see?\" A-Xin froze.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi said, \"Post the evidence where the whole school can see it. Let every person see with their own eyes—the water we drink is being polluted.\"\n\n\"But...\" Qingqing frowned, \"if we post it without permission, won't we...\"\n\n\"Get punished.\" Weixi said softly, \"But some things matter more than punishment.\"\n\nIn the equipment room, the three children quietly looked at that bottle of grayish-green water.\n\n\"...Fine.\" A-Xin finally said, \"Then we'll make the whole school see!\"\n\n\"But,\" Weixi added, \"before that, we have to do one thing first.\"\n\n\"What?\"\n\n\"Protect the evidence.\" Weixi carefully put the water sample into a box, \"As long as the evidence is safe, people will listen to our words.\"\n\n\"But...\" Liu-Liu panted, its voice carrying a hint of gravity, \"I saw some things inside the industrial zone.\"\n\n\"What things?\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"I saw,\" a complex light flickered in Liu-Liu's electronic eyes, \"that the pipe's source connects to a factory. On the factory's signboard was written...\"\n\nLiu-Liu paused, then said the name:\n\n\"'Hongyuan Food Processing Factory.'\"\n\n\"Hongyuan Food Processing Factory...\" Weixi murmured the name in repetition, and then, her face suddenly turned pale.\n\n\"Weixi?\" Qingqing noticed her change, \"What's wrong?\"\n\n\"This name...\" Weixi said in a low voice, \"I've heard it... in the future.\"\n\n\"Heard of it?\" A-Xin froze, \"You've heard of this factory?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi's face grew paler and paler, \"In the textbooks of my era... 'Hongyuan Food Processing Factory' is a 'lesson.'\"\n\n\"What lesson?\"\n\n\"The textbook says,\" Weixi's voice trembled slightly, \"in 2027, this factory polluted the local water source by secretly discharging wastewater. The river changed color, the fish died, and the children nearby...\"\n\n\"The children nearby?\" Qingqing asked nervously.\n\n\"The children nearby,\" Weixi closed her eyes, \"half of them got sick from drinking the polluted water.\"\n\n\"Sick...\" A-Xin gasped.\n\n\"The textbook says,\" Weixi said softly, \"that if someone had stopped it earlier back then... those children wouldn't have gotten sick.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Qingqing's voice was dry, \"if we act now...\"\n\n\"Now,\" Weixi opened her eyes, a determination never seen before burning in them, \"that page in the textbook hasn't been written yet. We...\"\n\n\"We still have a chance to rewrite it!\" A-Xin said loudly.\n\nIn the moonlight, the four partners' silhouettes stood quietly in a row outside the industrial zone's wall.\n\n\"Then let's rewrite it.\" Qingqing said.\n\n\"Okay—!\" The three children, plus one little pet, said in unison.\n\nWhat they didn't know was that deep inside the industrial zone, in the office of that \"Hongyuan Food Processing Factory,\" a low voice was talking on the phone:\n\n\"...Yes. Adjust the discharge time to three o'clock in the deep night.\"\n\n\"Increase the discharge volume again.\"\n\n\"Aren't they going to investigate? Then let them investigate their 'fill.'\"\n\n\"Anyway... by the time they find the evidence, those pieces of evidence will have already been...\"\n\n\"cleaned up by us.\"\n\nIn the deep night, the drainage ditch silently flowed with grayish-green water.\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":8,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第十六章：污染警報\n\n「讓全校都看見」的計畫，在第三天晚上，正式啟動。\n\n器材室裡，三個孩子，加上溜溜，圍著一張桌子，忙得不可開交。\n\n「照片！列印！」阿釁把溜溜拍到的管線照片，一張一張地，貼在大海報上，「大家快看！這就是那條管線！」\n\n「檢測數據！」晴晴把檢測結果，工工整整地抄在海報上，「PH值：四點五。重金屬：超標六倍！」\n\n「水樣！」未晞把那瓶灰綠色的水，用膠帶，牢牢地固定在海報中央，「讓大家親眼看看，這瓶『水』，是什麼顏色！」\n\n「嗶嗶！」溜溜叼著一支筆，在海報角落，歪歪扭扭地寫下標題——\n\n「【警告】我們喝的水，正在被污染！」\n\n「寫得真醜。」阿釁吐槽。\n\n「嗶嗶！是你不懂藝術！」溜溜反駁。\n\n「夠了夠了！」晴晴拍了拍手，「檢查一遍！這張海報，明天一早，要貼在全校公布欄上！」\n\n「還有，」未晞補充，「我們要準備很多份。貼在公布欄、貼在操場、貼在教室門口——讓全校，都看見！」\n\n「好！」三個孩子，加上溜溜，用力點頭。\n\n那一夜，海報的墨水味，在器材室裡，飄了一整晚。\n\n第二天，天還沒亮，三個孩子就偷偷溜進學校。\n\n「快！趁大家還沒來！」阿釁踩著椅子，把第一張海報，貼在公布欄最顯眼的位置。\n\n「這張貼操場！」晴晴把第二張海報，貼在操場司令台旁。\n\n「這張……貼在校門口！」未晞輕輕說。\n\n「校門口？」阿釁愣住，「那不是連路過的大人都會看到？」\n\n「就是要讓大人看到。」未晞說，「讓大人們知道，孩子們發現了他們沒發現的事。」\n\n海報，一張一張地，貼好了。\n\n三個人退到走廊另一頭，遠遠地，看著自己的「作品」。\n\n「看起來……」阿釁緊張地嚥了嚥口水，「好像真的會出大事。」\n\n「嗯。」未晞輕輕說，「會出大事。可是……這是對的大事。」\n\n然而，命運，沒有給他們「大事」的機會。\n\n當天早上七點半，當第一個學生踏進校門的時候——\n\n公布欄上的海報，已經不見了。\n\n「海報呢？」阿釁衝到公布欄前，翻來翻去，「我明明貼在這裡的！」\n\n「司令台旁的也不見了！」晴晴跑回來，臉色發白，「校門口那張……也被撕掉了！」\n\n「怎麼會……」阿釁喃喃地，「誰撕的？」\n\n「……」未晞蹲在公布欄前，撿起地上的一角海報殘片，沉默了。\n\n「未晞？」晴晴發現她的異樣，「你怎麼了？」\n\n「這張海報，」未晞輕輕說，「不是被『學生』撕的。」\n\n「什麼意思？」\n\n「你看這裡。」未晞指著殘片的邊緣，「撕得很整齊。而且……」她低下頭，「它是被人『很專業』地撕下來的。好像……他們做過很多次了。」\n\n「他們？」阿釁的心，猛地一沉，「未晞，你是說……」\n\n「有人在阻止我們。」未晞的聲音，輕得像一片羽毛，「而且，不是學校的人。」\n\n操場上，晨風吹過。\n\n三個孩子，站在空蕩蕩的公布欄前，一句話，都說不出來。\n\n「怎麼會這樣……」阿釁蹲在地上，看著那張被撕得只剩一角的海報，聲音都在發抖，「我們熬了三個晚上做的海報……他們怎麼可以……」\n\n「阿釁，」晴晴蹲下來，握住他的肩膀，「我們先冷靜下來。」\n\n「我冷靜不了！」阿釁紅著眼眶，「我們是為了學校！是為了大家！他們憑什麼……」\n\n「因為，」未晞開口了，聲音輕輕的，卻帶著一種力量，「我們發現了，他們不想讓別人發現的事。」\n\n「未晞……」晴晴看向她。\n\n「海報被撕了，」未晞說，「代表他們慌了。他們越慌，就代表……我們做對了。」\n\n「做對了……」阿釁愣住。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「阿釁，你要記住：他們可以撕海報、埋管線，可是……」她舉起手裡那瓶一直貼身帶著的水樣，「證據，在我們這裡。」\n\n「水樣……」阿釁的眼睛，慢慢地，重新亮了起來。\n\n「對！」晴晴站起來，「海報沒了，沒關係！我們有更重要的東西！」\n\n「那我們現在怎麼辦？」阿釁問。\n\n「我們……」未晞看向校長室的方向，「把證據，交給大人。」\n\n「交給誰？」阿釁問。\n\n「一個，」未晞輕輕說，「他們搶不走的人。」\n\n那天早上，學校裡，接連發生了兩件大事。\n\n第一件：學校宣布——「因水質檢驗異常，本校飲水機，即日起暫停使用。全校師生，請自備飲水。」\n\n「飲水機停了？」孩子們議論紛紛，「那我們喝什麼？」\n\n「學校說，會提供瓶裝水！」老巫抱著一箱礦泉水，氣喘吁吁地跑進教室，「一人一瓶！限量！」\n\n「瓶裝水……」林芸芸低頭，看著自己手裡的礦泉水瓶，小聲說，「我們學校的水……真的出事了嗎？」\n\n第二件：保健室的統計，出來了。\n\n「這一個月，」晴晴的媽媽，在電話裡，語氣凝重地告訴她，「全校因為肚子不舒服來保健室的孩子，超過了五十個。」\n\n「五十個？！」晴晴倒抽一口涼氣。\n\n「學校已經通報教育局了。」晴晴媽媽說，「聽說，環保局的人，今天會來學校。」\n\n「環保局……」晴晴喃喃地重複著。\n\n那天上午，六年一班教室裡，出現了一場「瓶裝水大作戰」。\n\n「一人一瓶！限量！不要搶！」老巫抱著作業簿一樣大的箱子，氣喘吁吁地分發，「學校說，在飲水機修好之前，大家都喝這個！」\n\n「礦泉水……」尪伝恺接過瓶子，左看右看，「我第一次覺得，礦泉水這麼珍貴。」\n\n「我以前都覺得，水龍頭的水，永遠不會停。」林芸芸小聲說，「現在……突然覺得，可以打開水龍頭喝水，是一件很幸福的事。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「你們說，」一個男生小聲問，「學校的水，真的出事了嗎？」\n\n「應該……只是暫時的吧？」另一個女生說，「學校不是說，只是『水質檢驗異常』嗎？」\n\n「可是……」老巫壓低聲音，「我聽廚房阿姨說，這幾天，學校後面那條排水溝，臭得連廚房的窗戶都不敢開。」\n\n「那條排水溝……」尪伝恺的臉色，微微變了，「它跟學校的水……真的有關嗎？」\n\n教室裡，誰也沒有回答。\n\n而午休時間，晴晴的手機，響個不停。\n\n「晴晴，」她媽媽的聲音，帶著焦急，「你們班群組，好多家長都在問！學校的水到底怎麼了？你沒有不舒服吧？」\n\n「我沒有，媽媽。」晴晴說。\n\n「那就好……」媽媽鬆了一口氣，「對了，你們學校，是不是有學生喝到不好的水？」\n\n「……」晴晴沉默了一下，「媽媽，你知道『宏遠食品加工廠』嗎？」\n\n「宏遠？」媽媽想了想，「沒聽過。怎麼了？」\n\n「沒有。」晴晴搖搖頭，「我只是……隨便問問。」\n\n掛上電話，晴晴看向窗外。\n\n學校後方的方向，隱隱約約，能聞到一股說不上來的味道。\n\n「明天，」她低聲說，「環保局的人就來了。我們一定要，把證據交出去。」\n\n「小晴，」媽媽的聲音，帶著擔憂，「你最近，有沒有不舒服？」\n\n「我沒有。」晴晴說。\n\n「那就好。」媽媽鬆了一口氣，「如果有不舒服，一定要跟媽媽說！」\n\n「嗯。」晴晴點頭。\n\n可是掛上電話後，晴晴的心，卻一點都輕鬆不起來。\n\n「環保局的人要來……」她低聲說，「可是，證據呢？」\n\n「證據被埋了。」溜溜的聲音，從她的書包裡傳出來，難得地沉重，「我今天早上，又飛去工業區一趟……那條管線，已經被完全埋掉了。」\n\n「埋掉了？！」\n\n「嗯。」溜溜點頭，「連管線的痕跡，都看不到了。而且，入海口那邊……海水變色的範圍，又擴大了。他們把管子埋了，可是污染，還在繼續。」\n\n「證據沒了，污染還在……」晴晴的心，沉到了谷底。\n\n「班長大人，」溜溜低聲問，「我們……怎麼辦？」\n\n晴晴沉默了。\n\n「……我們還有證據。」過了很久，她說。\n\n「什麼證據？」\n\n「我們有照片。我們有水樣。我們有檢測數據。」晴晴的聲音，越來越堅定，「我們在他們『毀滅證據』之前，把證據，拿到手了！」\n\n「可是……」溜溜低聲說，「那些證據，只放在器材室。如果我們拿出來……會不會又被……」\n\n「所以，」晴晴的眼中，閃過一抹光芒，「我們要把證據，交給一個『他們搶不走』的人。」\n\n「誰？」\n\n「一個，」晴晴低聲說，「連校長都尊敬的人。」\n\n當天下午，校長室。\n\n「你們說，你們有證據？」邱校長看著面前三個孩子，表情複雜。\n\n「有！」阿釁從書包裡，掏出一疊厚厚的資料，「管線的照片！水樣！檢測數據！全都在這裡！」\n\n「校長，」晴晴的聲音，微微發抖，卻異常堅定，「我們知道，這些證據，是我們偷偷拿到的。我們也知道，我們不該擅自調查。」\n\n「可是，」她抬起頭，眼神裡，閃爍著淚光，「如果我們不調查……誰會發現，我們喝的水，正在被污染？」\n\n校長室裡，沉默了。\n\n三個孩子，站在校長面前，心跳得飛快。\n\n「校長，」阿釁忍不住開口，「我們知道，我們這樣做，可能不對。可是……」\n\n「可是什麼？」邱校長問。\n\n「可是，」阿釁深吸一口氣，「我們是『守護地球作戰部隊』。我們發過誓，要保護地球、保護學校、保護我們喝的水。所以……」\n\n「所以你們就偷偷跑去工業區？」邱校長的語氣，聽不出情緒。\n\n「是！」阿釁挺起胸膛，「就算會被處罰，我們也要做！」\n\n「……」邱校長看著他，看了很久很久。\n\n「阿釁，」他最後開口，語氣裡，帶著一種複雜的情緒，「你知道，我當了三十年校長，聽過多少孩子跟我說『就算會被處罰，我也要做』嗎？」\n\n「不知道……」阿釁小聲說。\n\n「不多。」邱校長說，「大部分孩子，說的是『不要告訴老師』。會說『就算會被處罰，我也要做』的孩子……」他停頓了一下，「我這三十年，只聽過你們三個。」\n\n「校長……」三個孩子，愣住了。\n\n「坐吧。」邱校長嘆了一口氣，「把你們的證據，拿給我看。」\n\n「是！」三個孩子，連忙把資料遞上去。\n\n邱校長拿起那疊資料，一張一張地，翻看著。\n\n管線的照片。灰綠色的水樣。PH四點五的檢測結果。重金屬超標六倍的數據。\n\n「……這瓶水，」邱校長放下資料，聲音乾啞，「真的是從我們學校後面那條排水溝，取出來的？」\n\n「是。」未晞點頭，「而且，那條管線，連著工業區的『宏遠食品加工廠』。」\n\n「宏遠食品加工廠……」邱校長喃喃地重複著。\n\n「校長，」周嚴主任忽然開口，聲音低沉，「讓我來處理吧。」\n\n「老周……」邱校長看向他。\n\n「孩子們的證據，是真的。」周嚴主任說，「我沿著排水溝走過一趟，親眼看過那條管線。現在，管線被他們埋掉了。可是……」他拿起那瓶灰綠色的水樣，「這瓶水，是埋不掉的。」\n\n「你打算怎麼做？」邱校長問。\n\n「環保局的人，明天會來。」周嚴主任說，「我會把證據，親自交給他們。而且……」他的眼神，閃過一抹銳利的光芒，「我會帶著這瓶水，一起去。」\n\n「主任……」三個孩子，愣愣地看著他。\n\n「你們做得很好。」周嚴主任看著他們，語氣裡，帶著一種前所未有的溫柔，「接下來，交給大人吧。」\n\n「可是，主任！」阿釁急了，「如果工廠的人，又……」\n\n「不會的。」周嚴主任說，「他們可以撕海報、埋管線。可是……」他拿起那瓶水樣，在燈光下，微微晃了晃，「他們沒有辦法，讓這瓶水，消失。」\n\n第二天，環保局的稽查人員，如期來到鹿陽國小。\n\n「這就是我們學校後方排水溝的水樣。」周嚴主任，把那瓶灰綠色的水，遞給稽查人員，「PH四點五。重金屬超標六倍。檢測數據，都在這裡。」\n\n「還有這些照片。」阿釁補充，「是那條管線的照片！雖然管線已經被埋了，可是照片還在！」\n\n稽查人員，仔細地，查看了每一張照片、每一筆數據。\n\n「我們等了一個月，」阿釁緊張地握著拳頭，「終於等到這一天了……」\n\n「嗯。」晴晴點頭，聲音也在發抖，「照片、水樣、數據……全都交出去了。」\n\n「現在，」未晞低聲說，「我們能做的，就只有等待了。」\n\n「等待……」阿釁喃喃地重複著，「等待，真的好煎熬。」\n\n「可是，」未晞微微笑了，「至少，我們把該做的，都做了。」\n\n「你們……」稽查人員看著眼前這三個孩子，語氣裡帶著讚嘆，「你們真的很了不起。一般的小朋友，遇到這種事，大概只會躲在家裡哭。」\n\n「我們不能哭，」阿釁說，「因為，我們是『守護地球作戰部隊』！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」稽查人員笑了，「好！『守護地球作戰部隊』！我會記住你們的！」\n\n「……這些資料，我們要帶回去，送實驗室複驗。」稽查人員說，「如果確認屬實，我們會立刻查處。」\n\n「查處？」阿釁緊張地問，「會怎麼查處？」\n\n「我們會封鎖工業區，徹查每一條管線的源頭。」稽查人員說，「如果真的是『宏遠食品加工廠』……他們將面臨停工、罰款，以及刑事責任。」\n\n「停工！」阿釁的眼睛，瞬間亮了。\n\n「但是，」稽查人員話鋒一轉，「複驗需要時間。在結果出來之前，工廠還是不會受到任何處分。」\n\n「還需要時間……」晴晴喃喃地重複著，「多久？」\n\n「最快，一個星期。」\n\n「一個星期……」未晞低下頭，看著自己手腕上的手環。\n\n那行倒數數字，在日光下，靜靜地閃爍。\n\n——十九。\n\n接下來的日子，是六年一班最難熬的一個星期。\n\n溜溜每天清晨，都會飛到入海口，記錄海水的顏色。\n\n「第一天：海水變色範圍，沒有擴大。但是……」\n\n「第二天：工廠的方向，煙囪正常運轉。管線的位置，沒有任何動靜。」\n\n「第三天：入海口，出現了一群新的死魚。」\n\n「第四天：海水顏色，開始變深。」\n\n「第五天：……」溜溜的聲音，越來越沉重，「今天，我在工廠門口，看到了一輛環保局的稽查車。」\n\n「稽查車？！」阿釁的眼睛亮起來，「是不是複驗結果出來了？！」\n\n「不知道。」溜溜搖搖頭，「我只看到，稽查人員下車，然後……工廠的大門，關起來了。」\n\n「關起來了？」晴晴愣住。\n\n「嗯。」溜溜點頭，「而且，從那天開始，工廠的煙囪……沒有再冒煙了。」\n\n「沒有冒煙……」未晞輕輕重複著，然後，她的眼眶，忽然紅了。\n\n「未晞？」阿釁和晴晴同時看向她。\n\n「沒有冒煙……」未晞的聲音，微微顫抖，「在我們那個時代的課本裡，寫著……『宏遠食品加工廠，因為偷排廢水，被勒令停工。從那一天起，它的煙囪，再也沒有冒過煙。』」\n\n「……」阿釁和晴晴，愣住了。\n\n「課本裡說，」未晞的眼淚，一滴一滴地掉下來，「『這是那個時代，最了不起的一群孩子，做到的奇蹟。』」\n\n「奇蹟……」晴晴喃喃地重複著。\n\n「晴晴、阿釁，」未晞抬起頭，看著他們，淚眼朦朧，「我們……做到了。」\n\n「我們，」阿釁的聲音，也在顫抖，「改寫了課本？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞用力點頭，「我們改寫了課本。」\n\n那一天，三個孩子，在器材室裡，哭成一團。\n\n「一個星期，」未晞輕聲說，「夠了。」\n\n「夠了？」阿釁愣住，「未晞，你……」\n\n「阿釁，」未晞微微笑了，「一個星期，夠讓大人們，把真相查清楚。一個星期……」她低下頭，聲音輕輕的，「也夠我跟大家，好好說再見了。」\n\n「未晞……」阿釁和晴晴，同時愣住了。\n\n「我算過了，」未晞說，「我的手環，現在剩下十九天。可是……它越來越快了。照這個速度……」\n\n「照這個速度，會怎樣？」阿釁緊張地問。\n\n「照這個速度，」未晞輕輕說，「大概……再過一個星期，我就要回去了。」\n\n「一個星期？！」阿釁幾乎是喊出來的，「可是，你不是說還剩十九天嗎？！」\n\n「那是『現在的』速度。」未晞說，「每一次我『看見未來』，手環的能量，就會消耗得更快。這幾天下來……」\n\n她低頭，看了一眼手環。\n\n「已經，剩下十九天了。」\n\n「未晞，」晴晴的聲音，微微顫抖，「你老實告訴我……你還能撐多久？」\n\n未晞沉默了。\n\n「……我不知道。」她最後說，「可是，我會努力，撐到那一天。」\n\n「撐到哪一天？」\n\n「撐到……」未晞抬起頭，看向窗外的海，「撐到那條排水溝，恢復清澈的那一天。撐到……」她輕輕笑了，「撐到大家，都學會保護地球的那一天。」\n\n其實，這幾天，未晞的「閃回」，已經嚴重到，連晴晴都快要瞞不住了。\n\n上課的時候，她會突然盯著黑板，一動不動。\n\n午休的時候，她會忽然站起來，走到窗邊，對著窗外說「對不起」。\n\n「未晞，」某天放學，晴晴終於忍不住問，「你最近……是不是看到更多『未來』了？」\n\n未晞沉默了一會，點頭：「嗯。而且……越來越清楚了。」\n\n「清楚？」\n\n「以前，我看到的未來，是模糊的。」未晞說，「可是現在……我看到奶奶，看到配給站，看到灰黃色的天空……都像真的發生在眼前一樣。」\n\n「那……」晴晴緊張地問，「會痛嗎？」\n\n「不會痛。」未晞搖搖頭，「可是……會分不清楚。」\n\n「分不清楚？」\n\n「分不清楚……」未晞低下頭，聲音輕輕的，「哪裡是未來，哪裡是現在。」\n\n「未晞……」晴晴握住她的手，「你聽我說。不管發生什麼事——你現在在這裡。在鹿陽國小。在我們身邊。」\n\n「嗯。」未晞輕輕點頭，「我知道。可是……」她看著手環，「我擔心，有一天，我會『回不去』現在。」\n\n「不會的！」晴晴大聲說，「我們會叫醒你的！就像上次一樣！」\n\n「……」未晞看著晴晴那張堅定的臉，眼眶，忽然有點熱熱的。\n\n「嗯。」她低下頭，輕輕地，「謝謝你，晴晴。」\n\n那一夜，未晞獨自坐在海堤上，看著那片灰濛濛的海。\n\n手環上的數字，在月光下，一格一格地，往下掉。\n\n「二十、十九、十八……」未晞低聲數著，「十七……」\n\n她輕輕地，把手環貼在胸口。\n\n「奶奶，」她對著夜空，低聲說，「再給我一點時間。讓我看完……」她閉上眼睛，「讓我看完，孩子們把這片海，救回來的樣子。」\n\n海風，吹過她的臉頰。\n\n手環上的數字，在月光下，靜靜地，停在——十五。\n\n「十五天……」未晞輕輕笑了，「剛剛好。」\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 16: The Pollution Alarm\n\nThe plan to \"make the whole school see\" officially launched on the third night.\n\nIn the equipment room, the three children, plus Liu-Liu, gathered around a table, working frantically.\n\n\"Photos! Printing!\" A-Xin pasted the photos Liu-Liu had taken of the pipe, one by one, onto a big poster, \"Look everyone! This is the pipe!\"\n\n\"Test data!\" Qingqing neatly copied the test results onto the poster, \"pH: 4.5. Heavy metals: six times over the limit!\"\n\n\"Water sample!\" Weixi firmly taped that bottle of grayish-green water to the center of the poster with adhesive tape, \"Let everyone see with their own eyes what color this bottle of 'water' is!\"\n\n\"Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu held a pen in its mouth, writing a crooked title in the poster's corner—\n\n\"[WARNING] The water we drink is being polluted!\"\n\n\"That's ugly handwriting.\" A-Xin teased.\n\n\"Beep beep! You just don't understand art!\" Liu-Liu shot back.\n\n\"Enough, enough!\" Qingqing clapped her hands, \"Check it over! Tomorrow morning, this poster goes on the school bulletin board!\"\n\n\"And,\" Weixi added, \"we need to make many copies. Post it on the bulletin board, post it on the playground, post it at the classroom door—make the whole school see!\"\n\n\"Okay!\" The three children, plus Liu-Liu, nodded hard.\n\nThat night, the smell of poster ink drifted through the equipment room all night long.\n\nThe next day, before dawn, the three children snuck into school.\n\n\"Hurry! Before everyone arrives!\" A-Xin stood on a chair, sticking the first poster in the most prominent spot on the bulletin board.\n\n\"This one goes on the playground!\" Qingqing stuck the second poster beside the playground stage.\n\n\"This one... goes at the school gate!\" Weixi said softly.\n\n\"The school gate?\" A-Xin froze, \"Wouldn't even adults passing by see it?\"\n\n\"That's exactly the point.\" Weixi said, \"Let the adults know that the children discovered what they didn't.\"\n\nOne by one, the posters were put up.\n\nThe three retreated to the other end of the hallway, looking at their \"work\" from a distance.\n\n\"It looks like...\" A-Xin swallowed nervously, \"something big is really going to happen.\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi said softly, \"Something big will happen. But... it's the right kind of big.\"\n\nHowever, fate didn't give them the chance for \"something big.\"\n\nAt 7:30 that morning, when the first student stepped through the school gate—\n\nThe poster on the bulletin board was already gone.\n\n\"Where's the poster?!\" A-Xin rushed to the bulletin board, searching frantically, \"I stuck it right here!\"\n\n\"The one by the stage is gone too!\" Qingqing ran back, face pale, \"The one at the school gate... was also torn down!\"\n\n\"How can this be...\" A-Xin murmured, \"Who tore them down?\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi crouched before the bulletin board, picking up a torn corner of the poster, silent.\n\n\"Weixi?\" Qingqing noticed her change, \"What's wrong?\"\n\n\"This poster,\" Weixi said softly, \"wasn't torn down by a 'student.'\"\n\n\"What do you mean?\"\n\n\"Look here.\" Weixi pointed at the edge of the fragment, \"The tear is very clean. And...\" she lowered her head, \"it was torn down very 'professionally.' As if... they've done it many times.\"\n\n\"'They'?\" A-Xin's heart sank, \"Weixi, do you mean...\"\n\n\"Someone is stopping us.\" Weixi's voice was light as a feather, \"And it's not someone from the school.\"\n\nOn the playground, the morning wind blew past.\n\nThe three children stood before the empty bulletin board, unable to say a word.\n\n\"How can this be...\" A-Xin crouched on the ground, looking at that poster reduced to a torn corner, his voice trembling, \"The posters we stayed up three nights to make... how could they...\"\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Qingqing crouched down and gripped his shoulder, \"let's calm down first.\"\n\n\"I can't calm down!\" A-Xin's eyes were red, \"We did it for the school! For everyone! What right do they have—\"\n\n\"Because,\" Weixi spoke, her voice soft yet carrying a strength, \"we discovered something they don't want anyone else to discover.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" Qingqing looked at her.\n\n\"The poster was torn down,\" Weixi said, \"which means they're panicking. The more they panic, the more it means... we did the right thing.\"\n\n\"Did the right thing...\" A-Xin froze.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"A-Xin, you have to remember: they can tear down posters and bury pipes, but...\" she raised the bottle of water sample that had been kept on her person all along, \"the evidence is with us.\"\n\n\"The water sample...\" A-Xin's eyes slowly lit up again.\n\n\"Yes!\" Qingqing stood up, \"The poster's gone, fine! We have something more important!\"\n\n\"Then what do we do now?\" A-Xin asked.\n\n\"We...\" Weixi looked toward the principal's office, \"hand the evidence to the adults.\"\n\n\"Hand it to who?\" A-Xin asked.\n\n\"To someone,\" Weixi said softly, \"that they can't snatch away.\"\n\nThat morning, two big things happened at school one after another.\n\nFirst: the school announced—\"Due to abnormal water quality test results, the school's drinking fountains are suspended from use, effective immediately. All teachers and students, please bring your own drinking water.\"\n\n\"The fountains are stopped?\" The children buzzed, \"Then what do we drink?\"\n\n\"The school says they'll provide bottled water!\" Old Wu carried a box of mineral water, panting as he ran into the classroom, \"One bottle each! Limited supply!\"\n\n\"Bottled water...\" Lin Yunyun lowered her head, looking at the mineral water bottle in her hand, whispering, \"has something really happened to our school's water?\"\n\nSecond: the health room's statistics were released.\n\n\"This month,\" Qingqing's mother told her over the phone, her tone grave, \"more than fifty children have come to the health room with stomach trouble.\"\n\n\"Fifty?!\" Qingqing gasped.\n\n\"The school has already notified the education bureau.\" Qingqing's mother said, \"I heard the environmental protection bureau people are coming to the school today.\"\n\n\"Environmental protection bureau...\" Qingqing murmured in repetition.\n\nThat morning, in the classroom of Class 6-1, a \"bottled water campaign\" erupted.\n\n\"One per person! Limited! No grabbing!\" Old Wu hugged a box the size of an exercise book, distributing it while panting, \"The school says until the fountains are fixed, everyone drinks this!\"\n\n\"Mineral water...\" Wang Zhuankai took the bottle, looking at it left and right, \"This is the first time I've felt mineral water is so precious.\"\n\n\"I always thought the water from the tap would never stop.\" Lin Yunyun said quietly, \"Now... I suddenly feel that being able to open a tap and drink water is a very happy thing.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"Hey, you guys,\" a boy whispered, \"has something really happened to the school's water?\"\n\n\"It should... just be temporary, right?\" Another girl said, \"Didn't the school say it's just an 'abnormal water quality test'?\"\n\n\"But...\" Old Wu lowered his voice, \"I heard from the kitchen auntie that these past few days, the drainage ditch behind the school is so stinky the kitchen windows can't even be opened.\"\n\n\"That drainage ditch...\" Wang Zhuankai's face changed slightly, \"does it really have something to do with the school's water?\"\n\nNo one in the classroom answered.\n\nAnd at noon, Qingqing's phone wouldn't stop ringing.\n\n\"Qingqing,\" her mother's voice carried urgency, \"so many parents in your class group are asking! What's going on with the school's water? You're not feeling unwell, are you?\"\n\n\"I'm not, Mom.\" Qingqing said.\n\n\"That's good...\" Her mother breathed a sigh of relief, \"By the way, has anyone at your school drunk bad water?\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing paused, \"Mom, do you know the 'Hongyuan Food Processing Factory'?\"\n\n\"Hongyuan?\" Her mother thought for a moment, \"Never heard of it. Why?\"\n\n\"Nothing.\" Qingqing shook her head, \"I was just... asking casually.\"\n\nHanging up, Qingqing looked out the window.\n\nIn the direction behind the school, a nameless smell could be faintly detected.\n\n\"Tomorrow,\" she said in a low voice, \"the environmental protection bureau people are coming. We absolutely have to hand over the evidence.\"\n\n\"Xiaoqing,\" her mother's voice carried worry, \"have you been feeling unwell lately?\"\n\n\"I haven't.\" Qingqing said.\n\n\"That's good.\" Her mother breathed a sigh of relief, \"If you ever feel unwell, you must tell Mom!\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Qingqing nodded.\n\nBut after hanging up, Qingqing's heart couldn't relax at all.\n\n\"The environmental protection bureau people are coming...\" she said in a low voice, \"but where's the evidence?\"\n\n\"The evidence is buried.\" Liu-Liu's voice came from her backpack, unusually heavy, \"I flew to the industrial zone again this morning... that pipe has been completely buried.\"\n\n\"Buried?!\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Liu-Liu nodded, \"Even the traces of the pipe are gone. And at the river mouth... the discolored area of the seawater has expanded again. They buried the pipe, but the pollution is still going on.\"\n\n\"No evidence, but the pollution continues...\" Qingqing's heart sank to the bottom.\n\n\"Class President,\" Liu-Liu asked in a low voice, \"what do we... do?\"\n\nQingqing fell silent.\n\n\"...We still have evidence.\" After a long moment, she said.\n\n\"What evidence?\"\n\n\"We have photos. We have the water sample. We have the test data.\" Qingqing's voice grew more and more resolute, \"We got the evidence in hand before they 'destroyed' it!\"\n\n\"But...\" Liu-Liu said in a low voice, \"that evidence is only in the equipment room. If we take it out... will it be...\"\n\n\"So,\" a light flickered in Qingqing's eyes, \"we hand the evidence to someone 'they can't snatch away.'\"\n\n\"Who?\"\n\n\"Someone,\" Qingqing said in a low voice, \"even the principal respects.\"\n\nThat afternoon, in the principal's office.\n\n\"You say you have evidence?\" Principal Qiu looked at the three children before him, his expression complex.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin pulled out a thick stack of materials from his backpack, \"Photos of the pipe! The water sample! The test data! It's all here!\"\n\n\"Principal,\" Qingqing's voice trembled slightly, yet it was exceptionally resolute, \"we know that we obtained this evidence secretly. We also know we shouldn't have investigated on our own.\"\n\n\"But,\" she looked up, tears glistening in her eyes, \"if we hadn't investigated... who would have discovered that the water we drink is being polluted?\"\n\nThe principal's office fell silent.\n\nThe three children stood before the principal, their hearts pounding.\n\n\"Principal,\" A-Xin couldn't help speaking, \"we know what we did might be wrong. But...\"\n\n\"But what?\" Principal Qiu asked.\n\n\"But,\" A-Xin took a deep breath, \"we're the 'Protect Earth Operations Unit.' We swore to protect the Earth, protect the school, protect the water we drink. So...\"\n\n\"So you snuck into the industrial zone?\" Principal Qiu's tone was unreadable.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin puffed out his chest, \"Even if we get punished, we had to do it!\"\n\n\"...\" Principal Qiu looked at him for a very, very long time.\n\n\"A-Xin,\" he finally spoke, his tone carrying a complex emotion, \"do you know how many children have told me in my thirty years as principal, 'even if I get punished, I had to do it'?\"\n\n\"I don't know...\" A-Xin said quietly.\n\n\"Not many.\" Principal Qiu said, \"Most children say, 'don't tell the teacher.' Children who say 'even if I get punished, I had to do it'...\" he paused, \"in these thirty years, I've only heard it from the three of you.\"\n\n\"Principal...\" The three children froze.\n\n\"Have a seat.\" Principal Qiu sighed, \"Show me your evidence.\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The three children hurriedly handed over the materials.\n\nPrincipal Qiu picked up the stack of materials and flipped through them, page by page.\n\nPhotos of the pipe. The grayish-green water sample. The test result of pH 4.5. The data of heavy metals at six times the limit.\n\n\"...This bottle of water,\" Principal Qiu put down the materials, his voice hoarse, \"was really taken from the drainage ditch behind our school?\"\n\n\"Yes.\" Weixi nodded, \"And that pipe connects to the 'Hongyuan Food Processing Factory' in the industrial zone.\"\n\n\"Hongyuan Food Processing Factory...\" Principal Qiu murmured in repetition.\n\n\"Principal,\" Dean Zhou suddenly spoke, his voice low, \"let me handle this.\"\n\n\"Old Zhou...\" Principal Qiu looked at him.\n\n\"The children's evidence is real.\" Dean Zhou said, \"I walked the length of the drainage ditch and saw that pipe with my own eyes. Now, they've buried it. But...\" he picked up that bottle of grayish-green water sample, \"this bottle of water can't be buried.\"\n\n\"What do you plan to do?\" Principal Qiu asked.\n\n\"The environmental protection bureau people are coming tomorrow.\" Dean Zhou said, \"I'll hand the evidence to them personally. And...\" a sharp light flickered in his eyes, \"I'll take this bottle of water with me.\"\n\n\"Dean...\" The three children stared at him blankly.\n\n\"You did very well.\" Dean Zhou looked at them, a gentleness never seen before in his tone, \"Leave the rest to the adults.\"\n\n\"But, Dean!\" A-Xin was anxious, \"What if the factory people...\"\n\n\"They won't.\" Dean Zhou said, \"They can tear down posters and bury pipes. But...\" he picked up the water sample and gave it a slight shake under the light, \"they can't make this bottle of water disappear.\"\n\nThe next day, the environmental protection bureau's inspectors arrived at Luyang Elementary on schedule.\n\n\"This is the water sample from the drainage ditch behind our school.\" Dean Zhou handed that bottle of grayish-green water to the inspector, \"pH 4.5. Heavy metals at six times the limit. The test data is all here.\"\n\n\"And these photos.\" A-Xin added, \"They're photos of the pipe! Even though the pipe has been buried, the photos are still here!\"\n\nThe inspectors examined every photo and every piece of data carefully.\n\n\"We waited a whole month,\" A-Xin clenched his fists nervously, \"and finally today has come...\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Qingqing nodded, her voice trembling too, \"Photos, water sample, data... all handed over.\"\n\n\"Now,\" Weixi said in a low voice, \"all we can do is wait.\"\n\n\"Wait...\" A-Xin murmured in repetition, \"waiting is really agonizing.\"\n\n\"But,\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"at least we've done everything we should.\"\n\n\"You children...\" the inspector looked at the three children before him, admiration in his tone, \"are truly remarkable. Most kids, when they encounter something like this, would probably just hide at home and cry.\"\n\n\"We can't cry,\" A-Xin said, \"because we're the 'Protect Earth Operations Unit'!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The inspector laughed, \"Fine! 'Protect Earth Operations Unit'! I'll remember you!\"\n\n\"...These materials, we'll take back and send to the lab for re-testing.\" The inspector said, \"If confirmed, we'll immediately investigate and deal with it.\"\n\n\"Deal with it?\" A-Xin asked nervously, \"How?\"\n\n\"We'll seal off the industrial zone and thoroughly investigate the source of every pipe.\" The inspector said, \"If it really is 'Hongyuan Food Processing Factory'... they'll face suspension, fines, and criminal liability.\"\n\n\"Suspension!\" A-Xin's eyes lit up instantly.\n\n\"But,\" the inspector's tone shifted, \"re-testing takes time. Until the results come out, the factory won't receive any punishment.\"\n\n\"It still takes time...\" Qingqing murmured in repetition, \"how long?\"\n\n\"At the fastest, one week.\"\n\n\"One week...\" Weixi lowered her head, looking at the bracelet on her wrist.\n\nThe countdown number flickered quietly in the daylight.\n\n—Nineteen.\n\nThe days that followed were the hardest week Class 6-1 had ever endured.\n\nEvery morning at dawn, Liu-Liu flew to the river mouth to record the color of the seawater.\n\n\"Day one: the discolored area of the seawater hasn't expanded. But...\"\n\n\"Day two: at the factory, the smokestacks are running normally. No movement at the pipe's location.\"\n\n\"Day three: a new group of dead fish appeared at the river mouth.\"\n\n\"Day four: the seawater color is deepening.\"\n\n\"Day five:...\" Liu-Liu's voice grew heavier and heavier, \"today, I saw an environmental protection bureau inspection vehicle at the factory gate.\"\n\n\"An inspection vehicle?!\" A-Xin's eyes lit up, \"Is the re-test result out?!\"\n\n\"I don't know.\" Liu-Liu shook its head, \"I only saw the inspectors get out of the car, and then... the factory gate closed.\"\n\n\"Closed?\" Qingqing froze.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Liu-Liu nodded, \"And starting that day, the factory's smokestacks... haven't puffed any more smoke.\"\n\n\"Haven't puffed any more smoke...\" Weixi repeated softly, and then, her eyes suddenly turned red.\n\n\"Weixi?\" A-Xin and Qingqing looked at her at the same time.\n\n\"Haven't puffed any more smoke...\" Weixi's voice trembled slightly, \"in the textbooks of our era, it's written... 'Hongyuan Food Processing Factory was ordered to suspend operations for secretly discharging wastewater. From that day on, its smokestacks never puffed smoke again.'\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin and Qingqing froze.\n\n\"The textbook says,\" Weixi's tears fell drop by drop, \"'this was the miracle accomplished by the most remarkable group of children of that era.'\"\n\n\"A miracle...\" Qingqing murmured in repetition.\n\n\"Qingqing, A-Xin,\" Weixi looked up at them, her eyes blurred with tears, \"we... did it.\"\n\n\"We,\" A-Xin's voice was trembling too, \"rewrote the textbook?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded hard, \"We rewrote the textbook.\"\n\nThat day, the three children cried together in the equipment room.\n\n\"One week,\" Weixi said softly, \"is enough.\"\n\n\"Enough?\" A-Xin froze, \"Weixi, you...\"\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"one week is enough for the adults to find out the truth. And one week...\" she lowered her head, her voice soft, \"is also enough for me to say goodbye to everyone properly.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" A-Xin and Qingqing froze at the same time.\n\n\"I've calculated,\" Weixi said, \"my bracelet now has nineteen days left. But... it's moving faster and faster. At this rate...\"\n\n\"At this rate, what will happen?\" A-Xin asked nervously.\n\n\"At this rate,\" Weixi said softly, \"in about another week, I'll have to go back.\"\n\n\"Another week?!\" A-Xin almost shouted, \"But didn't you say there were nineteen days left?!\"\n\n\"That's at 'current' speed.\" Weixi said, \"Every time I 'see the future,' the bracelet's energy drains faster. These past few days...\"\n\nShe lowered her head and looked at the bracelet.\n\n\"It's already down to nineteen days.\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing's voice trembled slightly, \"tell me honestly... how much longer can you hold on?\"\n\nWeixi fell silent.\n\n\"...I don't know.\" She finally said, \"But I'll try to hold on until that day.\"\n\n\"Until which day?\"\n\n\"Until...\" Weixi looked up, gazing at the sea outside the window, \"until the day that drainage ditch becomes clear again. Until...\" she smiled softly, \"until the day everyone learns to protect the Earth.\"\n\nActually, these past few days, Weixi's \"flashbacks\" had become so severe that even Qingqing could barely hide it.\n\nDuring class, she would suddenly stare at the blackboard without moving.\n\nAt nap time, she would suddenly stand up, walk to the window, and say \"I'm sorry\" to the view outside.\n\n\"Weixi,\" one day after school, Qingqing finally couldn't help asking, \"have you been... seeing more of the 'future' lately?\"\n\nWeixi was silent for a moment, then nodded: \"Mhm. And... it's getting clearer and clearer.\"\n\n\"Clearer?\"\n\n\"In the past, the future I saw was blurry.\" Weixi said, \"But now... I see Grandma, the ration station, the grayish-yellow sky... all as if they're really happening before my eyes.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Qingqing asked nervously, \"does it hurt?\"\n\n\"It doesn't hurt.\" Weixi shook her head, \"But... it gets hard to tell them apart.\"\n\n\"Hard to tell apart?\"\n\n\"Hard to tell apart...\" Weixi lowered her head, her voice soft, \"which is the future, and which is the present.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" Qingqing took her hand, \"listen to me. No matter what happens—you're here right now. At Luyang Elementary. By our side.\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded softly, \"I know. But...\" she looked at her bracelet, \"I'm worried that one day, I won't be able to 'come back' to the present.\"\n\n\"You will!\" Qingqing said loudly, \"We'll wake you up! Just like last time!\"\n\n\"...\" Looking at Qingqing's resolute face, Weixi's eyes suddenly felt a little hot.\n\n\"Mhm.\" She lowered her head, softly, \"Thank you, Qingqing.\"\n\nThat night, Weixi sat alone on the seawall, looking at that murky gray sea.\n\nThe number on the bracelet dropped, digit by digit, in the moonlight.\n\n\"Twenty, nineteen, eighteen...\" Weixi counted softly, \"seventeen...\"\n\nShe gently pressed the bracelet against her chest.\n\n\"Grandma,\" she said softly to the night sky, \"give me a little more time. Let me see the rest...\" she closed her eyes, \"let me see the children save this sea.\"\n\nThe sea wind blew across her cheeks.\n\nThe number on the bracelet flickered quietly in the moonlight, stopping at—fifteen.\n\n\"Fifteen days...\" Weixi smiled softly, \"just right.\"\n\n(To be continued)"}];
